export const aquariumWaterMixingTranslationsByLocale = Object.freeze({"am":{"Aquarium Water Mixing Calculator":"Aquarium የውሃ ማደባለቅ ካልኩሌተር","Aquarium Water Mixing Calculator — Free GH & KH Planner":"Aquarium የውሃ ማደባለቅ ካልኩሌተር - ነፃ GH እና KH ዕቅድ አውጪ","Mix two water sources by measured GH and KH. Convert German, French, ppm and meq/L hardness units, check if both targets are compatible, and calculate litres locally.":"ሁለት የውሃ ምንጮችን በሚለካ GH እና KH ቀላቅሉባት። ጀርመንኛ፣ ፈረንሳይኛ፣ ፒፒኤም እና meq/L ጠንካራነት ክፍሎችን ቀይር፣ ሁለቱም ኢላማዎች ተኳሃኝ መሆናቸውን ያረጋግጡ እና ሊትሮችን በአገር ውስጥ አስላ።","Plan an aquarium water blend from two measured sources. The calculator solves general hardness (GH) and carbonate hardness (KH) together, rather than assuming reverse-osmosis water is exactly zero.":"ከሁለት ከሚለኩ ምንጮች የ aquarium ውሃ ቅልቅል ያቅዱ። የሂሳብ ማሽን አጠቃላይ ጥንካሬን (GH) እና ካርቦኔትን ጠንካራነት (KH) በአንድ ላይ ይፈታል፣ ይልቁንም የተገላቢጦሽ ኦስሞሲስ ውሃ በትክክል ዜሮ ነው ብሎ ከመገመት ይልቅ።","Example: mix tap water at GH 10 / KH 5 with RO water at GH 0 / KH 0. A 50% blend produces about GH 5 / KH 2.5; a different pair of targets may require incompatible blend ratios.":"ምሳሌ: የቧንቧ ውሃ በ GH 10 / KH 5 ከ RO ውሃ ጋር በ GH 0 / KH 0. የ 50% ቅልቅል ወደ GH 5 / KH 2.5 ያመርታል; የተለያዩ ጥንድ ኢላማዎች የማይጣጣሙ ድብልቅ ሬሾዎችን ሊፈልጉ ይችላሉ።","Each hardness value is converted to German degrees for calculation. GH and KH are treated as linearly mixable measured concentrations; the tool checks both independently and only gives a water recipe when the two results agree within 0.05 °dH.":"እያንዳንዱ የጠንካራነት እሴት ለስሌት ወደ ጀርመን ዲግሪ ይቀየራል። GH እና KH በመስመራዊ የተደባለቁ የመለኪያ ስብስቦች ይወሰዳሉ; መሣሪያው ሁለቱንም በተናጥል ይፈትሻል እና ሁለቱ ውጤቶች በ 0.05 °dH ውስጥ ሲስማሙ የውሃ አዘገጃጀት ብቻ ይሰጣል።","This is a mixing estimate, not a pH or species-care recommendation. It does not model remineralization, buffers, acids, substrate effects, evaporation or measurement error. Test your water and follow reliable aquarium-care guidance.":"ይህ ድብልቅ ግምት ነው እንጂ የፒኤች ወይም የዝርያ እንክብካቤ ምክር አይደለም። ሪሚኔራላይዜሽን፣ ቋጠሮዎች፣ አሲዶች፣ የከርሰ ምድር ውጤቶች፣ የትነት ወይም የመለኪያ ስህተትን ሞዴል አያደርግም። ውሃዎን ይሞክሩ እና አስተማማኝ የ aquarium-እንክብካቤ መመሪያን ይከተሉ።","Mixing example":"ማደባለቅ ምሳሌ","How GH/KH mixing works":"GH/KH ማደባለቅ እንዴት እንደሚሰራ","Aquarium water mixing questions":"የአኳሪየም ውሃ መቀላቀል ጥያቄዎች","Assumptions and limits":"ግምቶች እና ገደቦች","What do GH and KH mean?":"GH እና KH ማለት ምን ማለት ነው?","GH is general hardness, mainly dissolved calcium and magnesium. KH is carbonate hardness/alkalinity as reported by your test. They are separate measurements and are not interchangeable.":"GH አጠቃላይ ጥንካሬ ነው፣በዋነኛነት የሚሟሟት ካልሺየም እና ማግኒዚየም። በፈተናዎ እንደተዘገበው KH የካርቦኔት ጠንካራነት/አልካሊንነት ነው። የተለዩ መለኪያዎች ናቸው እና አይለዋወጡም.","Does reverse-osmosis water always have zero hardness?":"Reverse-osmosis ውሃ ሁልጊዜ ዜሮ ጥንካሬ የለውም?","No. Enter the GH and KH you actually measured for both sources. The calculator does not silently assume either source is pure water.":"ቁ. ለሁለቱም ምንጮች በትክክል የለካከውን GH እና KH አስገባ። ካልኩሌተሩ የትኛውም ምንጭ ንጹህ ውሃ ነው ብሎ በዝምታ አያስብም።","Why can my GH and KH targets be incompatible?":"ለምንድነው የኔ GH እና KH ኢላማዎች የማይጣጣሙት?","One blend percentage must satisfy both values. If GH requires a different source ratio from KH, two-source mixing alone cannot reach both targets; the tool reports that instead of making up a recipe.":"አንድ ድብልቅ መቶኛ ሁለቱንም እሴቶች ማሟላት አለበት። GH ከ KH የተለየ ምንጭ ሬሾን የሚፈልግ ከሆነ፣ የሁለት-ምንጭ መቀላቀል ብቻ ሁለቱንም ዒላማዎች ላይ መድረስ አይችልም። መሣሪያው የምግብ አዘገጃጀት መመሪያ ከማዘጋጀት ይልቅ ሪፖርት ያደርጋል.","Which units can I convert?":"የትኞቹን ክፍሎች መለወጥ እችላለሁ?","German degrees (°dH), French degrees (°fH), mg/L as CaCO3 (ppm), and milliequivalents per litre (meq/L). The selected unit applies to every hardness input and result.":"የጀርመን ዲግሪዎች (°dH)፣ የፈረንሳይ ዲግሪዎች (°fH)፣ mg/L እንደ CaCO3 (ppm)፣ እና ሚሊሚክሎች በሊትር (meq/L)። የተመረጠው አሃድ በእያንዳንዱ ጠንካራነት ግቤት እና ውጤት ላይ ተፈጻሚ ይሆናል።","Is this a pH calculator or a fish-care recommendation?":"ይህ ፒኤች ካልኩሌተር ነው ወይስ የአሳ እንክብካቤ ምክር?","No. pH does not mix linearly, and suitable aquarium water depends on species and other chemistry. This tool only estimates GH/KH blend proportions from supplied measurements.":"ቁ. ፒኤች በመስመር ላይ አይቀላቅልም, እና ተስማሚ የ aquarium ውሃ እንደ ዝርያ እና ሌሎች ኬሚስትሪ ይወሰናል. ይህ መሳሪያ የGH/KH ድብልቅ ምጣኔን የሚገመተው ከሚቀርቡት ልኬቶች ብቻ ነው።","Water source A":"የውሃ ምንጭ ሀ","Water source B":"የውሃ ምንጭ ቢ","Source A label":"ምንጭ A መለያ","Source B label":"ምንጭ ቢ መለያ","Enter measured GH and KH for each source. For example, source A can be tap water and source B reverse-osmosis water.":"ለእያንዳንዱ ምንጭ የሚለካ GH እና KH አስገባ። ለምሳሌ, ምንጭ A የቧንቧ ውሃ እና ምንጭ B reverse-osmosis ውሃ ሊሆን ይችላል.","Hardness unit":"የጠንካራነት ክፍል","German degrees (°dH)":"የጀርመን ዲግሪ (°dH)","French degrees (°fH)":"የፈረንሳይ ዲግሪ (°fH)","mg/L as CaCO3 (ppm)":"mg/L እንደ CaCO3 (ppm)","Milliequivalents per litre (meq/L)":"ሚሊዮኖች በሊትር (meq/L)","General hardness (GH)":"አጠቃላይ ጠንካራነት (GH)","Carbonate hardness (KH)":"የካርቦኔት ጠንካራነት (KH)","Target water":"የታቀደ ውሃ","Final batch volume (litres)":"የመጨረሻ ባች መጠን (ሊትር)","Calculate blend":"ቅልቅል አስላ","Clear values":"ዋጋዎችን አጽዳ","Enter both water sources and your target GH/KH.":"ሁለቱንም የውሃ ምንጮች እና ኢላማችሁን GH/KH አስገባ።","Both target values can be reached with one blend ratio.":"ሁለቱም የዒላማ እሴቶች በአንድ ድብልቅ ጥምርታ ሊደርሱ ይችላሉ።","GH and KH require different blend ratios; these two sources cannot reach both targets together.":"GH እና KH የተለያዩ ድብልቅ ጥምርታ ያስፈልጋቸዋል; እነዚህ ሁለት ምንጮች ሁለቱንም ኢላማዎች አንድ ላይ መድረስ አይችሉም.","At least one target is outside the range between the two source waters.":"ቢያንስ አንድ ኢላማ በሁለቱ የምንጭ ውሃዎች መካከል ካለው ክልል ውጭ ነው።","Source A volume":"ምንጭ ሀ ጥራዝ","Source B volume":"ምንጭ ቢ መጠን","Source A share":"ምንጭ አንድ ድርሻ","Predicted blend":"የተገመተ ድብልቅ","Predicted GH":"የተገመተ GH","Predicted KH":"የተገመተው ኬ","Source A share required by GH":"ምንጭ በ GH የሚፈለግ ድርሻ","Source A share required by KH":"ምንጭ በKH የሚፈለግ ድርሻ","Comparison tolerance":"የማነፃፀር መቻቻል","Unit conversion: 1 °dH = 17.848 mg/L CaCO3; 1 °fH = 10 mg/L CaCO3; 1 meq/L = 50 mg/L CaCO3.":"የአሃድ ልወጣ፡ 1 °dH = 17.848 mg/L CaCO3; 1 °fH = 10 mg/L CaCO3; 1 meq/L = 50 mg/L CaCO3.","All calculations run locally in this browser; no water measurements are uploaded.":"ሁሉም ስሌቶች በዚህ አሳሽ ውስጥ በአካባቢው ይሰራሉ; ምንም የውሃ መለኪያዎች አልተሰቀሉም።","Check the values: hardness must be 0–10,000 and final volume 0–100,000 litres.":"እሴቶቹን ይፈትሹ፡ ጥንካሬው 0–10,000 እና የመጨረሻው መጠን 0–100,000 ሊትር መሆን አለበት።","Unit conversion factors":"የአሃድ ልወጣ ምክንያቶች","mg/L as CaCO3":"mg/L እንደ CaCO3","meq/L":"meq/L","A compatible result is an estimate within 0.05 °dH; real test kits and water chemistry have measurement variation.":"ተኳሃኝ ውጤት በ 0.05 °dH ውስጥ ግምት ነው; እውነተኛ የሙከራ ኪት እና የውሃ ኬሚስትሪ የመለኪያ ልዩነት አላቸው።"},"ar":{"Aquarium Water Mixing Calculator":"آلة حاسبة لخلط مياه حوض السمك","Aquarium Water Mixing Calculator — Free GH & KH Planner":"آلة حاسبة لخلط مياه حوض السمك — مخطط GH & KH مجاني","Mix two water sources by measured GH and KH. Convert German, French, ppm and meq/L hardness units, check if both targets are compatible, and calculate litres locally.":"اخلط مصدرين للمياه عن طريق قياس GH وKH. قم بتحويل وحدات الصلابة الألمانية والفرنسية وجزء في المليون وmeq/L، وتحقق مما إذا كان كلا الهدفين متوافقين، وقم بحساب اللترات محليًا.","Plan an aquarium water blend from two measured sources. The calculator solves general hardness (GH) and carbonate hardness (KH) together, rather than assuming reverse-osmosis water is exactly zero.":"قم بتخطيط مزيج مياه حوض السمك من مصدرين تم قياسهما. تقوم الآلة الحاسبة بحل العسر العام (GH) وعسر الكربونات (KH) معًا، بدلًا من افتراض أن الماء بالتناضح العكسي يساوي صفرًا تمامًا.","Example: mix tap water at GH 10 / KH 5 with RO water at GH 0 / KH 0. A 50% blend produces about GH 5 / KH 2.5; a different pair of targets may require incompatible blend ratios.":"مثال: امزج ماء الصنبور عند GH 10 / KH 5 مع ماء RO عند GH 0 / KH 0. ينتج مزيج 50% حوالي GH 5 / KH 2.5؛ قد يتطلب زوج مختلف من الأهداف نسب مزج غير متوافقة.","Each hardness value is converted to German degrees for calculation. GH and KH are treated as linearly mixable measured concentrations; the tool checks both independently and only gives a water recipe when the two results agree within 0.05 °dH.":"يتم تحويل كل قيمة صلابة إلى درجات ألمانية للحساب. يتم التعامل مع GH وKH كتركيزات مقاسة قابلة للخلط خطيًا؛ تتحقق الأداة من كليهما بشكل مستقل وتعطي وصفة الماء فقط عندما تتفق النتيجتان ضمن 0.05 °dH.","This is a mixing estimate, not a pH or species-care recommendation. It does not model remineralization, buffers, acids, substrate effects, evaporation or measurement error. Test your water and follow reliable aquarium-care guidance.":"هذا تقدير مختلط، وليس توصية لدرجة الحموضة أو رعاية الأنواع. وهي لا تمثل إعادة التمعدن أو المحاليل المؤقتة أو الأحماض أو تأثيرات الركيزة أو التبخر أو خطأ القياس. اختبر المياه واتبع إرشادات موثوقة للعناية بأحواض السمك.","Mixing example":"مثال للخلط","How GH/KH mixing works":"كيف يعمل خلط GH/KH","Aquarium water mixing questions":"أسئلة خلط مياه حوض السمك","Assumptions and limits":"الافتراضات والحدود","What do GH and KH mean?":"ماذا يعني GH وKH؟","GH is general hardness, mainly dissolved calcium and magnesium. KH is carbonate hardness/alkalinity as reported by your test. They are separate measurements and are not interchangeable.":"GH عبارة عن صلابة عامة، وتتكون أساسًا من الكالسيوم والمغنيسيوم المذاب. KH هو صلابة/قلوية الكربونات كما ورد في الاختبار. فهي قياسات منفصلة وغير قابلة للتبديل.","Does reverse-osmosis water always have zero hardness?":"هل يكون الماء بالتناضح العكسي دائمًا خاليًا من الصلابة؟","No. Enter the GH and KH you actually measured for both sources. The calculator does not silently assume either source is pure water.":"رقم. أدخل هرمون النمو وKH الذي قمت بقياسه بالفعل لكلا المصدرين. لا تفترض الآلة الحاسبة بصمت أن أيًا من المصدرين هو ماء نقي.","Why can my GH and KH targets be incompatible?":"لماذا يمكن أن تكون أهدافي GH وKH غير متوافقة؟","One blend percentage must satisfy both values. If GH requires a different source ratio from KH, two-source mixing alone cannot reach both targets; the tool reports that instead of making up a recipe.":"يجب أن تلبي نسبة المزج الواحدة كلتا القيمتين. إذا كان GH يتطلب نسبة مصدر مختلفة عن KH، فإن الخلط بين المصدرين وحده لا يمكن أن يصل إلى كلا الهدفين؛ تشير الأداة إلى أنه بدلاً من تكوين وصفة.","Which units can I convert?":"ما هي الوحدات التي يمكنني تحويلها؟","German degrees (°dH), French degrees (°fH), mg/L as CaCO3 (ppm), and milliequivalents per litre (meq/L). The selected unit applies to every hardness input and result.":"الدرجات الألمانية (°dH)، والدرجات الفرنسية (°fH)، ملغم/لتر مثل CaCO3 (جزء في المليون)، والميلي مكافئ لكل لتر (meq/L). تنطبق الوحدة المحددة على كل مدخلات ونتائج الصلابة.","Is this a pH calculator or a fish-care recommendation?":"هل هذه حاسبة للأس الهيدروجيني أم توصية للعناية بالأسماك؟","No. pH does not mix linearly, and suitable aquarium water depends on species and other chemistry. This tool only estimates GH/KH blend proportions from supplied measurements.":"رقم. لا يختلط الرقم الهيدروجيني خطيًا، وتعتمد مياه الحوض المناسبة على الأنواع والكيمياء الأخرى. تقوم هذه الأداة بتقدير نسب مزيج GH/KH فقط من القياسات المتوفرة.","Water source A":"مصدر المياه أ","Water source B":"مصدر المياه ب","Source A label":"المصدر أ","Source B label":"تصنيف المصدر B","Enter measured GH and KH for each source. For example, source A can be tap water and source B reverse-osmosis water.":"أدخل قياسات GH وKH لكل مصدر. على سبيل المثال، المصدر أ يمكن أن يكون ماء الصنبور والمصدر ب ماء التناضح العكسي.","Hardness unit":"وحدة الصلابة","German degrees (°dH)":"الدرجات الألمانية (°dH)","French degrees (°fH)":"الدرجات الفرنسية (°fH)","mg/L as CaCO3 (ppm)":"مجم/لتر في صورة CaCO3 (جزء في المليون)","Milliequivalents per litre (meq/L)":"ملي مكافئ لكل لتر (meq/L)","General hardness (GH)":"الصلابة العامة (GH)","Carbonate hardness (KH)":"صلابة الكربونات (KH)","Target water":"المياه المستهدفة","Final batch volume (litres)":"حجم الدفعة النهائية (لتر)","Calculate blend":"حساب المزيج","Clear values":"مسح القيم","Enter both water sources and your target GH/KH.":"أدخل مصدري المياه وهدفك GH/KH.","Both target values can be reached with one blend ratio.":"يمكن الوصول إلى كلا القيمتين المستهدفتين بنسبة مزج واحدة.\nيتطلب","GH and KH require different blend ratios; these two sources cannot reach both targets together.":"GH وKH نسب مزج مختلفة؛ ولا يمكن لهذين المصدرين الوصول إلى كلا الهدفين معًا.","At least one target is outside the range between the two source waters.":"يوجد هدف واحد على الأقل خارج النطاق بين مصدري المياه.","Source A volume":"المصدر أ","Source B volume":"حجم المصدر B","Source A share":"المصدر أ","Predicted blend":"المزيج المتوقع","Predicted GH":"GH المتوقع","Predicted KH":"KH المتوقع","Source A share required by GH":"المصدر A مشاركة مطلوبة بواسطة GH","Source A share required by KH":"المصدر مشاركة مطلوبة بواسطة KH","Comparison tolerance":"تسامح المقارنة","Unit conversion: 1 °dH = 17.848 mg/L CaCO3; 1 °fH = 10 mg/L CaCO3; 1 meq/L = 50 mg/L CaCO3.":"تحويل الوحدة: 1 °dH = 17.848 mg/L CaCO3; 1 °fH = 10 ملجم/لتر CaCO3; 1 meq/L = 50 ملجم/لتر CaCO3.","All calculations run locally in this browser; no water measurements are uploaded.":"يتم تشغيل جميع الحسابات محليًا في هذا المتصفح؛ لا يتم تحميل قياسات المياه.","Check the values: hardness must be 0–10,000 and final volume 0–100,000 litres.":"تحقق من القيم: يجب أن تكون الصلابة 0–10,000 والحجم النهائي 0–100,000 لترًا.","Unit conversion factors":"عوامل تحويل الوحدة","mg/L as CaCO3":"مجم/لتر مثل CaCO3","meq/L":"meq/L","A compatible result is an estimate within 0.05 °dH; real test kits and water chemistry have measurement variation.":"النتيجة المتوافقة هي تقدير ضمن 0.05 °dH؛ مجموعات الاختبار الحقيقية وكيمياء المياه لها اختلاف في القياس."},"bg":{"Aquarium Water Mixing Calculator":"Калкулатор за смесване на аквариумна вода","Aquarium Water Mixing Calculator — Free GH & KH Planner":"Калкулатор за смесване на водата в аквариума — Безплатен план за GH и KH","Mix two water sources by measured GH and KH. Convert German, French, ppm and meq/L hardness units, check if both targets are compatible, and calculate litres locally.":"Смесете два източника на вода чрез измерени GH и KH. Преобразувайте немски, френски, ppm и meq/L единици за твърдост, проверете дали и двете цели са съвместими и изчислете литри локално.","Plan an aquarium water blend from two measured sources. The calculator solves general hardness (GH) and carbonate hardness (KH) together, rather than assuming reverse-osmosis water is exactly zero.":"Планирайте смес от аквариумна вода от два измерени източника. Калкулаторът решава общата твърдост (GH) и карбонатната твърдост (KH) заедно, вместо да приема, че водата с обратна осмоза е точно нула.","Example: mix tap water at GH 10 / KH 5 with RO water at GH 0 / KH 0. A 50% blend produces about GH 5 / KH 2.5; a different pair of targets may require incompatible blend ratios.":"Пример: смесете чешмяна вода при GH 10 / KH 5 с RO вода при GH 0 / KH 0. 50% смес произвежда около GH 5 / KH 2.5; различна двойка цели може да изисква несъвместими съотношения на смесване.","Each hardness value is converted to German degrees for calculation. GH and KH are treated as linearly mixable measured concentrations; the tool checks both independently and only gives a water recipe when the two results agree within 0.05 °dH.":"Всяка стойност на твърдост се преобразува в немски градуси за изчисление. GH и KH се третират като линейно смесими измерени концентрации; инструментът проверява и двете независимо и дава рецепта за вода само когато двата резултата съвпадат в 0.05 °dH.","This is a mixing estimate, not a pH or species-care recommendation. It does not model remineralization, buffers, acids, substrate effects, evaporation or measurement error. Test your water and follow reliable aquarium-care guidance.":"Това е оценка за смесване, а не pH или препоръка за грижа за вида. Той не моделира реминерализация, буфери, киселини, субстратни ефекти, изпарение или грешка при измерване. Тествайте водата си и следвайте надеждни указания за грижа за аквариума.","Mixing example":"Пример за смесване","How GH/KH mixing works":"Как работи смесването на GH/KH","Aquarium water mixing questions":"Въпроси за смесване на аквариумна вода","Assumptions and limits":"Допускания и ограничения","What do GH and KH mean?":"Какво означават GH и KH?","GH is general hardness, mainly dissolved calcium and magnesium. KH is carbonate hardness/alkalinity as reported by your test. They are separate measurements and are not interchangeable.":"GH е обща твърдост, основно разтворен калций и магнезий. KH е карбонатна твърдост/алкалност, отчетена от вашия тест. Те са отделни измервания и не са взаимозаменяеми.","Does reverse-osmosis water always have zero hardness?":"Водата с обратна осмоза винаги ли има нулева твърдост?","No. Enter the GH and KH you actually measured for both sources. The calculator does not silently assume either source is pure water.":"Бр. Въведете GH и KH, които действително сте измерили и за двата източника. Калкулаторът не приема мълчаливо, че нито един от източниците е чиста вода.","Why can my GH and KH targets be incompatible?":"Защо моите цели за GH и KH могат да бъдат несъвместими?","One blend percentage must satisfy both values. If GH requires a different source ratio from KH, two-source mixing alone cannot reach both targets; the tool reports that instead of making up a recipe.":"Един процент на смесване трябва да отговаря и на двете стойности. Ако GH изисква различно съотношение на източника от KH, самото смесване от два източника не може да достигне и двете цели; инструментът съобщава, че вместо да състави рецепта.","Which units can I convert?":"Кои единици мога да конвертирам?","German degrees (°dH), French degrees (°fH), mg/L as CaCO3 (ppm), and milliequivalents per litre (meq/L). The selected unit applies to every hardness input and result.":"Немски градуси (°dH), френски градуси (°fH), mg/L като CaCO3 (ppm) и милиеквиваленти на литър (meq/L). Избраната единица се прилага за всеки вход и резултат за твърдост.","Is this a pH calculator or a fish-care recommendation?":"Това pH калкулатор ли е или препоръка за грижа за рибките?","No. pH does not mix linearly, and suitable aquarium water depends on species and other chemistry. This tool only estimates GH/KH blend proportions from supplied measurements.":"Бр. pH не се смесва линейно и подходящата аквариумна вода зависи от вида и други химикали. Този инструмент оценява само пропорциите на сместа GH/KH от предоставените измервания.","Water source A":"Водоизточник А","Water source B":"Водоизточник B","Source A label":"Етикет на източник A","Source B label":"Етикет на източник B","Enter measured GH and KH for each source. For example, source A can be tap water and source B reverse-osmosis water.":"Въведете измерените GH и KH за всеки източник. Например източник А може да бъде чешмяна вода, а източник Б вода с обратна осмоза.","Hardness unit":"Единица за твърдост","German degrees (°dH)":"Немски градуси (°dH)","French degrees (°fH)":"Френски градуси (°fH)","mg/L as CaCO3 (ppm)":"mg/L като CaCO3 (ppm)","Milliequivalents per litre (meq/L)":"Милиеквиваленти на литър (meq/L)","General hardness (GH)":"Обща твърдост (GH)","Carbonate hardness (KH)":"Карбонатна твърдост (KH)","Target water":"Целева вода","Final batch volume (litres)":"Краен обем на партидата (литри)","Calculate blend":"Изчислете сместа","Clear values":"Изчистване на стойностите","Enter both water sources and your target GH/KH.":"Въведете двата източника на вода и вашата целева GH/KH.","Both target values can be reached with one blend ratio.":"И двете целеви стойности могат да бъдат достигнати с едно съотношение на смесване.","GH and KH require different blend ratios; these two sources cannot reach both targets together.":"GH и KH изискват различни съотношения на смесване; тези два източника не могат да достигнат и двете цели заедно.","At least one target is outside the range between the two source waters.":"Поне една цел е извън обхвата между двете изворни води.","Source A volume":"Източник А том","Source B volume":"Източник B том","Source A share":"Източник A дял","Predicted blend":"Предвидена смес","Predicted GH":"Предвиден GH","Predicted KH":"Предвидено KH","Source A share required by GH":"Източник Акция, изисквана от GH","Source A share required by KH":"Източник Акция, изисквана от KH","Comparison tolerance":"Толерантност към сравнение","Unit conversion: 1 °dH = 17.848 mg/L CaCO3; 1 °fH = 10 mg/L CaCO3; 1 meq/L = 50 mg/L CaCO3.":"Преобразуване на единица: 1 °dH = 17.848 mg/L CaCO3; 1 °fH = 10 mg/L CaCO3; 1 meq/L = 50 mg/L CaCO3.","All calculations run locally in this browser; no water measurements are uploaded.":"Всички изчисления се изпълняват локално в този браузър; не се качват водни измервания.","Check the values: hardness must be 0–10,000 and final volume 0–100,000 litres.":"Проверете стойностите: твърдостта трябва да бъде 0–10,000 и крайният обем 0–100,000 литра.","Unit conversion factors":"Коефициенти за преобразуване на единици","mg/L as CaCO3":"mg/L като CaCO3","meq/L":"meq/L","A compatible result is an estimate within 0.05 °dH; real test kits and water chemistry have measurement variation.":"Съвместим резултат е оценка в рамките на 0.05 °dH; реалните тестови комплекти и химията на водата имат вариация на измерването."},"bn":{"Aquarium Water Mixing Calculator":"অ্যাকোয়ারিয়াম ওয়াটার মিক্সিং ক্যালকুলেটর","Aquarium Water Mixing Calculator — Free GH & KH Planner":"অ্যাকোয়ারিয়াম ওয়াটার মিক্সিং ক্যালকুলেটর — ফ্রি GH & KH প্ল্যানার","Mix two water sources by measured GH and KH. Convert German, French, ppm and meq/L hardness units, check if both targets are compatible, and calculate litres locally.":"মাপা GH এবং KH দ্বারা দুটি জলের উত্স মিশ্রিত করুন। জার্মান, ফ্রেঞ্চ, ppm এবং meq/L কঠোরতা ইউনিট রূপান্তর করুন, উভয় লক্ষ্য সামঞ্জস্যপূর্ণ কিনা তা পরীক্ষা করুন এবং স্থানীয়ভাবে লিটার গণনা করুন।","Plan an aquarium water blend from two measured sources. The calculator solves general hardness (GH) and carbonate hardness (KH) together, rather than assuming reverse-osmosis water is exactly zero.":"দুটি পরিমাপিত উত্স থেকে অ্যাকোয়ারিয়াম জলের মিশ্রণের পরিকল্পনা করুন। ক্যালকুলেটর বিপরীত-অস্মোসিস জল ঠিক শূন্য অনুমান করার পরিবর্তে সাধারণ কঠোরতা (GH) এবং কার্বনেট কঠোরতা (KH) একসাথে সমাধান করে।","Example: mix tap water at GH 10 / KH 5 with RO water at GH 0 / KH 0. A 50% blend produces about GH 5 / KH 2.5; a different pair of targets may require incompatible blend ratios.":"উদাহরণ: GH 10 / KH 5 এ RO জলের সাথে GH 0 / KH 0 এ ট্যাপের জল মেশান৷ একটি 50% মিশ্রণ প্রায় GH 5 / KH 2.5 উত্পাদন করে; লক্ষ্যগুলির একটি ভিন্ন জোড়ার জন্য বেমানান মিশ্রণ অনুপাতের প্রয়োজন হতে পারে।","Each hardness value is converted to German degrees for calculation. GH and KH are treated as linearly mixable measured concentrations; the tool checks both independently and only gives a water recipe when the two results agree within 0.05 °dH.":"প্রতিটি কঠোরতার মান গণনার জন্য জার্মান ডিগ্রিতে রূপান্তরিত হয়। GH এবং KH কে রৈখিকভাবে মিশ্রিত পরিমাপ করা ঘনত্ব হিসাবে বিবেচনা করা হয়; টুলটি স্বাধীনভাবে পরীক্ষা করে এবং শুধুমাত্র একটি জলের রেসিপি দেয় যখন দুটি ফলাফল 0.05 °dH এর মধ্যে সম্মত হয়।","This is a mixing estimate, not a pH or species-care recommendation. It does not model remineralization, buffers, acids, substrate effects, evaporation or measurement error. Test your water and follow reliable aquarium-care guidance.":"এটি একটি মিশ্রণ অনুমান, পিএইচ বা প্রজাতি-যত্ন সুপারিশ নয়। এটি রিমিনারলাইজেশন, বাফার, অ্যাসিড, সাবস্ট্রেট ইফেক্ট, বাষ্পীভবন বা পরিমাপ ত্রুটির মডেল করে না। আপনার জল পরীক্ষা করুন এবং নির্ভরযোগ্য অ্যাকোয়ারিয়াম-যত্ন নির্দেশিকা অনুসরণ করুন।","Mixing example":"মিক্সিং উদাহরণ","How GH/KH mixing works":"জিএইচ/কেএইচ মিক্সিং কিভাবে কাজ করে","Aquarium water mixing questions":"অ্যাকোয়ারিয়ামের জল মেশানো প্রশ্ন","Assumptions and limits":"অনুমান এবং সীমা","What do GH and KH mean?":"GH এবং KH মানে কি?","GH is general hardness, mainly dissolved calcium and magnesium. KH is carbonate hardness/alkalinity as reported by your test. They are separate measurements and are not interchangeable.":"GH হল সাধারণ কঠোরতা, প্রধানত দ্রবীভূত ক্যালসিয়াম এবং ম্যাগনেসিয়াম। KH হল কার্বনেটের কঠোরতা/ক্ষারত্ব যা আপনার পরীক্ষার দ্বারা রিপোর্ট করা হয়েছে। এগুলি পৃথক পরিমাপ এবং বিনিময়যোগ্য নয়।","Does reverse-osmosis water always have zero hardness?":"রিভার্স-অসমোসিস জলের কি সবসময় শূন্য কঠোরতা থাকে?","No. Enter the GH and KH you actually measured for both sources. The calculator does not silently assume either source is pure water.":"না। আপনি আসলে উভয় উত্সের জন্য পরিমাপ করেছেন GH এবং KH লিখুন৷ ক্যালকুলেটর নিঃশব্দে অনুমান করে না যে কোনও উৎসই বিশুদ্ধ জল।","Why can my GH and KH targets be incompatible?":"কেন আমার GH এবং KH লক্ষ্যগুলি বেমানান হতে পারে?","One blend percentage must satisfy both values. If GH requires a different source ratio from KH, two-source mixing alone cannot reach both targets; the tool reports that instead of making up a recipe.":"একটি মিশ্রিত শতাংশ অবশ্যই উভয় মান পূরণ করবে। যদি GH-এর জন্য KH থেকে আলাদা উৎস অনুপাতের প্রয়োজন হয়, তবে একা দুই-উৎস মিশ্রণ উভয় লক্ষ্যমাত্রায় পৌঁছাতে পারে না; টুলটি রিপোর্ট করে যে একটি রেসিপি তৈরি করার পরিবর্তে।","Which units can I convert?":"আমি কোন ইউনিটকে রূপান্তর করতে পারি?","German degrees (°dH), French degrees (°fH), mg/L as CaCO3 (ppm), and milliequivalents per litre (meq/L). The selected unit applies to every hardness input and result.":"জার্মান ডিগ্রী (°dH), ফ্রেঞ্চ ডিগ্রী (°fH), CaCO3 (ppm) হিসাবে mg/L, এবং মিলি ইকুইভ্যালেন্ট প্রতি লিটার (meq/L)। নির্বাচিত ইউনিট প্রতিটি কঠোরতা ইনপুট এবং ফলাফল প্রযোজ্য.","Is this a pH calculator or a fish-care recommendation?":"এটি কি পিএইচ ক্যালকুলেটর নাকি মাছের যত্নের সুপারিশ?","No. pH does not mix linearly, and suitable aquarium water depends on species and other chemistry. This tool only estimates GH/KH blend proportions from supplied measurements.":"না। pH রৈখিকভাবে মিশ্রিত হয় না, এবং উপযুক্ত অ্যাকোয়ারিয়াম জল প্রজাতি এবং অন্যান্য রসায়ন উপর নির্ভর করে। এই টুলটি শুধুমাত্র সরবরাহকৃত পরিমাপ থেকে GH/KH মিশ্রণের অনুপাত অনুমান করে।","Water source A":"জলের উৎস A","Water source B":"জলের উৎস বি","Source A label":"উৎস একটি লেবেল","Source B label":"উৎস বি লেবেল","Enter measured GH and KH for each source. For example, source A can be tap water and source B reverse-osmosis water.":"প্রতিটি উৎসের জন্য পরিমাপকৃত GH এবং KH লিখুন। উদাহরণস্বরূপ, উৎস A হতে পারে ট্যাপের পানি এবং উৎস B বিপরীত-অস্মোসিস পানি।","Hardness unit":"হার্ডনেস ইউনিট","German degrees (°dH)":"জার্মান ডিগ্রি (°dH)","French degrees (°fH)":"ফ্রেঞ্চ ডিগ্রি (°fH)","mg/L as CaCO3 (ppm)":"mg/L হিসাবে CaCO3 (ppm)","Milliequivalents per litre (meq/L)":"মিলি সমতুল্য প্রতি লিটার (meq/L)","General hardness (GH)":"সাধারণ কঠোরতা (GH)","Carbonate hardness (KH)":"কার্বনেট কঠোরতা (KH)","Target water":"টার্গেট ওয়াটার","Final batch volume (litres)":"চূড়ান্ত ব্যাচ ভলিউম (লিটার)","Calculate blend":"মিশ্রণ গণনা করুন","Clear values":"পরিষ্কার মান","Enter both water sources and your target GH/KH.":"জলের উৎস এবং আপনার লক্ষ্য GH/KH উভয়ই লিখুন।","Both target values can be reached with one blend ratio.":"উভয় টার্গেট মান এক মিশ্রিত অনুপাতের সাথে পৌঁছানো যেতে পারে।","GH and KH require different blend ratios; these two sources cannot reach both targets together.":"GH এবং KH এর জন্য আলাদা মিশ্রিত অনুপাত প্রয়োজন; এই দুটি উৎস একসঙ্গে উভয় লক্ষ্যে পৌঁছাতে পারে না।","At least one target is outside the range between the two source waters.":"দুটি উৎসের জলের মধ্যে অন্তত একটি লক্ষ্য সীমার বাইরে।","Source A volume":"উৎস A ভলিউম","Source B volume":"উৎস বি ভলিউম","Source A share":"উৎস একটি শেয়ার","Predicted blend":"অনুমানিত মিশ্রণ","Predicted GH":"প্রেডিক্টেড GH","Predicted KH":"প্রেডিক্টেড KH","Source A share required by GH":"উৎস একটি শেয়ারের প্রয়োজন GH","Source A share required by KH":"উৎস একটি শেয়ারের প্রয়োজন KH","Comparison tolerance":"তুলনা সহনশীলতা","Unit conversion: 1 °dH = 17.848 mg/L CaCO3; 1 °fH = 10 mg/L CaCO3; 1 meq/L = 50 mg/L CaCO3.":"ইউনিট রূপান্তর: 1 °dH = 17.848 mg/L CaCO3; 1 °fH = 10 mg/L CaCO3; 1 meq/L = 50 mg/L CaCO3।","All calculations run locally in this browser; no water measurements are uploaded.":"সমস্ত গণনা এই ব্রাউজারে স্থানীয়ভাবে চলে; কোন জল পরিমাপ আপলোড করা হয়.","Check the values: hardness must be 0–10,000 and final volume 0–100,000 litres.":"মানগুলি পরীক্ষা করুন: কঠোরতা অবশ্যই 0–10,000 এবং চূড়ান্ত ভলিউম 0–100,000 লিটার হতে হবে৷","Unit conversion factors":"ইউনিট কনভার্সন ফ্যাক্টর","mg/L as CaCO3":"mg/L CaCO3 হিসাবে","meq/L":"meq/L","A compatible result is an estimate within 0.05 °dH; real test kits and water chemistry have measurement variation.":"একটি সামঞ্জস্যপূর্ণ ফলাফল হল 0.05 °dH এর মধ্যে একটি অনুমান; বাস্তব পরীক্ষার কিট এবং জল রসায়ন পরিমাপ বৈচিত্র আছে."},"ca":{"Aquarium Water Mixing Calculator":"Calculadora de mescla d'aigua d'aquari","Aquarium Water Mixing Calculator — Free GH & KH Planner":"Calculadora de mescla d'aigua d'aquari: planificador gratuït de GH i KH","Mix two water sources by measured GH and KH. Convert German, French, ppm and meq/L hardness units, check if both targets are compatible, and calculate litres locally.":"Barreja dues fonts d'aigua per GH i KH mesurats. Convertiu unitats de duresa alemanya, francesa, ppm i meq/L, comproveu si ambdós objectius són compatibles i calculeu els litres localment.","Plan an aquarium water blend from two measured sources. The calculator solves general hardness (GH) and carbonate hardness (KH) together, rather than assuming reverse-osmosis water is exactly zero.":"Planifica una barreja d'aigua d'aquari a partir de dues fonts mesurades. La calculadora resol la duresa general (GH) i la duresa carbonatada (KH) juntes, en lloc de suposar que l'aigua d'osmosi inversa és exactament zero.","Example: mix tap water at GH 10 / KH 5 with RO water at GH 0 / KH 0. A 50% blend produces about GH 5 / KH 2.5; a different pair of targets may require incompatible blend ratios.":"Exemple: barregeu aigua de l'aixeta a GH 10 / KH 5 amb aigua RO a GH 0 / KH 0. Una barreja 50% produeix aproximadament GH 5 / KH 2.5; un parell d'objectius diferent pot requerir proporcions de barreja incompatibles.","Each hardness value is converted to German degrees for calculation. GH and KH are treated as linearly mixable measured concentrations; the tool checks both independently and only gives a water recipe when the two results agree within 0.05 °dH.":"Cada valor de duresa es converteix en graus alemanys per al càlcul. GH i KH es tracten com a concentracions mesurades linealment barrejables; l'eina comprova tots dos de manera independent i només dóna una recepta d'aigua quan els dos resultats coincideixen dins de 0.05 °dH.","This is a mixing estimate, not a pH or species-care recommendation. It does not model remineralization, buffers, acids, substrate effects, evaporation or measurement error. Test your water and follow reliable aquarium-care guidance.":"Aquesta és una estimació de barreja, no una recomanació de pH o cura de les espècies. No modela remineralització, tampons, àcids, efectes de substrat, evaporació o error de mesura. Proveu la vostra aigua i seguiu una guia fiable per a la cura de l'aquari.","Mixing example":"Exemple de mescla","How GH/KH mixing works":"Com funciona la barreja GH/KH","Aquarium water mixing questions":"Preguntes sobre la barreja d'aigua de l'aquari","Assumptions and limits":"Hipotecis i límits","What do GH and KH mean?":"Què signifiquen GH i KH?","GH is general hardness, mainly dissolved calcium and magnesium. KH is carbonate hardness/alkalinity as reported by your test. They are separate measurements and are not interchangeable.":"GH és la duresa general, principalment calci i magnesi dissolts. KH és la duresa/alcalinitat dels carbonats tal com informa la vostra prova. Són mesures separades i no són intercanviables.","Does reverse-osmosis water always have zero hardness?":"L'aigua d'osmosi inversa sempre té duresa zero?","No. Enter the GH and KH you actually measured for both sources. The calculator does not silently assume either source is pure water.":"Núm. Introduïu el GH i el KH que heu mesurat realment per a ambdues fonts. La calculadora no assumeix en silenci que cap de les fonts sigui aigua pura.","Why can my GH and KH targets be incompatible?":"Per què els meus objectius GH i KH poden ser incompatibles?","One blend percentage must satisfy both values. If GH requires a different source ratio from KH, two-source mixing alone cannot reach both targets; the tool reports that instead of making up a recipe.":"Un percentatge de barreja ha de satisfer els dos valors. Si la GH requereix una proporció de font diferent de la de KH, la barreja de dues fonts per si sola no pot arribar a les dues dianes; l'eina informa que en lloc de fer una recepta.","Which units can I convert?":"Quines unitats puc convertir?","German degrees (°dH), French degrees (°fH), mg/L as CaCO3 (ppm), and milliequivalents per litre (meq/L). The selected unit applies to every hardness input and result.":"Graus alemanys (°dH), graus francesos (°fH), mg/L com a CaCO3 (ppm) i mil·liequivalents per litre (meq/L). La unitat seleccionada s'aplica a cada entrada i resultat de duresa.","Is this a pH calculator or a fish-care recommendation?":"És una calculadora de pH o una recomanació per a la cura del peix?","No. pH does not mix linearly, and suitable aquarium water depends on species and other chemistry. This tool only estimates GH/KH blend proportions from supplied measurements.":"Núm. El pH no es barreja linealment, i l'aigua adequada de l'aquari depèn de l'espècie i d'altres productes químics. Aquesta eina només estima les proporcions de la barreja GH/KH a partir de les mesures subministrades.","Water source A":"Font d'aigua A","Water source B":"Font d'aigua B","Source A label":"Etiqueta de la font A","Source B label":"Etiqueta de la font B","Enter measured GH and KH for each source. For example, source A can be tap water and source B reverse-osmosis water.":"Introduïu GH i KH mesurats per a cada font. Per exemple, la font A pot ser aigua de l'aixeta i la font B aigua d'osmosi inversa.","Hardness unit":"Unitat de duresa","German degrees (°dH)":"Graus alemanys (°dH)","French degrees (°fH)":"Graus francesos (°fH)","mg/L as CaCO3 (ppm)":"mg/L com a CaCO3 (ppm)","Milliequivalents per litre (meq/L)":"Milliequivalents per litre (meq/L)","General hardness (GH)":"Duresa general (GH)","Carbonate hardness (KH)":"Duresa carbonatada (KH)","Target water":"Aigua objectiu","Final batch volume (litres)":"Volum del lot final (litres)","Calculate blend":"Calcular la barreja","Clear values":"Esborra els valors","Enter both water sources and your target GH/KH.":"Introduïu les dues fonts d'aigua i el vostre GH/KH objectiu.","Both target values can be reached with one blend ratio.":"Ambdós valors objectiu es poden assolir amb una proporció de barreja.","GH and KH require different blend ratios; these two sources cannot reach both targets together.":"GH i KH requereixen relacions de barreja diferents; aquestes dues fonts no poden assolir els dos objectius junts.","At least one target is outside the range between the two source waters.":"Almenys un objectiu es troba fora de l'abast entre les dues aigües d'origen.","Source A volume":"Volum Font A","Source B volume":"Volum de la font B","Source A share":"Compartició de la font A","Predicted blend":"Barra prevista","Predicted GH":"GH previst","Predicted KH":"KH previst","Source A share required by GH":"Font A que requereix GH","Source A share required by KH":"Font A que requereix KH","Comparison tolerance":"Tolerància de comparació","Unit conversion: 1 °dH = 17.848 mg/L CaCO3; 1 °fH = 10 mg/L CaCO3; 1 meq/L = 50 mg/L CaCO3.":"Conversió d'unitats: 1 °dH = 17.848 mg/L CaCO3; 1 °fH = 10 mg/L CaCO3; 1 meq/L = 50 mg/L CaCO3.","All calculations run locally in this browser; no water measurements are uploaded.":"Tots els càlculs s'executen localment en aquest navegador; no es pengen mesures d'aigua.","Check the values: hardness must be 0–10,000 and final volume 0–100,000 litres.":"Comproveu els valors: la duresa ha de ser 0–10,000 i el volum final 0–100,000 litres.","Unit conversion factors":"Factors de conversió d'unitats","mg/L as CaCO3":"mg/L com a CaCO3","meq/L":"meq/L","A compatible result is an estimate within 0.05 °dH; real test kits and water chemistry have measurement variation.":"Un resultat compatible és una estimació dins de 0.05 °dH; Els kits de prova reals i la química de l'aigua tenen variacions de mesura."},"de":{"Aquarium Water Mixing Calculator":"Wassermischrechner für Aquarien","Aquarium Water Mixing Calculator — Free GH & KH Planner":"Wassermischrechner für Aquarien – Kostenloser GH- und KH-Planer","Mix two water sources by measured GH and KH. Convert German, French, ppm and meq/L hardness units, check if both targets are compatible, and calculate litres locally.":"Mischen Sie zwei Wasserquellen anhand der gemessenen GH- und KH-Werte. Konvertieren Sie deutsche, französische, ppm- und meq/L-Härteeinheiten, prüfen Sie, ob beide Ziele kompatibel sind, und berechnen Sie Liter lokal.","Plan an aquarium water blend from two measured sources. The calculator solves general hardness (GH) and carbonate hardness (KH) together, rather than assuming reverse-osmosis water is exactly zero.":"Planen Sie eine Aquarienwassermischung aus zwei gemessenen Quellen. Der Rechner berechnet die Gesamthärte (GH) und die Karbonathärte (KH) zusammen, anstatt davon auszugehen, dass Umkehrosmosewasser genau Null ist.","Example: mix tap water at GH 10 / KH 5 with RO water at GH 0 / KH 0. A 50% blend produces about GH 5 / KH 2.5; a different pair of targets may require incompatible blend ratios.":"Beispiel: Leitungswasser bei GH 10 / KH 5 mit RO-Wasser bei GH 0 / KH 0 mischen. Eine Mischung aus 50 % ergibt etwa GH 5 / KH 2.5; Ein anderes Zielpaar erfordert möglicherweise inkompatible Mischungsverhältnisse.","Each hardness value is converted to German degrees for calculation. GH and KH are treated as linearly mixable measured concentrations; the tool checks both independently and only gives a water recipe when the two results agree within 0.05 °dH.":"Jeder Härtewert wird zur Berechnung in deutsche Grad umgerechnet. GH und KH werden als linear mischbare gemessene Konzentrationen behandelt; Das Tool prüft beide unabhängig voneinander und gibt nur dann ein Wasserrezept aus, wenn die beiden Ergebnisse innerhalb von 0.05 °dH übereinstimmen.","This is a mixing estimate, not a pH or species-care recommendation. It does not model remineralization, buffers, acids, substrate effects, evaporation or measurement error. Test your water and follow reliable aquarium-care guidance.":"Dies ist eine Mischungsschätzung, keine Empfehlung zum pH-Wert oder zur Artenpflege. Remineralisierung, Puffer, Säuren, Substrateffekte, Verdunstung oder Messfehler werden nicht modelliert. Testen Sie Ihr Wasser und befolgen Sie zuverlässige Anleitungen zur Aquarienpflege.","Mixing example":"Mischbeispiel","How GH/KH mixing works":"So funktioniert das GH/KH-Mischen","Aquarium water mixing questions":"Fragen zum Mischen von Aquariumwasser","Assumptions and limits":"Annahmen und Grenzen","What do GH and KH mean?":"Was bedeuten GH und KH?","GH is general hardness, mainly dissolved calcium and magnesium. KH is carbonate hardness/alkalinity as reported by your test. They are separate measurements and are not interchangeable.":"GH ist die allgemeine Härte, hauptsächlich gelöstes Kalzium und Magnesium. KH ist die Karbonathärte/Alkalität gemäß Ihrem Test. Es handelt sich um separate Messungen, die nicht austauschbar sind.","Does reverse-osmosis water always have zero hardness?":"Hat Umkehrosmosewasser immer eine Härte von Null?","No. Enter the GH and KH you actually measured for both sources. The calculator does not silently assume either source is pure water.":"Nr. Geben Sie die tatsächlich gemessenen GH- und KH-Werte für beide Quellen ein. Der Rechner geht nicht stillschweigend davon aus, dass es sich bei einer der beiden Quellen um reines Wasser handelt.","Why can my GH and KH targets be incompatible?":"Warum können meine GH- und KH-Ziele inkompatibel sein?","One blend percentage must satisfy both values. If GH requires a different source ratio from KH, two-source mixing alone cannot reach both targets; the tool reports that instead of making up a recipe.":"Ein Mischungsprozentsatz muss beide Werte erfüllen. Wenn GH ein anderes Quellenverhältnis als KH erfordert, können durch das Mischen zweier Quellen allein nicht beide Ziele erreicht werden; Das Tool meldet dies, anstatt ein Rezept zu erfinden.","Which units can I convert?":"Welche Einheiten kann ich umrechnen?","German degrees (°dH), French degrees (°fH), mg/L as CaCO3 (ppm), and milliequivalents per litre (meq/L). The selected unit applies to every hardness input and result.":"Deutsche Grad (°dH), französische Grad (°fH), mg/L als CaCO3 (ppm) und Milliäquivalente pro Liter (meq/L). Die gewählte Einheit gilt für jede Härteeingabe und jedes Ergebnis.","Is this a pH calculator or a fish-care recommendation?":"Ist das ein pH-Rechner oder eine Empfehlung zur Fischpflege?","No. pH does not mix linearly, and suitable aquarium water depends on species and other chemistry. This tool only estimates GH/KH blend proportions from supplied measurements.":"Nr. Der pH-Wert mischt sich nicht linear und geeignetes Aquarienwasser hängt von der Art und anderen chemischen Stoffen ab. Dieses Tool schätzt nur die GH/KH-Mischverhältnisse anhand der bereitgestellten Messungen.","Water source A":"Wasserquelle A","Water source B":"Wasserquelle B","Source A label":"Quelle A-Label","Source B label":"Quelle B-Label","Enter measured GH and KH for each source. For example, source A can be tap water and source B reverse-osmosis water.":"Geben Sie die gemessenen GH- und KH-Werte für jede Quelle ein. Beispielsweise kann Quelle A Leitungswasser und Quelle B Umkehrosmosewasser sein.","Hardness unit":"Härteeinheit","German degrees (°dH)":"Deutsche Grade (°dH)","French degrees (°fH)":"Französische Grad (°fH)","mg/L as CaCO3 (ppm)":"mg/L als CaCO3 (ppm)","Milliequivalents per litre (meq/L)":"Milliäquivalente pro Liter (meq/L)","General hardness (GH)":"Allgemeine Härte (GH)","Carbonate hardness (KH)":"Karbonathärte (KH)","Target water":"Zielwasser","Final batch volume (litres)":"Endgültiges Chargenvolumen (Liter)","Calculate blend":"Mischung berechnen","Clear values":"Werte löschen","Enter both water sources and your target GH/KH.":"Geben Sie beide Wasserquellen und Ihr Ziel-GH/KH ein.","Both target values can be reached with one blend ratio.":"Beide Zielwerte können mit einem Mischungsverhältnis erreicht werden.","GH and KH require different blend ratios; these two sources cannot reach both targets together.":"GH und KH erfordern unterschiedliche Mischungsverhältnisse; Diese beiden Quellen können nicht beide Ziele gemeinsam erreichen.","At least one target is outside the range between the two source waters.":"Mindestens ein Ziel liegt außerhalb des Bereichs zwischen den beiden Quellgewässern.","Source A volume":"Quelle A-Volume","Source B volume":"Quelle B-Volume","Source A share":"Quelle A-Freigabe","Predicted blend":"Vorhergesagte Mischung","Predicted GH":"Vorhergesagte GH","Predicted KH":"Vorhergesagte KH","Source A share required by GH":"Quelle A-Freigabe von GH erforderlich","Source A share required by KH":"Quelle A-Anteil von KH benötigt","Comparison tolerance":"Vergleichstoleranz","Unit conversion: 1 °dH = 17.848 mg/L CaCO3; 1 °fH = 10 mg/L CaCO3; 1 meq/L = 50 mg/L CaCO3.":"Einheitenumrechnung: 1 °dH = 17.848 mg/L CaCO3; 1 °fH = 10 mg/L CaCO3; 1 meq/L = 50 mg/L CaCO3.","All calculations run locally in this browser; no water measurements are uploaded.":"Alle Berechnungen werden lokal in diesem Browser ausgeführt; Es werden keine Wassermessungen hochgeladen.","Check the values: hardness must be 0–10,000 and final volume 0–100,000 litres.":"Überprüfen Sie die Werte: Die Härte muss 0–10,000 und das Endvolumen 0–100,000 Liter betragen.","Unit conversion factors":"Einheitenumrechnungsfaktoren","mg/L as CaCO3":"mg/L als CaCO3","meq/L":"meq/L","A compatible result is an estimate within 0.05 °dH; real test kits and water chemistry have measurement variation.":"Ein kompatibles Ergebnis ist eine Schätzung innerhalb 0.05 °dH; Echte Testkits und Wasserchemie weisen Messabweichungen auf."},"el":{"Aquarium Water Mixing Calculator":"Αριθμομηχανή ανάμειξης νερού ενυδρείου","Aquarium Water Mixing Calculator — Free GH & KH Planner":"Αριθμομηχανή ανάμειξης νερού ενυδρείου — Δωρεάν προγραμματιστής GH & KH","Mix two water sources by measured GH and KH. Convert German, French, ppm and meq/L hardness units, check if both targets are compatible, and calculate litres locally.":"Αναμίξτε δύο πηγές νερού με μετρήσεις GH και KH. Μετατρέψτε τις μονάδες σκληρότητας γερμανικών, γαλλικών, ppm και meq/L, ελέγξτε εάν και οι δύο στόχοι είναι συμβατοί και υπολογίστε τα λίτρα τοπικά.","Plan an aquarium water blend from two measured sources. The calculator solves general hardness (GH) and carbonate hardness (KH) together, rather than assuming reverse-osmosis water is exactly zero.":"Σχεδιάστε ένα μείγμα νερού ενυδρείου από δύο μετρημένες πηγές. Η αριθμομηχανή λύνει τη γενική σκληρότητα (GH) και τη ανθρακική σκληρότητα (KH) μαζί, αντί να υποθέσει ότι το νερό αντίστροφης όσμωσης είναι ακριβώς μηδέν.","Example: mix tap water at GH 10 / KH 5 with RO water at GH 0 / KH 0. A 50% blend produces about GH 5 / KH 2.5; a different pair of targets may require incompatible blend ratios.":"Παράδειγμα: αναμίξτε νερό βρύσης στο GH 10 / KH 5 με νερό RO στο GH 0 / KH 0. Ένα μείγμα 50% παράγει περίπου GH 5 / KH 2.5. ένα διαφορετικό ζεύγος στόχων μπορεί να απαιτεί ασύμβατους λόγους ανάμειξης.","Each hardness value is converted to German degrees for calculation. GH and KH are treated as linearly mixable measured concentrations; the tool checks both independently and only gives a water recipe when the two results agree within 0.05 °dH.":"Κάθε τιμή σκληρότητας μετατρέπεται σε γερμανικούς βαθμούς για υπολογισμό. Η GH και η KH αντιμετωπίζονται ως γραμμικά αναμίξιμες μετρούμενες συγκεντρώσεις. το εργαλείο ελέγχει και τα δύο ανεξάρτητα και δίνει μια συνταγή νερού μόνο όταν τα δύο αποτελέσματα συμφωνούν εντός 0.05 °dH.","This is a mixing estimate, not a pH or species-care recommendation. It does not model remineralization, buffers, acids, substrate effects, evaporation or measurement error. Test your water and follow reliable aquarium-care guidance.":"Αυτή είναι μια εκτίμηση ανάμειξης, όχι μια σύσταση για το pH ή τη φροντίδα του είδους. Δεν μοντελοποιεί επαναμεταλλοποίηση, ρυθμιστικά διαλύματα, οξέα, επιδράσεις υποστρώματος, εξάτμιση ή σφάλμα μέτρησης. Δοκιμάστε το νερό σας και ακολουθήστε αξιόπιστες οδηγίες φροντίδας ενυδρείου.","Mixing example":"Παράδειγμα ανάμειξης","How GH/KH mixing works":"Πώς λειτουργεί η ανάμειξη GH/KH","Aquarium water mixing questions":"Ερωτήσεις ανάμειξης νερού ενυδρείου","Assumptions and limits":"Υποθέσεις και όρια","What do GH and KH mean?":"Τι σημαίνουν τα GH και KH;\nΤο","GH is general hardness, mainly dissolved calcium and magnesium. KH is carbonate hardness/alkalinity as reported by your test. They are separate measurements and are not interchangeable.":"GH είναι γενική σκληρότητα, κυρίως διαλυμένο ασβέστιο και μαγνήσιο. Το KH είναι η ανθρακική σκληρότητα/αλκαλικότητα όπως αναφέρεται από τη δοκιμή σας. Είναι ξεχωριστές μετρήσεις και δεν εναλλάσσονται.","Does reverse-osmosis water always have zero hardness?":"Το νερό αντίστροφης όσμωσης έχει πάντα μηδενική σκληρότητα;","No. Enter the GH and KH you actually measured for both sources. The calculator does not silently assume either source is pure water.":"Αρ. Εισαγάγετε τα GH και KH που πραγματικά μετρήσατε και για τις δύο πηγές. Η αριθμομηχανή δεν υποθέτει σιωπηλά καμία πηγή είναι καθαρό νερό.","Why can my GH and KH targets be incompatible?":"Γιατί οι στόχοι μου GH και KH μπορεί να είναι ασυμβίβαστοι;","One blend percentage must satisfy both values. If GH requires a different source ratio from KH, two-source mixing alone cannot reach both targets; the tool reports that instead of making up a recipe.":"Ένα ποσοστό μείγματος πρέπει να ικανοποιεί και τις δύο τιμές. Εάν η GH απαιτεί διαφορετική αναλογία πηγής από την KH, η ανάμειξη δύο πηγών από μόνη της δεν μπορεί να φτάσει και τους δύο στόχους. το εργαλείο αναφέρει ότι αντί να φτιάξει μια συνταγή.","Which units can I convert?":"Ποιες μονάδες μπορώ να μετατρέψω;","German degrees (°dH), French degrees (°fH), mg/L as CaCO3 (ppm), and milliequivalents per litre (meq/L). The selected unit applies to every hardness input and result.":"Γερμανικοί βαθμοί (°dH), γαλλικοί βαθμοί (°fH), mg/L ως CaCO3 (ppm) και χιλιοστοϊσοδύναμα ανά λίτρο (meq/L). Η επιλεγμένη μονάδα ισχύει για κάθε είσοδο και αποτέλεσμα σκληρότητας.","Is this a pH calculator or a fish-care recommendation?":"Αυτό είναι ένας υπολογιστής pH ή μια σύσταση φροντίδας ψαριών;","No. pH does not mix linearly, and suitable aquarium water depends on species and other chemistry. This tool only estimates GH/KH blend proportions from supplied measurements.":"Αρ. Το pH δεν αναμιγνύεται γραμμικά και το κατάλληλο νερό ενυδρείου εξαρτάται από το είδος και την άλλη χημεία. Αυτό το εργαλείο υπολογίζει μόνο τις αναλογίες μείγματος GH/KH από τις παρεχόμενες μετρήσεις.","Water source A":"Πηγή νερού Α","Water source B":"Πηγή νερού Β","Source A label":"Πηγή Α ετικέτα","Source B label":"Ετικέτα πηγής Β","Enter measured GH and KH for each source. For example, source A can be tap water and source B reverse-osmosis water.":"Εισαγάγετε τα μετρημένα GH και KH για κάθε πηγή. Για παράδειγμα, η πηγή Α μπορεί να είναι νερό βρύσης και η πηγή Β νερό αντίστροφης όσμωσης.","Hardness unit":"Μονάδα σκληρότητας","German degrees (°dH)":"Γερμανικοί βαθμοί (°dH)","French degrees (°fH)":"Γαλλικοί βαθμοί (°fH)","mg/L as CaCO3 (ppm)":"mg/L ως CaCO3 (ppm)","Milliequivalents per litre (meq/L)":"Χιλιοστοϊσοδύναμα ανά λίτρο (meq/L)","General hardness (GH)":"Γενική σκληρότητα (GH)","Carbonate hardness (KH)":"Σκληρότητα ανθρακικού (KH)","Target water":"Στόχος νερού","Final batch volume (litres)":"Τελικός όγκος παρτίδας (λίτρα)","Calculate blend":"Υπολογισμός ανάμειξης","Clear values":"Διαγραφή τιμών","Enter both water sources and your target GH/KH.":"Εισαγάγετε τόσο τις πηγές νερού όσο και τον στόχο GH/KH σας.","Both target values can be reached with one blend ratio.":"Μπορούν να επιτευχθούν και οι δύο τιμές στόχου με μία αναλογία ανάμειξης.\nΤο","GH and KH require different blend ratios; these two sources cannot reach both targets together.":"GH και KH απαιτούν διαφορετικές αναλογίες ανάμειξης. Αυτές οι δύο πηγές δεν μπορούν να φτάσουν και τους δύο στόχους μαζί.","At least one target is outside the range between the two source waters.":"Τουλάχιστον ένας στόχος βρίσκεται εκτός της εμβέλειας μεταξύ των δύο υδάτων πηγής.","Source A volume":"Πηγή Α τόμος","Source B volume":"Πηγή Β τόμος","Source A share":"Πηγή Α μετοχή","Predicted blend":"Προβλεπόμενο μείγμα","Predicted GH":"Προβλεπόμενη GH","Predicted KH":"Προβλεπόμενο KH","Source A share required by GH":"Πηγή Μια μετοχή που απαιτείται από την GH","Source A share required by KH":"Πηγή Μια μετοχή που απαιτείται από την KH","Comparison tolerance":"Συγκριτική ανοχή","Unit conversion: 1 °dH = 17.848 mg/L CaCO3; 1 °fH = 10 mg/L CaCO3; 1 meq/L = 50 mg/L CaCO3.":"Μετατροπή μονάδας: 1 °dH = 17.848 mg/L CaCO3; 1 °fH = 10 mg/L CaCO3; 1 meq/L = 50 mg/L CaCO3.","All calculations run locally in this browser; no water measurements are uploaded.":"Όλοι οι υπολογισμοί εκτελούνται τοπικά σε αυτό το πρόγραμμα περιήγησης. δεν ανεβαίνουν μετρήσεις νερού.","Check the values: hardness must be 0–10,000 and final volume 0–100,000 litres.":"Ελέγξτε τις τιμές: η σκληρότητα πρέπει να είναι 0–10,000 και ο τελικός όγκος 0–100,000 λίτρα.","Unit conversion factors":"Συντελεστές μετατροπής μονάδων","mg/L as CaCO3":"mg/L ως CaCO3","meq/L":"meq/L","A compatible result is an estimate within 0.05 °dH; real test kits and water chemistry have measurement variation.":"Ένα συμβατό αποτέλεσμα είναι μια εκτίμηση εντός 0.05 °dH. Τα πραγματικά κιτ δοκιμών και η χημεία του νερού έχουν διακύμανση μέτρησης."},"es":{"Aquarium Water Mixing Calculator":"Calculadora de mezcla de agua para acuarios","Aquarium Water Mixing Calculator — Free GH & KH Planner":"Calculadora de mezcla de agua para acuarios: planificador gratuito de GH y KH","Mix two water sources by measured GH and KH. Convert German, French, ppm and meq/L hardness units, check if both targets are compatible, and calculate litres locally.":"Mezcle dos fuentes de agua según la medida de GH y KH. Convierta unidades de dureza alemanas, francesas, ppm y meq/L, compruebe si ambos objetivos son compatibles y calcule los litros localmente.","Plan an aquarium water blend from two measured sources. The calculator solves general hardness (GH) and carbonate hardness (KH) together, rather than assuming reverse-osmosis water is exactly zero.":"Planifique una mezcla de agua de acuario a partir de dos fuentes medidas. La calculadora resuelve la dureza general (GH) y la dureza de carbonatos (KH) juntas, en lugar de asumir que el agua de ósmosis inversa es exactamente cero.","Example: mix tap water at GH 10 / KH 5 with RO water at GH 0 / KH 0. A 50% blend produces about GH 5 / KH 2.5; a different pair of targets may require incompatible blend ratios.":"Ejemplo: mezclar agua del grifo en GH 10 / KH 5 con agua RO en GH 0 / KH 0. Una mezcla de 50% produce aproximadamente GH 5 / KH 2.5; un par diferente de objetivos puede requerir proporciones de mezcla incompatibles.","Each hardness value is converted to German degrees for calculation. GH and KH are treated as linearly mixable measured concentrations; the tool checks both independently and only gives a water recipe when the two results agree within 0.05 °dH.":"Cada valor de dureza se convierte a grados alemanes para su cálculo. GH y KH se tratan como concentraciones medidas linealmente mezclables; la herramienta verifica ambos de forma independiente y solo proporciona una receta de agua cuando los dos resultados coinciden dentro de 0.05 °dH.","This is a mixing estimate, not a pH or species-care recommendation. It does not model remineralization, buffers, acids, substrate effects, evaporation or measurement error. Test your water and follow reliable aquarium-care guidance.":"Esta es una estimación de mezcla, no una recomendación de pH o cuidado de especies. No modela remineralización, tampones, ácidos, efectos del sustrato, evaporación o errores de medición. Pruebe su agua y siga pautas confiables para el cuidado del acuario.","Mixing example":"Ejemplo de mezcla","How GH/KH mixing works":"Cómo funciona la mezcla GH/KH","Aquarium water mixing questions":"Preguntas sobre mezcla de agua de acuario","Assumptions and limits":"Supuestos y límites","What do GH and KH mean?":"¿Qué significan GH y KH?","GH is general hardness, mainly dissolved calcium and magnesium. KH is carbonate hardness/alkalinity as reported by your test. They are separate measurements and are not interchangeable.":"GH es dureza general, principalmente calcio y magnesio disueltos. KH es la dureza/alcalinidad de carbonatos según lo informado por su prueba. Son medidas separadas y no son intercambiables.","Does reverse-osmosis water always have zero hardness?":"¿El agua de ósmosis inversa siempre tiene dureza cero?","No. Enter the GH and KH you actually measured for both sources. The calculator does not silently assume either source is pure water.":"No. Ingrese la GH y KH que realmente midió para ambas fuentes. La calculadora no asume silenciosamente que ninguna de las fuentes sea agua pura.","Why can my GH and KH targets be incompatible?":"¿Por qué mis objetivos de GH y KH pueden ser incompatibles?","One blend percentage must satisfy both values. If GH requires a different source ratio from KH, two-source mixing alone cannot reach both targets; the tool reports that instead of making up a recipe.":"Un porcentaje de mezcla debe satisfacer ambos valores. Si GH requiere una proporción de fuente diferente a la de KH, la mezcla de dos fuentes por sí sola no puede alcanzar ambos objetivos; la herramienta informa que en lugar de inventar una receta.","Which units can I convert?":"¿Qué unidades puedo convertir?","German degrees (°dH), French degrees (°fH), mg/L as CaCO3 (ppm), and milliequivalents per litre (meq/L). The selected unit applies to every hardness input and result.":"Grados alemanes (°dH), grados franceses (°fH), mg/L como CaCO3 (ppm) y miliequivalentes por litro (meq/L). La unidad seleccionada se aplica a cada entrada y resultado de dureza.","Is this a pH calculator or a fish-care recommendation?":"¿Es esta una calculadora de pH o una recomendación para el cuidado de los peces?","No. pH does not mix linearly, and suitable aquarium water depends on species and other chemistry. This tool only estimates GH/KH blend proportions from supplied measurements.":"No. El pH no se mezcla linealmente y el agua adecuada para el acuario depende de las especies y otros componentes químicos. Esta herramienta solo estima las proporciones de mezcla de GH/KH a partir de las mediciones suministradas.","Water source A":"Fuente de agua A","Water source B":"Fuente de agua B","Source A label":"Etiqueta de fuente A","Source B label":"Etiqueta de fuente B","Enter measured GH and KH for each source. For example, source A can be tap water and source B reverse-osmosis water.":"Ingrese GH y KH medidos para cada fuente. Por ejemplo, la fuente A puede ser agua del grifo y la fuente B, agua de ósmosis inversa.","Hardness unit":"Unidad de dureza","German degrees (°dH)":"Grados alemanes (°dH)","French degrees (°fH)":"Grados franceses (°fH)","mg/L as CaCO3 (ppm)":"mg/L como CaCO3 (ppm)","Milliequivalents per litre (meq/L)":"Miliequivalentes por litro (meq/L)","General hardness (GH)":"Dureza general (GH)","Carbonate hardness (KH)":"Dureza de carbonatos (KH)","Target water":"Agua objetivo","Final batch volume (litres)":"Volumen de lote final (litros)","Calculate blend":"Calcular mezcla","Clear values":"Borrar valores","Enter both water sources and your target GH/KH.":"Ingrese ambas fuentes de agua y su objetivo GH/KH.","Both target values can be reached with one blend ratio.":"Ambos valores objetivo se pueden alcanzar con una sola proporción de mezcla.","GH and KH require different blend ratios; these two sources cannot reach both targets together.":"GH y KH requieren diferentes proporciones de mezcla; estas dos fuentes no pueden alcanzar ambos objetivos juntas.","At least one target is outside the range between the two source waters.":"Al menos un objetivo está fuera del rango entre las dos fuentes de agua.","Source A volume":"Fuente A volumen","Source B volume":"Volumen de fuente B","Source A share":"Fuente Una acción","Predicted blend":"Mezcla prevista","Predicted GH":"GH prevista","Predicted KH":"KH previsto","Source A share required by GH":"Fuente A compartida requerida por GH","Source A share required by KH":"Fuente Una acción requerida por KH","Comparison tolerance":"Tolerancia de comparación","Unit conversion: 1 °dH = 17.848 mg/L CaCO3; 1 °fH = 10 mg/L CaCO3; 1 meq/L = 50 mg/L CaCO3.":"Conversión de unidades: 1 °dH = 17.848 mg/L CaCO3; 1 °fH = 10 mg/L CaCO3; 1 meq/L = 50 mg/L CaCO3.","All calculations run locally in this browser; no water measurements are uploaded.":"Todos los cálculos se ejecutan localmente en este navegador; no se cargan mediciones de agua.","Check the values: hardness must be 0–10,000 and final volume 0–100,000 litres.":"Compruebe los valores: la dureza debe ser 0–10,000 y el volumen final 0–100,000 litros.","Unit conversion factors":"Factores de conversión de unidades","mg/L as CaCO3":"mg/L como CaCO3","meq/L":"meq/L","A compatible result is an estimate within 0.05 °dH; real test kits and water chemistry have measurement variation.":"Un resultado compatible es una estimación dentro de 0.05 °dH; Los kits de prueba reales y la química del agua tienen variaciones en las mediciones."},"fa":{"Aquarium Water Mixing Calculator":"ماشین حساب مخلوط کردن آب آکواریوم","Aquarium Water Mixing Calculator — Free GH & KH Planner":"ماشین حساب مخلوط کردن آب آکواریوم — برنامه ریز GH & KH رایگان","Mix two water sources by measured GH and KH. Convert German, French, ppm and meq/L hardness units, check if both targets are compatible, and calculate litres locally.":"دو منبع آب را با اندازه گیری GH و KH مخلوط کنید. واحدهای سختی آلمانی، فرانسوی، ppm و meq/L را تبدیل کنید، بررسی کنید که آیا هر دو هدف سازگار هستند یا خیر، و لیترها را به صورت محلی محاسبه کنید.","Plan an aquarium water blend from two measured sources. The calculator solves general hardness (GH) and carbonate hardness (KH) together, rather than assuming reverse-osmosis water is exactly zero.":"یک ترکیب آب آکواریوم را از دو منبع اندازه گیری شده برنامه ریزی کنید. ماشین حساب سختی عمومی (GH) و سختی کربناته (KH) را با هم حل می کند، نه اینکه آب اسمز معکوس را دقیقاً صفر فرض کند.","Example: mix tap water at GH 10 / KH 5 with RO water at GH 0 / KH 0. A 50% blend produces about GH 5 / KH 2.5; a different pair of targets may require incompatible blend ratios.":"مثال: آب لوله کشی را در GH 10 / KH 5 با آب RO در GH 0 / KH 0 مخلوط کنید. یک ترکیب 50٪ حدود GH 5 / KH 2.5 تولید می کند. یک جفت هدف متفاوت ممکن است به نسبت های ترکیبی ناسازگار نیاز داشته باشد.","Each hardness value is converted to German degrees for calculation. GH and KH are treated as linearly mixable measured concentrations; the tool checks both independently and only gives a water recipe when the two results agree within 0.05 °dH.":"هر مقدار سختی برای محاسبه به درجه آلمانی تبدیل می شود. GH و KH به عنوان غلظت های اندازه گیری شده به صورت خطی مخلوط می شوند. این ابزار هر دو را به طور مستقل بررسی می کند و تنها زمانی دستور آب را ارائه می دهد که دو نتیجه در محدوده 0.05 °dH مطابقت داشته باشند.","This is a mixing estimate, not a pH or species-care recommendation. It does not model remineralization, buffers, acids, substrate effects, evaporation or measurement error. Test your water and follow reliable aquarium-care guidance.":"این یک تخمین اختلاط است، نه pH یا توصیه مراقبت از گونه. رمینرالیزاسیون، بافرها، اسیدها، اثرات بستر، تبخیر یا خطای اندازه گیری را مدل نمی کند. آب خود را آزمایش کنید و از راهنمایی های قابل اعتماد مراقبت از آکواریوم پیروی کنید.","Mixing example":"مثال میکس","How GH/KH mixing works":"مخلوط کردن GH/KH چگونه کار می کند","Aquarium water mixing questions":"سوالات اختلاط آب آکواریوم","Assumptions and limits":"فرض و حدود","What do GH and KH mean?":"GH و KH به چه معناست؟","GH is general hardness, mainly dissolved calcium and magnesium. KH is carbonate hardness/alkalinity as reported by your test. They are separate measurements and are not interchangeable.":"GH سختی عمومی است، عمدتاً کلسیم و منیزیم محلول. KH سختی / قلیایی کربنات است که توسط آزمایش شما گزارش شده است. اندازه گیری های جداگانه ای هستند و قابل تعویض نیستند.","Does reverse-osmosis water always have zero hardness?":"آیا آب اسمز معکوس همیشه سختی صفر دارد؟","No. Enter the GH and KH you actually measured for both sources. The calculator does not silently assume either source is pure water.":"شماره. GH و KH را که در واقع برای هر دو منبع اندازه گیری کرده اید وارد کنید. ماشین‌حساب بی‌صدا هر یک از منابع را آب خالص فرض نمی‌کند.","Why can my GH and KH targets be incompatible?":"چرا اهداف GH و KH من می توانند ناسازگار باشند؟","One blend percentage must satisfy both values. If GH requires a different source ratio from KH, two-source mixing alone cannot reach both targets; the tool reports that instead of making up a recipe.":"یک درصد ترکیب باید هر دو مقدار را برآورده کند. اگر GH نیاز به نسبت منبع متفاوت از KH داشته باشد، مخلوط کردن دو منبع به تنهایی نمی تواند به هر دو هدف برسد. ابزار گزارش می دهد که به جای تهیه یک دستور غذا.","Which units can I convert?":"کدام واحد را می توانم تبدیل کنم؟","German degrees (°dH), French degrees (°fH), mg/L as CaCO3 (ppm), and milliequivalents per litre (meq/L). The selected unit applies to every hardness input and result.":"درجه آلمانی (°dH)، درجه فرانسوی (°fH)، میلی گرم در لیتر به صورت CaCO3 (ppm) و میلی اکی والان در لیتر (meq/L). واحد انتخاب شده برای هر ورودی سختی و نتیجه اعمال می شود.","Is this a pH calculator or a fish-care recommendation?":"آیا این یک ماشین حساب pH است یا توصیه ای برای مراقبت از ماهی؟","No. pH does not mix linearly, and suitable aquarium water depends on species and other chemistry. This tool only estimates GH/KH blend proportions from supplied measurements.":"شماره pH به صورت خطی با هم مخلوط نمی شود و آب مناسب آکواریوم به گونه ها و سایر مواد شیمیایی بستگی دارد. این ابزار فقط نسبت های ترکیب GH/KH را از اندازه گیری های ارائه شده تخمین می زند.","Water source A":"منبع آب A","Water source B":"منبع آب B","Source A label":"برچسب منبع A","Source B label":"برچسب منبع B","Enter measured GH and KH for each source. For example, source A can be tap water and source B reverse-osmosis water.":"GH و KH اندازه گیری شده را برای هر منبع وارد کنید. به عنوان مثال، منبع A می تواند آب لوله کشی و منبع B آب اسمز معکوس باشد.","Hardness unit":"واحد سختی","German degrees (°dH)":"درجه آلمانی (°dH)","French degrees (°fH)":"درجه فرانسوی (°fH)","mg/L as CaCO3 (ppm)":"mg/L به صورت CaCO3 (ppm)","Milliequivalents per litre (meq/L)":"میلی‌اکی‌والان در لیتر (میلی‌اکی‌والان در لیتر)","General hardness (GH)":"سختی عمومی (GH)","Carbonate hardness (KH)":"سختی کربنات (KH)","Target water":"آب هدف","Final batch volume (litres)":"حجم بسته نهایی (لیتر)","Calculate blend":"محاسبه ترکیب","Clear values":"مقادیر را پاک کنید","Enter both water sources and your target GH/KH.":"هم منابع آب و هم GH/KH هدف خود را وارد کنید.","Both target values can be reached with one blend ratio.":"هر دو مقدار هدف را می توان با یک نسبت ترکیبی بدست آورد.","GH and KH require different blend ratios; these two sources cannot reach both targets together.":"GH و KH به نسبت های مختلف مخلوط نیاز دارند. این دو منبع نمی توانند با هم به هر دو هدف برسند.","At least one target is outside the range between the two source waters.":"حداقل یک هدف خارج از محدوده بین دو آب منبع است.","Source A volume":"منبع جلد A","Source B volume":"منبع حجم B","Source A share":"منبع سهم","Predicted blend":"ترکیب پیش بینی شده","Predicted GH":"GH پیش بینی شده","Predicted KH":"پیش بینی KH","Source A share required by GH":"منبع سهم مورد نیاز GH","Source A share required by KH":"منبع سهم مورد نیاز KH","Comparison tolerance":"تحمل مقایسه","Unit conversion: 1 °dH = 17.848 mg/L CaCO3; 1 °fH = 10 mg/L CaCO3; 1 meq/L = 50 mg/L CaCO3.":"تبدیل واحد: 1 °dH = 17.848 mg/L CaCO3; 1 °fH = 10 mg/L CaCO3; 1 meq/L = 50 mg/L CaCO3.","All calculations run locally in this browser; no water measurements are uploaded.":"همه محاسبات به صورت محلی در این مرورگر اجرا می شوند. هیچ اندازه گیری آب آپلود نمی شود.","Check the values: hardness must be 0–10,000 and final volume 0–100,000 litres.":"مقادیر را بررسی کنید: سختی باید 0–10,000 و حجم نهایی 0–100,000 لیتر باشد.","Unit conversion factors":"فاکتورهای تبدیل واحد","mg/L as CaCO3":"mg/L به عنوان CaCO3","meq/L":"meq/L","A compatible result is an estimate within 0.05 °dH; real test kits and water chemistry have measurement variation.":"نتیجه سازگار تخمینی در محدوده 0.05 °dH است. کیت های آزمایش واقعی و شیمی آب دارای تنوع اندازه گیری هستند."},"fr":{"Aquarium Water Mixing Calculator":"Calculateur de mélange d'eau d'aquarium","Aquarium Water Mixing Calculator — Free GH & KH Planner":"Calculateur de mélange d'eau d'aquarium — Planificateur GH et KH gratuit","Mix two water sources by measured GH and KH. Convert German, French, ppm and meq/L hardness units, check if both targets are compatible, and calculate litres locally.":"Mélanger deux sources d'eau en mesurant GH et KH. Convertissez les unités de dureté allemandes, françaises, ppm et meq/L, vérifiez si les deux cibles sont compatibles et calculez les litres localement.","Plan an aquarium water blend from two measured sources. The calculator solves general hardness (GH) and carbonate hardness (KH) together, rather than assuming reverse-osmosis water is exactly zero.":"Planifiez un mélange d'eau d'aquarium à partir de deux sources mesurées. Le calculateur résout ensemble la dureté générale (GH) et la dureté carbonatée (KH), plutôt que de supposer que l’eau osmosée est exactement nulle.","Example: mix tap water at GH 10 / KH 5 with RO water at GH 0 / KH 0. A 50% blend produces about GH 5 / KH 2.5; a different pair of targets may require incompatible blend ratios.":"Exemple : mélangez l'eau du robinet à GH 10 / KH 5 avec de l'eau osmosée à GH 0 / KH 0. Un mélange 50% produit environ GH 5 / KH 2.5 ; une paire de cibles différente peut nécessiter des ratios de mélange incompatibles.","Each hardness value is converted to German degrees for calculation. GH and KH are treated as linearly mixable measured concentrations; the tool checks both independently and only gives a water recipe when the two results agree within 0.05 °dH.":"Chaque valeur de dureté est convertie en degrés allemands pour le calcul. GH et KH sont traités comme des concentrations mesurées linéairement mélangeables ; l'outil vérifie les deux indépendamment et ne donne une recette d'eau que lorsque les deux résultats concordent dans les limites de 0.05 °dH.","This is a mixing estimate, not a pH or species-care recommendation. It does not model remineralization, buffers, acids, substrate effects, evaporation or measurement error. Test your water and follow reliable aquarium-care guidance.":"Il s'agit d'une estimation de mélange, et non d'une recommandation de pH ou de soins aux espèces. Il ne modélise pas la reminéralisation, les tampons, les acides, les effets du substrat, l'évaporation ou les erreurs de mesure. Testez votre eau et suivez les conseils fiables en matière d’entretien de l’aquarium.","Mixing example":"Exemple de mélange","How GH/KH mixing works":"Comment fonctionne le mélange GH/KH","Aquarium water mixing questions":"Questions sur le mélange de l'eau d'aquarium","Assumptions and limits":"Hypothèses et limites","What do GH and KH mean?":"Que signifient GH et KH ?","GH is general hardness, mainly dissolved calcium and magnesium. KH is carbonate hardness/alkalinity as reported by your test. They are separate measurements and are not interchangeable.":"GH est la dureté générale, principalement du calcium et du magnésium dissous. KH est la dureté carbonatée/alcalinité telle que rapportée par votre test. Ce sont des mesures distinctes et ne sont pas interchangeables.","Does reverse-osmosis water always have zero hardness?":"L'eau osmosée a-t-elle toujours une dureté nulle ?","No. Enter the GH and KH you actually measured for both sources. The calculator does not silently assume either source is pure water.":"Non. Entrez le GH et le KH que vous avez réellement mesurés pour les deux sources. Le calculateur ne suppose pas silencieusement que l’une ou l’autre source est de l’eau pure.","Why can my GH and KH targets be incompatible?":"Pourquoi mes cibles GH et KH peuvent-elles être incompatibles ?","One blend percentage must satisfy both values. If GH requires a different source ratio from KH, two-source mixing alone cannot reach both targets; the tool reports that instead of making up a recipe.":"Un pourcentage de mélange doit satisfaire les deux valeurs. Si GH nécessite un rapport de source différent de KH, le mélange de deux sources ne peut à lui seul atteindre les deux cibles ; l'outil rapporte cela au lieu d'inventer une recette.","Which units can I convert?":"Quelles unités puis-je convertir ?","German degrees (°dH), French degrees (°fH), mg/L as CaCO3 (ppm), and milliequivalents per litre (meq/L). The selected unit applies to every hardness input and result.":"Degrés allemands (°dH), degrés français (°fH), mg/L sous forme de CaCO3 (ppm) et milliéquivalents par litre (meq/L). L'unité sélectionnée s'applique à chaque entrée et résultat de dureté.","Is this a pH calculator or a fish-care recommendation?":"Est-ce un calculateur de pH ou une recommandation pour le soin des poissons ?","No. pH does not mix linearly, and suitable aquarium water depends on species and other chemistry. This tool only estimates GH/KH blend proportions from supplied measurements.":"Non. Le pH ne se mélange pas de manière linéaire et l’eau d’aquarium appropriée dépend des espèces et d’autres produits chimiques. Cet outil estime uniquement les proportions du mélange GH/KH à partir des mesures fournies.","Water source A":"Source d'eau A","Water source B":"Source d'eau B","Source A label":"Étiquette Source A","Source B label":"Étiquette source B","Enter measured GH and KH for each source. For example, source A can be tap water and source B reverse-osmosis water.":"Entrez le GH et le KH mesurés pour chaque source. Par exemple, la source A peut être de l’eau du robinet et la source B de l’eau osmosée.","Hardness unit":"Unité de dureté","German degrees (°dH)":"Degrés allemands (°dH)","French degrees (°fH)":"Degrés français (°fH)","mg/L as CaCO3 (ppm)":"mg/L sous forme de CaCO3 (ppm)","Milliequivalents per litre (meq/L)":"Milliéquivalents par litre (meq/L)","General hardness (GH)":"Dureté générale (GH)","Carbonate hardness (KH)":"Dureté carbonatée (KH)","Target water":"Eau cible","Final batch volume (litres)":"Volume final du lot (litres)","Calculate blend":"Calculer le mélange","Clear values":"Effacer les valeurs","Enter both water sources and your target GH/KH.":"Entrez les deux sources d'eau et votre GH/KH cible.","Both target values can be reached with one blend ratio.":"Les deux valeurs cibles peuvent être atteintes avec un seul rapport de mélange.","GH and KH require different blend ratios; these two sources cannot reach both targets together.":"GH et KH nécessitent des ratios de mélange différents ; ces deux sources ne peuvent pas atteindre les deux cibles ensemble.","At least one target is outside the range between the two source waters.":"Au moins une cible se trouve en dehors de la plage située entre les deux sources d'eau.","Source A volume":"Volume source A","Source B volume":"Volume source B","Source A share":"Partage source A","Predicted blend":"Mélange prévu","Predicted GH":"GH prédite","Predicted KH":"KH prédit","Source A share required by GH":"Source Un partage requis par GH","Source A share required by KH":"Source Un partage requis par KH","Comparison tolerance":"Tolérance de comparaison","Unit conversion: 1 °dH = 17.848 mg/L CaCO3; 1 °fH = 10 mg/L CaCO3; 1 meq/L = 50 mg/L CaCO3.":"Conversion d'unité : 1 °dH = 17.848 mg/L CaCO3 ; 1 °fH = 10 mg/L CaCO3 ; 1 méq/L = 50 mg/L CaCO3.","All calculations run locally in this browser; no water measurements are uploaded.":"Tous les calculs sont exécutés localement dans ce navigateur ; aucune mesure d'eau n'est téléchargée.","Check the values: hardness must be 0–10,000 and final volume 0–100,000 litres.":"Vérifiez les valeurs : la dureté doit être de 0–10,000 et le volume final 0–100,000 litres.","Unit conversion factors":"Facteurs de conversion d'unité","mg/L as CaCO3":"mg/L sous forme de CaCO3","meq/L":"méq/L","A compatible result is an estimate within 0.05 °dH; real test kits and water chemistry have measurement variation.":"Un résultat compatible est une estimation comprise dans 0.05 °dH ; Les vrais kits de test et la chimie de l'eau présentent des variations de mesure."},"gu":{"Aquarium Water Mixing Calculator":"એક્વેરિયમ વોટર મિક્સિંગ કેલ્ક્યુલેટર","Aquarium Water Mixing Calculator — Free GH & KH Planner":"એક્વેરિયમ વોટર મિક્સિંગ કેલ્ક્યુલેટર - મફત GH અને KH પ્લાનર","Mix two water sources by measured GH and KH. Convert German, French, ppm and meq/L hardness units, check if both targets are compatible, and calculate litres locally.":"માપેલા GH અને KH દ્વારા પાણીના બે સ્ત્રોતને મિક્સ કરો. જર્મન, ફ્રેન્ચ, ppm અને meq/L કઠિનતા એકમોને કન્વર્ટ કરો, બંને લક્ષ્યો સુસંગત છે કે કેમ તે તપાસો અને સ્થાનિક રીતે લિટરની ગણતરી કરો.","Plan an aquarium water blend from two measured sources. The calculator solves general hardness (GH) and carbonate hardness (KH) together, rather than assuming reverse-osmosis water is exactly zero.":"બે માપેલા સ્ત્રોતોમાંથી એક્વેરિયમ પાણીના મિશ્રણની યોજના બનાવો. કેલ્ક્યુલેટર સામાન્ય કઠિનતા (GH) અને કાર્બોનેટ કઠિનતા (KH) ને એકસાથે ઉકેલે છે, રિવર્સ-ઓસ્મોસિસ પાણી બરાબર શૂન્ય છે એમ માની લેવાને બદલે.","Example: mix tap water at GH 10 / KH 5 with RO water at GH 0 / KH 0. A 50% blend produces about GH 5 / KH 2.5; a different pair of targets may require incompatible blend ratios.":"ઉદાહરણ: GH 10 / KH 5 પર RO પાણી સાથે GH 0 / KH 0 પર નળના પાણીને મિક્સ કરો. એક 50% મિશ્રણ લગભગ GH 5 / KH 2.5 ઉત્પાદન કરે છે; લક્ષ્યોની એક અલગ જોડી માટે અસંગત મિશ્રણ ગુણોત્તરની જરૂર પડી શકે છે.","Each hardness value is converted to German degrees for calculation. GH and KH are treated as linearly mixable measured concentrations; the tool checks both independently and only gives a water recipe when the two results agree within 0.05 °dH.":"દરેક કઠિનતા મૂલ્ય ગણતરી માટે જર્મન ડિગ્રીમાં રૂપાંતરિત થાય છે. GH અને KH ને રેખીય રીતે મિશ્રિત માપી શકાય તેવી સાંદ્રતા તરીકે ગણવામાં આવે છે; સાધન બંને સ્વતંત્ર રીતે તપાસે છે અને જ્યારે બે પરિણામો 0.05 °dH ની અંદર સંમત થાય ત્યારે જ પાણીની રેસીપી આપે છે.","This is a mixing estimate, not a pH or species-care recommendation. It does not model remineralization, buffers, acids, substrate effects, evaporation or measurement error. Test your water and follow reliable aquarium-care guidance.":"આ મિશ્રણનો અંદાજ છે, pH અથવા જાતિ-સંભાળની ભલામણ નથી. તે રિમિનરલાઇઝેશન, બફર્સ, એસિડ્સ, સબસ્ટ્રેટ ઇફેક્ટ્સ, બાષ્પીભવન અથવા માપન ભૂલનું મોડેલ કરતું નથી. તમારા પાણીનું પરીક્ષણ કરો અને માછલીઘરની સંભાળના વિશ્વસનીય માર્ગદર્શનને અનુસરો.","Mixing example":"મિક્સિંગ ઉદાહરણ","How GH/KH mixing works":"GH/KH મિશ્રણ કેવી રીતે કામ કરે છે","Aquarium water mixing questions":"એક્વેરિયમ પાણીના મિશ્રણના પ્રશ્નો","Assumptions and limits":"ધારણાઓ અને મર્યાદાઓ","What do GH and KH mean?":"GH અને KH નો અર્થ શું છે?","GH is general hardness, mainly dissolved calcium and magnesium. KH is carbonate hardness/alkalinity as reported by your test. They are separate measurements and are not interchangeable.":"GH એ સામાન્ય કઠિનતા છે, મુખ્યત્વે ઓગળેલા કેલ્શિયમ અને મેગ્નેશિયમ. KH એ કાર્બોનેટ કઠિનતા/ક્ષારત્વ છે જે તમારા પરીક્ષણ દ્વારા નોંધાયેલ છે. તેઓ અલગ માપ છે અને વિનિમયક્ષમ નથી.","Does reverse-osmosis water always have zero hardness?":"શું રિવર્સ-ઓસ્મોસિસ પાણી હંમેશા શૂન્ય કઠિનતા ધરાવે છે?","No. Enter the GH and KH you actually measured for both sources. The calculator does not silently assume either source is pure water.":"નં. તમે ખરેખર બંને સ્ત્રોતો માટે માપેલ GH અને KH દાખલ કરો. કેલ્ક્યુલેટર ચુપચાપ ધારણ કરતું નથી કે ક્યાં તો સ્ત્રોત શુદ્ધ પાણી છે.","Why can my GH and KH targets be incompatible?":"મારા GH અને KH લક્ષ્યો અસંગત કેમ હોઈ શકે?","One blend percentage must satisfy both values. If GH requires a different source ratio from KH, two-source mixing alone cannot reach both targets; the tool reports that instead of making up a recipe.":"એક મિશ્રણની ટકાવારી એ બંને મૂલ્યોને સંતોષવી આવશ્યક છે. જો GH ને KH થી અલગ સ્ત્રોત ગુણોત્તરની જરૂર હોય, તો એકલા બે-સ્રોત મિશ્રણ બંને લક્ષ્યો સુધી પહોંચી શકતું નથી; સાધન અહેવાલ આપે છે કે રેસીપી બનાવવાને બદલે.","Which units can I convert?":"હું કયા એકમોને કન્વર્ટ કરી શકું?","German degrees (°dH), French degrees (°fH), mg/L as CaCO3 (ppm), and milliequivalents per litre (meq/L). The selected unit applies to every hardness input and result.":"જર્મન ડિગ્રી (°dH), ફ્રેન્ચ ડિગ્રી (°fH), CaCO3 (ppm) તરીકે mg/L, અને મિલી સમકક્ષ પ્રતિ લિટર (meq/L). પસંદ કરેલ એકમ દરેક કઠિનતા ઇનપુટ અને પરિણામ પર લાગુ થાય છે.","Is this a pH calculator or a fish-care recommendation?":"શું આ pH કેલ્ક્યુલેટર છે કે માછલીની સંભાળની ભલામણ છે?","No. pH does not mix linearly, and suitable aquarium water depends on species and other chemistry. This tool only estimates GH/KH blend proportions from supplied measurements.":"નં. pH રેખીય રીતે ભળતું નથી, અને યોગ્ય માછલીઘરનું પાણી પ્રજાતિઓ અને અન્ય રસાયણશાસ્ત્ર પર આધારિત છે. આ સાધન પૂરા પાડવામાં આવેલ માપોમાંથી માત્ર GH/KH મિશ્રણ પ્રમાણનો અંદાજ કાઢે છે.","Water source A":"જળ સ્ત્રોત એ","Water source B":"જળ સ્ત્રોત B","Source A label":"સ્ત્રોત એ લેબલ","Source B label":"સોર્સ B લેબલ","Enter measured GH and KH for each source. For example, source A can be tap water and source B reverse-osmosis water.":"દરેક સ્ત્રોત માટે માપેલ GH અને KH દાખલ કરો. ઉદાહરણ તરીકે, સ્ત્રોત A એ નળનું પાણી અને સ્ત્રોત B રિવર્સ-ઓસ્મોસિસ પાણી હોઈ શકે છે.","Hardness unit":"હાર્ડનેસ યુનિટ","German degrees (°dH)":"જર્મન ડિગ્રી (°dH)","French degrees (°fH)":"ફ્રેન્ચ ડિગ્રી (°fH)","mg/L as CaCO3 (ppm)":"mg/L CaCO3 (ppm) તરીકે","Milliequivalents per litre (meq/L)":"મિલી સમકક્ષ પ્રતિ લિટર (meq/L)","General hardness (GH)":"સામાન્ય કઠિનતા (GH)","Carbonate hardness (KH)":"કાર્બોનેટ કઠિનતા (KH)","Target water":"ટાર્ગેટ વોટર","Final batch volume (litres)":"અંતિમ બેચ વોલ્યુમ (લિટર)","Calculate blend":"મિશ્રણની ગણતરી કરો","Clear values":"મૂલ્યો સાફ કરો","Enter both water sources and your target GH/KH.":"પાણીના સ્ત્રોતો અને તમારું લક્ષ્ય GH/KH બંને દાખલ કરો.","Both target values can be reached with one blend ratio.":"બંને લક્ષ્ય મૂલ્યો એક મિશ્રણ ગુણોત્તર સાથે પહોંચી શકાય છે.","GH and KH require different blend ratios; these two sources cannot reach both targets together.":"GH અને KH ને વિવિધ મિશ્રણ ગુણોત્તરની જરૂર છે; આ બે સ્ત્રોતો એકસાથે બંને લક્ષ્યો સુધી પહોંચી શકતા નથી.","At least one target is outside the range between the two source waters.":"ઓછામાં ઓછું એક લક્ષ્ય બે સ્ત્રોત પાણી વચ્ચેની રેન્જની બહાર છે.","Source A volume":"સોર્સ A વોલ્યુમ","Source B volume":"સ્રોત B વોલ્યુમ","Source A share":"સોર્સ એ શેર","Predicted blend":"અનુમાનિત મિશ્રણ","Predicted GH":"અનુમાનિત GH","Predicted KH":"અનુમાનિત KH","Source A share required by GH":"સ્રોત GH દ્વારા જરૂરી શેર","Source A share required by KH":"KH દ્વારા જરૂરી એક શેર","Comparison tolerance":"સરખામણી સહનશીલતા","Unit conversion: 1 °dH = 17.848 mg/L CaCO3; 1 °fH = 10 mg/L CaCO3; 1 meq/L = 50 mg/L CaCO3.":"યુનિટ કન્વર્ઝન: 1 °dH = 17.848 mg/L CaCO3; 1 °fH = 10 mg/L CaCO3; 1 meq/L = 50 mg/L CaCO3.","All calculations run locally in this browser; no water measurements are uploaded.":"બધી ગણતરીઓ આ બ્રાઉઝરમાં સ્થાનિક રીતે ચાલે છે; પાણીનું કોઈ માપ અપલોડ કરવામાં આવતું નથી.","Check the values: hardness must be 0–10,000 and final volume 0–100,000 litres.":"મૂલ્યો તપાસો: કઠિનતા 0–10,000 અને અંતિમ વોલ્યુમ 0–100,000 લિટર હોવી જોઈએ.","Unit conversion factors":"યુનિટ રૂપાંતરણ પરિબળો","mg/L as CaCO3":"mg/L CaCO3 તરીકે","meq/L":"meq/L","A compatible result is an estimate within 0.05 °dH; real test kits and water chemistry have measurement variation.":"એક સુસંગત પરિણામ એ 0.05 °dH ની અંદરનો અંદાજ છે; વાસ્તવિક પરીક્ષણ કીટ અને પાણી રસાયણશાસ્ત્રમાં માપન વિવિધતા હોય છે."},"ha":{"Aquarium Water Mixing Calculator":"Ƙwaƙwalwar Ruwa na Ruwa","Aquarium Water Mixing Calculator — Free GH & KH Planner":"Ƙwaƙwalwar Ruwa na Ruwa - Mai tsara GH & KH Kyauta","Mix two water sources by measured GH and KH. Convert German, French, ppm and meq/L hardness units, check if both targets are compatible, and calculate litres locally.":"Haɗa hanyoyin ruwa guda biyu ta hanyar auna GH da KH. Maida Jamusanci, Faransanci, ppm da meq/L taurin raka'a, bincika idan duka maƙasudin sun dace, da lissafin lita a gida.","Plan an aquarium water blend from two measured sources. The calculator solves general hardness (GH) and carbonate hardness (KH) together, rather than assuming reverse-osmosis water is exactly zero.":"Shirya cakuda ruwan kifaye daga ma'auni guda biyu. Kalkuleta yana warware taurin gabaɗaya (GH) da taurin carbonate (KH) tare, maimakon ɗaukan ruwan baya-osmosis daidai sifili.","Example: mix tap water at GH 10 / KH 5 with RO water at GH 0 / KH 0. A 50% blend produces about GH 5 / KH 2.5; a different pair of targets may require incompatible blend ratios.":"Misali: Mix ruwan famfo a GH 10 / KH 5 tare da ruwan RO a GH 0 / KH 0. A 50% cakuda yana samar da game da GH 5 / KH 2.5; maƙasudai daban-daban na iya buƙatar ma'auni mara daidaituwa.","Each hardness value is converted to German degrees for calculation. GH and KH are treated as linearly mixable measured concentrations; the tool checks both independently and only gives a water recipe when the two results agree within 0.05 °dH.":"Kowace ƙimar taurin tana canzawa zuwa digiri na Jamus don lissafi. GH da KH ana bi da su azaman ma'aunin ma'auni mai haɗaɗɗiyar layi; kayan aiki yana duba duka biyu da kansa kuma kawai yana ba da girke-girke na ruwa lokacin da sakamakon biyu ya yarda a cikin 0.05 ° dH.","This is a mixing estimate, not a pH or species-care recommendation. It does not model remineralization, buffers, acids, substrate effects, evaporation or measurement error. Test your water and follow reliable aquarium-care guidance.":"Wannan ƙididdiga ce ta gaurayawa, ba pH ko shawarar kula da nau'in ba. Ba ya ƙirƙira remineralization, buffers, acids, substrate effects, evaporation ko kuskuren aunawa. Gwada ruwan ku kuma bi ingantaccen jagorar kula da akwatin kifaye.","Mixing example":"Misali hadawa","How GH/KH mixing works":"Yadda hadawar GH/KH ke aiki","Aquarium water mixing questions":"Tambayoyi masu gauraya ruwan kifaye","Assumptions and limits":"Zato da iyaka","What do GH and KH mean?":"Menene ma'anar GH da KH?","GH is general hardness, mainly dissolved calcium and magnesium. KH is carbonate hardness/alkalinity as reported by your test. They are separate measurements and are not interchangeable.":"GH shine taurin gaba ɗaya, galibi narkar da calcium da magnesium. KH shine taurin carbonate/alkalinity kamar yadda gwajin ku ya ruwaito. Ma'auni daban-daban ne kuma ba sa canzawa.","Does reverse-osmosis water always have zero hardness?":"Shin ruwan baya-osmosis koyaushe yana da taurin sifili?","No. Enter the GH and KH you actually measured for both sources. The calculator does not silently assume either source is pure water.":"No. Shigar da GH da KH da kuka auna a zahiri don tushen biyu. Kalkuleta ba ya yin shiru ya ɗauka ko dai tushen ruwa ne mai tsafta.","Why can my GH and KH targets be incompatible?":"Me yasa maƙasudin GH na KH na iya zama marasa jituwa?","One blend percentage must satisfy both values. If GH requires a different source ratio from KH, two-source mixing alone cannot reach both targets; the tool reports that instead of making up a recipe.":"Kashi ɗaya dole ne ya gamsar da ƙimar duka biyun. Idan GH yana buƙatar nau'in tushe daban-daban daga KH, haɗuwa guda biyu kawai ba zai iya isa ga maƙasudin biyu ba; kayan aiki sun ba da rahoton cewa maimakon yin girke-girke.","Which units can I convert?":"Wadanne raka'a zan iya canzawa?","German degrees (°dH), French degrees (°fH), mg/L as CaCO3 (ppm), and milliequivalents per litre (meq/L). The selected unit applies to every hardness input and result.":"Digiri na Jamus (° dH), digiri na Faransa (° fH), mg/L as CaCO3 (ppm), da milliequivalents per liter (meq/L). Naúrar da aka zaɓa ta shafi kowane shigarwar ƙarfi da sakamako.","Is this a pH calculator or a fish-care recommendation?":"Shin wannan kalkuleta ce ta pH ko shawarar kula da kifi?","No. pH does not mix linearly, and suitable aquarium water depends on species and other chemistry. This tool only estimates GH/KH blend proportions from supplied measurements.":"A'a. pH ba ya haɗuwa da layi, kuma ruwan aquarium mai dacewa ya dogara da nau'in nau'i da sauran sunadarai. Wannan kayan aikin kawai yana ƙididdige ma'aunin haɗin GH/KH daga ma'aunin da aka kawo.","Water source A":"Madogaran ruwa A","Water source B":"Madogaran ruwa B","Source A label":"Source A lakabin","Source B label":"Tambarin tushen B","Enter measured GH and KH for each source. For example, source A can be tap water and source B reverse-osmosis water.":"Shigar da ma'aunin GH da KH don kowane tushe. Misali, tushen A na iya zama ruwan famfo da tushen B reverse-osmosis ruwa.","Hardness unit":"Naúrar taurin","German degrees (°dH)":"Digiri na Jamus (° dH)","French degrees (°fH)":"Digiri na Faransa (° fH)","mg/L as CaCO3 (ppm)":"mg/L as CaCO3 (ppm)","Milliequivalents per litre (meq/L)":"Milli kwatankwacin lita daya (meq/L","General hardness (GH)":"Taurin Gaba ɗaya (GH)","Carbonate hardness (KH)":"Taurin Carbonate (KH)","Target water":"Ruwan manufa","Final batch volume (litres)":"Ƙarshen tsari na ƙarshe (lita)","Calculate blend":"Lissafi gauraya","Clear values":"Tallafi masu ƙima","Enter both water sources and your target GH/KH.":"Shigar da hanyoyin ruwa biyu da GH/KH manufa.","Both target values can be reached with one blend ratio.":"Dukkan ƙimar ƙima za a iya kaiwa tare da rabon gauraya ɗaya.","GH and KH require different blend ratios; these two sources cannot reach both targets together.":"GH da KH suna buƙatar ma'auni daban-daban; waɗannan hanyoyin guda biyu ba za su iya kai ga maƙasudin biyu tare ba.","At least one target is outside the range between the two source waters.":"Aƙalla manufa ɗaya yana waje da kewayo tsakanin ruwan tushen biyu.","Source A volume":"Tushen A girma","Source B volume":"Tushen B girma","Source A share":"Madogaran rabon","Predicted blend":"Haɗin da aka annabta","Predicted GH":"GH da aka annabta","Predicted KH":"KH","Source A share required by GH":"Madogaran rabon da GH ke buƙata","Source A share required by KH":"Madogaran rabon da KH ke buƙata","Comparison tolerance":"Haƙurin kwatance","Unit conversion: 1 °dH = 17.848 mg/L CaCO3; 1 °fH = 10 mg/L CaCO3; 1 meq/L = 50 mg/L CaCO3.":"Juyin Juya: 1 °dH = 17.848 mg/L CaCO3; 1 °fH = 10 mg/L CaCO3; 1 meq/L = 50 mg/L CaCO3.","All calculations run locally in this browser; no water measurements are uploaded.":"ba a ɗora ma'aunin ruwa ba.","Check the values: hardness must be 0–10,000 and final volume 0–100,000 litres.":"Duba ƙimar: taurin dole ne ya zama 0–10,000 da ƙarar ƙarshe 0–100,000 lita.","Unit conversion factors":"Abubuwan jujjuyawar raka'a","mg/L as CaCO3":"mg/L as CaCO3","meq/L":"meq/L","A compatible result is an estimate within 0.05 °dH; real test kits and water chemistry have measurement variation.":"Sakamako mai jituwa shine ƙididdigewa tsakanin 0.05 °dH; na'urorin gwaji na gaske da kimiyyar ruwa suna da bambancin ma'auni."},"hi":{"Aquarium Water Mixing Calculator":"एक्वेरियम जल मिश्रण कैलकुलेटर","Aquarium Water Mixing Calculator — Free GH & KH Planner":"एक्वेरियम वॉटर मिक्सिंग कैलकुलेटर — मुफ़्त GH और KH प्लानर","Mix two water sources by measured GH and KH. Convert German, French, ppm and meq/L hardness units, check if both targets are compatible, and calculate litres locally.":"मापे गए GH और KH द्वारा दो जल स्रोतों को मिलाएं। जर्मन, फ्रेंच, पीपीएम और एमईक्यू/एल कठोरता इकाइयों को परिवर्तित करें, जांचें कि क्या दोनों लक्ष्य संगत हैं, और स्थानीय स्तर पर लीटर की गणना करें।","Plan an aquarium water blend from two measured sources. The calculator solves general hardness (GH) and carbonate hardness (KH) together, rather than assuming reverse-osmosis water is exactly zero.":"दो मापित स्रोतों से एक्वैरियम जल मिश्रण की योजना बनाएं। कैलकुलेटर रिवर्स-ऑस्मोसिस पानी को बिल्कुल शून्य मानने के बजाय सामान्य कठोरता (जीएच) और कार्बोनेट कठोरता (केएच) को एक साथ हल करता है।","Example: mix tap water at GH 10 / KH 5 with RO water at GH 0 / KH 0. A 50% blend produces about GH 5 / KH 2.5; a different pair of targets may require incompatible blend ratios.":"उदाहरण: GH 10 / KH 5 पर नल का पानी GH 0 / KH 0 पर आरओ पानी के साथ मिलाएं। एक 50% मिश्रण लगभग GH 5 / KH 2.5 उत्पन्न करता है; लक्ष्यों की एक अलग जोड़ी के लिए असंगत मिश्रण अनुपात की आवश्यकता हो सकती है।","Each hardness value is converted to German degrees for calculation. GH and KH are treated as linearly mixable measured concentrations; the tool checks both independently and only gives a water recipe when the two results agree within 0.05 °dH.":"प्रत्येक कठोरता मान को गणना के लिए जर्मन डिग्री में परिवर्तित किया जाता है। जीएच और केएच को रैखिक रूप से मिश्रण योग्य मापी गई सांद्रता के रूप में माना जाता है; उपकरण स्वतंत्र रूप से जांच करता है और केवल तभी पानी का नुस्खा देता है जब दोनों परिणाम 0.05 °dH के भीतर सहमत होते हैं।","This is a mixing estimate, not a pH or species-care recommendation. It does not model remineralization, buffers, acids, substrate effects, evaporation or measurement error. Test your water and follow reliable aquarium-care guidance.":"यह एक मिश्रण अनुमान है, पीएच या प्रजाति-देखभाल अनुशंसा नहीं। यह पुनर्खनिजीकरण, बफ़र्स, एसिड, सब्सट्रेट प्रभाव, वाष्पीकरण या माप त्रुटि का मॉडल नहीं बनाता है। अपने पानी का परीक्षण करें और विश्वसनीय एक्वेरियम-देखभाल मार्गदर्शन का पालन करें।","Mixing example":"मिश्रण उदाहरण","How GH/KH mixing works":"GH/KH मिश्रण कैसे काम करता है","Aquarium water mixing questions":"एक्वेरियम जल मिश्रण प्रश्न","Assumptions and limits":"मान्यताएँ और सीमाएँ","What do GH and KH mean?":"GH और KH का क्या मतलब है?","GH is general hardness, mainly dissolved calcium and magnesium. KH is carbonate hardness/alkalinity as reported by your test. They are separate measurements and are not interchangeable.":"GH सामान्य कठोरता है, मुख्य रूप से घुले हुए कैल्शियम और मैग्नीशियम। जैसा कि आपके परीक्षण में बताया गया है, KH कार्बोनेट कठोरता/क्षारीयता है। वे अलग-अलग माप हैं और विनिमेय नहीं हैं।","Does reverse-osmosis water always have zero hardness?":"क्या रिवर्स-ऑस्मोसिस पानी में हमेशा शून्य कठोरता होती है?","No. Enter the GH and KH you actually measured for both sources. The calculator does not silently assume either source is pure water.":"नहीं। वह GH और KH दर्ज करें जिसे आपने वास्तव में दोनों स्रोतों के लिए मापा था। कैलकुलेटर चुपचाप यह नहीं मान लेता कि कोई भी स्रोत शुद्ध पानी है।","Why can my GH and KH targets be incompatible?":"मेरे GH और KH लक्ष्य असंगत क्यों हो सकते हैं?","One blend percentage must satisfy both values. If GH requires a different source ratio from KH, two-source mixing alone cannot reach both targets; the tool reports that instead of making up a recipe.":"एक मिश्रण प्रतिशत को दोनों मानों को संतुष्ट करना होगा। यदि GH को KH से भिन्न स्रोत अनुपात की आवश्यकता होती है, तो दो-स्रोत मिश्रण अकेले दोनों लक्ष्यों तक नहीं पहुंच सकता है; टूल रिपोर्ट करता है कि नुस्खा बनाने के बजाय।","Which units can I convert?":"मैं कौन सी इकाइयों को परिवर्तित कर सकता हूँ?","German degrees (°dH), French degrees (°fH), mg/L as CaCO3 (ppm), and milliequivalents per litre (meq/L). The selected unit applies to every hardness input and result.":"जर्मन डिग्री (°dH), फ़्रेंच डिग्री (°fH), CaCO3 (ppm) के रूप में mg/L, और प्रति लीटर milliequivalents (meq/L)। चयनित इकाई प्रत्येक कठोरता इनपुट और परिणाम पर लागू होती है।","Is this a pH calculator or a fish-care recommendation?":"क्या यह pH कैलकुलेटर है या मछली-देखभाल अनुशंसा है?","No. pH does not mix linearly, and suitable aquarium water depends on species and other chemistry. This tool only estimates GH/KH blend proportions from supplied measurements.":"नहीं। पीएच रैखिक रूप से मिश्रित नहीं होता है, और उपयुक्त एक्वैरियम पानी प्रजातियों और अन्य रसायन शास्त्र पर निर्भर करता है। यह उपकरण केवल आपूर्ति किए गए मापों से जीएच/केएच मिश्रण अनुपात का अनुमान लगाता है।","Water source A":"जल स्रोत ए","Water source B":"जल स्रोत बी","Source A label":"स्रोत ए लेबल","Source B label":"स्रोत बी लेबल","Enter measured GH and KH for each source. For example, source A can be tap water and source B reverse-osmosis water.":"प्रत्येक स्रोत के लिए मापा गया GH और KH दर्ज करें। उदाहरण के लिए, स्रोत ए नल का पानी और स्रोत बी रिवर्स-ऑस्मोसिस पानी हो सकता है।","Hardness unit":"कठोरता इकाई","German degrees (°dH)":"जर्मन डिग्री (°dH)","French degrees (°fH)":"फ़्रेंच डिग्री (°fH)","mg/L as CaCO3 (ppm)":"mg/L CaCO3 (पीपीएम) के रूप में","Milliequivalents per litre (meq/L)":"मिलीइक्विवेलेंट्स प्रति लीटर (meq/L)","General hardness (GH)":"सामान्य कठोरता (जीएच)","Carbonate hardness (KH)":"कार्बोनेट कठोरता (KH)","Target water":"लक्ष्य जल","Final batch volume (litres)":"अंतिम बैच मात्रा (लीटर)","Calculate blend":"मिश्रण की गणना करें","Clear values":"मान साफ़ करें","Enter both water sources and your target GH/KH.":"जल स्रोत और अपना लक्ष्य GH/KH दोनों दर्ज करें।","Both target values can be reached with one blend ratio.":"दोनों लक्ष्य मानों तक एक मिश्रण अनुपात के साथ पहुंचा जा सकता है।","GH and KH require different blend ratios; these two sources cannot reach both targets together.":"GH और KH को अलग-अलग मिश्रण अनुपात की आवश्यकता होती है; ये दोनों स्रोत एक साथ दोनों लक्ष्यों तक नहीं पहुंच सकते।","At least one target is outside the range between the two source waters.":"कम से कम एक लक्ष्य दो स्रोत जल के बीच की सीमा से बाहर है।","Source A volume":"स्रोत ए वॉल्यूम","Source B volume":"स्रोत बी वॉल्यूम","Source A share":"स्रोत ए शेयर","Predicted blend":"अनुमानित मिश्रण","Predicted GH":"अनुमानित GH","Predicted KH":"अनुमानित KH","Source A share required by GH":"स्रोत GH द्वारा आवश्यक एक शेयर","Source A share required by KH":"स्रोत केएच द्वारा आवश्यक एक शेयर","Comparison tolerance":"तुलना सहनशीलता","Unit conversion: 1 °dH = 17.848 mg/L CaCO3; 1 °fH = 10 mg/L CaCO3; 1 meq/L = 50 mg/L CaCO3.":"इकाई रूपांतरण: 1 °dH = 17.848 mg/L CaCO3; 1 °fH = 10 mg/L CaCO3; 1 meq/L = 50 mg/L CaCO3।","All calculations run locally in this browser; no water measurements are uploaded.":"सभी गणनाएँ इस ब्राउज़र में स्थानीय रूप से चलती हैं; कोई जल माप अपलोड नहीं किया गया है.","Check the values: hardness must be 0–10,000 and final volume 0–100,000 litres.":"मानों की जांच करें: कठोरता 0–10,000 और अंतिम मात्रा 0–100,000 लीटर होनी चाहिए।","Unit conversion factors":"यूनिट रूपांतरण कारक","mg/L as CaCO3":"mg/L CaCO3 के रूप में","meq/L":"meq/L","A compatible result is an estimate within 0.05 °dH; real test kits and water chemistry have measurement variation.":"एक संगत परिणाम 0.05 °dH के भीतर एक अनुमान है; वास्तविक परीक्षण किट और जल रसायन में माप भिन्नता होती है।"},"id":{"Aquarium Water Mixing Calculator":"Kalkulator Pencampuran Air Akuarium","Aquarium Water Mixing Calculator — Free GH & KH Planner":"Kalkulator Pencampuran Air Akuarium — Perencana GH & KH Gratis","Mix two water sources by measured GH and KH. Convert German, French, ppm and meq/L hardness units, check if both targets are compatible, and calculate litres locally.":"Campurkan dua sumber air dengan mengukur GH dan KH. Konversikan satuan kekerasan Jerman, Prancis, ppm, dan meq/L, periksa apakah kedua target kompatibel, dan hitung liter secara lokal.","Plan an aquarium water blend from two measured sources. The calculator solves general hardness (GH) and carbonate hardness (KH) together, rather than assuming reverse-osmosis water is exactly zero.":"Rencanakan campuran air akuarium dari dua sumber terukur. Kalkulator ini menyelesaikan kesadahan umum (GH) dan kesadahan karbonat (KH) secara bersamaan, daripada mengasumsikan air osmosis balik sama persis dengan nol.","Example: mix tap water at GH 10 / KH 5 with RO water at GH 0 / KH 0. A 50% blend produces about GH 5 / KH 2.5; a different pair of targets may require incompatible blend ratios.":"Contoh: campurkan air keran pada GH 10 / KH 5 dengan air RO pada GH 0 / KH 0. Campuran 50% menghasilkan sekitar GH 5 / KH 2.5; sepasang target yang berbeda mungkin memerlukan rasio campuran yang tidak kompatibel.","Each hardness value is converted to German degrees for calculation. GH and KH are treated as linearly mixable measured concentrations; the tool checks both independently and only gives a water recipe when the two results agree within 0.05 °dH.":"Setiap nilai kekerasan dikonversi ke derajat Jerman untuk perhitungan. GH dan KH diperlakukan sebagai konsentrasi terukur yang dapat dicampur secara linier; alat memeriksa keduanya secara mandiri dan hanya memberikan resep air jika kedua hasil sesuai dalam 0.05 °dH.","This is a mixing estimate, not a pH or species-care recommendation. It does not model remineralization, buffers, acids, substrate effects, evaporation or measurement error. Test your water and follow reliable aquarium-care guidance.":"Ini adalah perkiraan pencampuran, bukan rekomendasi pH atau perawatan spesies. Itu tidak memodelkan remineralisasi, buffer, asam, efek substrat, penguapan atau kesalahan pengukuran. Uji air Anda dan ikuti panduan perawatan akuarium yang andal.","Mixing example":"Contoh pencampuran","How GH/KH mixing works":"Cara kerja pencampuran GH/KH","Aquarium water mixing questions":"Soal pencampuran air akuarium","Assumptions and limits":"Asumsi dan batasan","What do GH and KH mean?":"Apa yang dimaksud dengan GH dan KH?","GH is general hardness, mainly dissolved calcium and magnesium. KH is carbonate hardness/alkalinity as reported by your test. They are separate measurements and are not interchangeable.":"GH adalah kekerasan umum, terutama kalsium dan magnesium terlarut. KH adalah kekerasan/alkalinitas karbonat seperti yang dilaporkan oleh pengujian Anda. Pengukurannya terpisah dan tidak dapat dipertukarkan.","Does reverse-osmosis water always have zero hardness?":"Apakah air osmosis balik selalu tidak memiliki kesadahan?","No. Enter the GH and KH you actually measured for both sources. The calculator does not silently assume either source is pure water.":"Tidak. Masukkan GH dan KH yang sebenarnya Anda ukur untuk kedua sumber. Kalkulator tidak secara diam-diam berasumsi bahwa sumber mana pun adalah air murni.","Why can my GH and KH targets be incompatible?":"Mengapa target GH dan KH saya bisa tidak sesuai?","One blend percentage must satisfy both values. If GH requires a different source ratio from KH, two-source mixing alone cannot reach both targets; the tool reports that instead of making up a recipe.":"Satu persentase campuran harus memenuhi kedua nilai. Jika GH memerlukan rasio sumber yang berbeda dari KH, pencampuran dua sumber saja tidak dapat mencapai kedua target; alat tersebut melaporkan hal itu alih-alih membuat resep.","Which units can I convert?":"Unit manakah yang dapat saya konversi?","German degrees (°dH), French degrees (°fH), mg/L as CaCO3 (ppm), and milliequivalents per litre (meq/L). The selected unit applies to every hardness input and result.":"Derajat Jerman (°dH), derajat Prancis (°fH), mg/L sebagai CaCO3 (ppm), dan miliekuivalen per liter (meq/L). Satuan yang dipilih berlaku untuk setiap masukan dan hasil kekerasan.","Is this a pH calculator or a fish-care recommendation?":"Apakah ini kalkulator pH atau rekomendasi perawatan ikan?","No. pH does not mix linearly, and suitable aquarium water depends on species and other chemistry. This tool only estimates GH/KH blend proportions from supplied measurements.":"Tidak. pH tidak bercampur secara linier, dan air akuarium yang cocok bergantung pada spesies dan bahan kimia lainnya. Alat ini hanya memperkirakan proporsi campuran GH/KH dari pengukuran yang disediakan.","Water source A":"Sumber air A","Water source B":"Sumber air B","Source A label":"Sumber label A","Source B label":"Label sumber B","Enter measured GH and KH for each source. For example, source A can be tap water and source B reverse-osmosis water.":"Masukkan GH dan KH terukur untuk setiap sumber. Misalnya, sumber A dapat berupa air keran dan sumber B adalah air osmosis balik.","Hardness unit":"Satuan kekerasan","German degrees (°dH)":"Derajat Jerman (°dH)","French degrees (°fH)":"Derajat Prancis (°fH)","mg/L as CaCO3 (ppm)":"mg/L sebagai CaCO3 (ppm)","Milliequivalents per litre (meq/L)":"Milliekuivalen per liter (meq/L)","General hardness (GH)":"Kekerasan umum (GH)","Carbonate hardness (KH)":"Kesadahan karbonat (KH)","Target water":"Targetkan air","Final batch volume (litres)":"Volume batch akhir (liter)","Calculate blend":"Hitung campuran","Clear values":"Nilai yang jelas","Enter both water sources and your target GH/KH.":"Masukkan sumber air dan target GH/KH Anda.","Both target values can be reached with one blend ratio.":"Kedua nilai target dapat dicapai dengan satu rasio campuran.","GH and KH require different blend ratios; these two sources cannot reach both targets together.":"GH dan KH memerlukan rasio campuran yang berbeda; kedua sumber ini tidak dapat mencapai kedua target secara bersamaan.","At least one target is outside the range between the two source waters.":"Setidaknya satu target berada di luar jangkauan antara dua sumber air.","Source A volume":"Sumber volume A","Source B volume":"Volume sumber B","Source A share":"Sumber Bagikan","Predicted blend":"Campuran yang diprediksi","Predicted GH":"Prediksi GH","Predicted KH":"Diprediksi KH","Source A share required by GH":"Sumber Bagian yang dibutuhkan oleh GH","Source A share required by KH":"Sumber Suatu bagian yang dibutuhkan oleh KH","Comparison tolerance":"Toleransi perbandingan","Unit conversion: 1 °dH = 17.848 mg/L CaCO3; 1 °fH = 10 mg/L CaCO3; 1 meq/L = 50 mg/L CaCO3.":"Konversi satuan: 1 °dH = 17.848 mg/L CaCO3; 1 °fH = 10 mg/L CaCO3; 1 meq/L = 50 mg/L CaCO3.","All calculations run locally in this browser; no water measurements are uploaded.":"Semua penghitungan dijalankan secara lokal di browser ini; tidak ada pengukuran air yang diunggah.","Check the values: hardness must be 0–10,000 and final volume 0–100,000 litres.":"Periksa nilainya: kekerasan harus 0–10,000 dan volume akhir 0–100,000 liter.","Unit conversion factors":"Faktor konversi satuan","mg/L as CaCO3":"mg/L sebagai CaCO3","meq/L":"meq/L","A compatible result is an estimate within 0.05 °dH; real test kits and water chemistry have measurement variation.":"Hasil yang kompatibel adalah perkiraan dalam 0.05 °dH; alat tes nyata dan kimia air memiliki variasi pengukuran."},"it":{"Aquarium Water Mixing Calculator":"Calcolatore per la miscelazione dell'acqua dell'acquario","Aquarium Water Mixing Calculator — Free GH & KH Planner":"Calcola la miscelazione dell'acqua dell'acquario: pianificatore GH e KH gratuito","Mix two water sources by measured GH and KH. Convert German, French, ppm and meq/L hardness units, check if both targets are compatible, and calculate litres locally.":"Mescolare due fonti d'acqua in base al GH e al KH misurati. Converti unità di durezza tedesche, francesi, ppm e meq/L, controlla se entrambi gli obiettivi sono compatibili e calcola i litri localmente.","Plan an aquarium water blend from two measured sources. The calculator solves general hardness (GH) and carbonate hardness (KH) together, rather than assuming reverse-osmosis water is exactly zero.":"Pianifica una miscela di acqua dell'acquario da due fonti misurate. Il calcolatore risolve insieme la durezza generale (GH) e la durezza carbonatica (KH), anziché presupporre che l'acqua ad osmosi inversa sia esattamente zero.","Example: mix tap water at GH 10 / KH 5 with RO water at GH 0 / KH 0. A 50% blend produces about GH 5 / KH 2.5; a different pair of targets may require incompatible blend ratios.":"Esempio: mescolare l'acqua del rubinetto a GH 10 / KH 5 con acqua RO a GH 0 / KH 0. Una miscela 50% produce circa GH 5 / KH 2.5; una diversa coppia di target potrebbe richiedere rapporti di miscelazione incompatibili.","Each hardness value is converted to German degrees for calculation. GH and KH are treated as linearly mixable measured concentrations; the tool checks both independently and only gives a water recipe when the two results agree within 0.05 °dH.":"Ogni valore di durezza viene convertito in gradi tedeschi per il calcolo. GH e KH sono trattati come concentrazioni misurate linearmente miscelabili; lo strumento li controlla entrambi in modo indipendente e fornisce una ricetta dell'acqua solo quando i due risultati coincidono entro 0.05 °dH.","This is a mixing estimate, not a pH or species-care recommendation. It does not model remineralization, buffers, acids, substrate effects, evaporation or measurement error. Test your water and follow reliable aquarium-care guidance.":"Questa è una stima di miscelazione, non una raccomandazione sul pH o sulla cura della specie. Non modella la rimineralizzazione, i tamponi, gli acidi, gli effetti del substrato, l'evaporazione o l'errore di misurazione. Testa la tua acqua e segui una guida affidabile per la cura dell'acquario.","Mixing example":"Esempio di miscelazione","How GH/KH mixing works":"Come funziona la miscelazione GH/KH","Aquarium water mixing questions":"Domande sulla miscelazione dell'acqua dell'acquario","Assumptions and limits":"Presupposti e limiti","What do GH and KH mean?":"Cosa significano GH e KH?","GH is general hardness, mainly dissolved calcium and magnesium. KH is carbonate hardness/alkalinity as reported by your test. They are separate measurements and are not interchangeable.":"GH è la durezza generale, principalmente calcio e magnesio disciolti. KH è la durezza carbonatica/alcalinità riportata dal test. Sono misurazioni separate e non sono intercambiabili.","Does reverse-osmosis water always have zero hardness?":"L'acqua ad osmosi inversa ha sempre durezza pari a zero?","No. Enter the GH and KH you actually measured for both sources. The calculator does not silently assume either source is pure water.":"N. Inserisci il GH e il KH effettivamente misurati per entrambe le fonti. Il calcolatore non presuppone silenziosamente che nessuna delle fonti sia acqua pura.","Why can my GH and KH targets be incompatible?":"Perché i miei obiettivi GH e KH possono essere incompatibili?","One blend percentage must satisfy both values. If GH requires a different source ratio from KH, two-source mixing alone cannot reach both targets; the tool reports that instead of making up a recipe.":"Una percentuale di miscela deve soddisfare entrambi i valori. Se il GH richiede un rapporto di sorgente diverso da KH, la sola miscelazione di due sorgenti non può raggiungere entrambi gli obiettivi; lo strumento lo segnala invece di inventare una ricetta.","Which units can I convert?":"Quali unità posso convertire?","German degrees (°dH), French degrees (°fH), mg/L as CaCO3 (ppm), and milliequivalents per litre (meq/L). The selected unit applies to every hardness input and result.":"Gradi tedeschi (°dH), gradi francesi (°fH), mg/L come CaCO3 (ppm) e milliequivalenti per litro (meq/L). L'unità selezionata si applica a ogni input e risultato di durezza.","Is this a pH calculator or a fish-care recommendation?":"È un calcolatore del pH o un consiglio per la cura del pesce?","No. pH does not mix linearly, and suitable aquarium water depends on species and other chemistry. This tool only estimates GH/KH blend proportions from supplied measurements.":"N. Il pH non si miscela in modo lineare e l'acqua dell'acquario adatta dipende dalle specie e da altri prodotti chimici. Questo strumento stima solo le proporzioni della miscela GH/KH dalle misurazioni fornite.","Water source A":"Fonte d'acqua A","Water source B":"Fonte d'acqua B","Source A label":"Etichetta origine A","Source B label":"Etichetta sorgente B","Enter measured GH and KH for each source. For example, source A can be tap water and source B reverse-osmosis water.":"Inserisci GH e KH misurati per ciascuna fonte. Ad esempio, la fonte A può essere acqua di rubinetto e la fonte B acqua ad osmosi inversa.","Hardness unit":"Unità di durezza","German degrees (°dH)":"Gradi tedeschi (°dH)","French degrees (°fH)":"Gradi francesi (°fH)","mg/L as CaCO3 (ppm)":"mg/L come CaCO3 (ppm)","Milliequivalents per litre (meq/L)":"Milliequivalenti per litro (meq/L)","General hardness (GH)":"Durezza generale (GH)","Carbonate hardness (KH)":"Durezza carbonatica (KH)","Target water":"Acqua target","Final batch volume (litres)":"Volume batch finale (litri)","Calculate blend":"Calcola la miscela","Clear values":"Cancella valori","Enter both water sources and your target GH/KH.":"Inserisci entrambe le fonti d'acqua e il tuo target GH/KH.","Both target values can be reached with one blend ratio.":"Entrambi i valori target possono essere raggiunti con un unico rapporto di miscelazione.","GH and KH require different blend ratios; these two sources cannot reach both targets together.":"GH e KH richiedono rapporti di miscelazione diversi; queste due fonti non possono raggiungere entrambi gli obiettivi insieme.","At least one target is outside the range between the two source waters.":"Almeno un target è fuori dall'intervallo tra le due acque di origine.","Source A volume":"Volume di origine A","Source B volume":"Volume sorgente B","Source A share":"Origine Condivisione A","Predicted blend":"Miscela prevista","Predicted GH":"GH previsto","Predicted KH":"KH previsto","Source A share required by GH":"Origine Una condivisione richiesta da GH","Source A share required by KH":"Origine Una condivisione richiesta da KH","Comparison tolerance":"Tolleranza di confronto","Unit conversion: 1 °dH = 17.848 mg/L CaCO3; 1 °fH = 10 mg/L CaCO3; 1 meq/L = 50 mg/L CaCO3.":"Conversione unità: 1 °dH = 17.848 mg/L CaCO3; 1 °fH = 10 mg/L CaCO3; 1 meq/L = 50 mg/L CaCO3.","All calculations run locally in this browser; no water measurements are uploaded.":"Tutti i calcoli vengono eseguiti localmente in questo browser; non vengono caricate misurazioni dell'acqua.","Check the values: hardness must be 0–10,000 and final volume 0–100,000 litres.":"Verificare i valori: la durezza deve essere 0–10,000 e il volume finale 0–100,000 litri.","Unit conversion factors":"Fattori di conversione delle unità","mg/L as CaCO3":"mg/L come CaCO3","meq/L":"meq/l","A compatible result is an estimate within 0.05 °dH; real test kits and water chemistry have measurement variation.":"Un risultato compatibile è una stima entro 0.05 °dH; i kit di test reali e la chimica dell'acqua presentano variazioni di misurazione."},"ja":{"Aquarium Water Mixing Calculator":"水族館の水混合計算機","Aquarium Water Mixing Calculator — Free GH & KH Planner":"水族館の水混合計算ツール — 無料の GH & KH プランナー","Mix two water sources by measured GH and KH. Convert German, French, ppm and meq/L hardness units, check if both targets are compatible, and calculate litres locally.":"測定された GH と KH によって 2 つの水源を混合します。ドイツ語、フランス語、ppm、meq/L の硬度単位を変換し、両方のターゲットに互換性があるかどうかを確認し、ローカルでリットルを計算します。","Plan an aquarium water blend from two measured sources. The calculator solves general hardness (GH) and carbonate hardness (KH) together, rather than assuming reverse-osmosis water is exactly zero.":"2 つの測定された水源からの水族館の水のブレンドを計画します。この計算機は、逆浸透水が正確にゼロであると仮定するのではなく、一般硬度 (GH) と炭酸塩硬度 (KH) を一緒に計算します。","Example: mix tap water at GH 10 / KH 5 with RO water at GH 0 / KH 0. A 50% blend produces about GH 5 / KH 2.5; a different pair of targets may require incompatible blend ratios.":"例: GH 10 / KH 5 の水道水と GH 0 / KH 0 の RO 水とを混合します。 50% ブレンドでは、約 GH 5 / KH 2.5 が生成されます。異なるターゲットのペアでは、互換性のないブレンド比が必要になる場合があります。","Each hardness value is converted to German degrees for calculation. GH and KH are treated as linearly mixable measured concentrations; the tool checks both independently and only gives a water recipe when the two results agree within 0.05 °dH.":"各硬度値は計算のためにドイツ度に変換されます。 GH と KH は、直線的に混合可能な測定濃度として扱われます。このツールは両方を独立してチェックし、2 つの結果が 0.05 °dH 以内で一致する場合にのみ、水のレシピを提供します。","This is a mixing estimate, not a pH or species-care recommendation. It does not model remineralization, buffers, acids, substrate effects, evaporation or measurement error. Test your water and follow reliable aquarium-care guidance.":"これは混合の推定値であり、pH や種の管理に関する推奨事項ではありません。再石灰化、緩衝液、酸、基質効果、蒸発、または測定誤差はモデル化されません。水をテストし、信頼できる水槽管理ガイドに従ってください。","Mixing example":"混合例","How GH/KH mixing works":"GH/KH 混合の仕組み","Aquarium water mixing questions":"水族館の水の混合に関する質問","Assumptions and limits":"仮定と制限","What do GH and KH mean?":"GH と KH は何を意味しますか?","GH is general hardness, mainly dissolved calcium and magnesium. KH is carbonate hardness/alkalinity as reported by your test. They are separate measurements and are not interchangeable.":"GH は、主にカルシウムとマグネシウムが溶け込んだ一般的な硬度です。 KH は、テストで報告された炭酸塩硬度/アルカリ度です。これらは個別の測定値であり、互換性はありません。","Does reverse-osmosis water always have zero hardness?":"逆浸透水は常に硬度ゼロですか?","No. Enter the GH and KH you actually measured for both sources. The calculator does not silently assume either source is pure water.":"いいえ。両方のソースについて実際に測定した GH と KH を入力します。計算機は、どちらの供給源も純水であると黙って仮定することはありません。","Why can my GH and KH targets be incompatible?":"GH ターゲットと KH ターゲットに互換性がないのはなぜですか?","One blend percentage must satisfy both values. If GH requires a different source ratio from KH, two-source mixing alone cannot reach both targets; the tool reports that instead of making up a recipe.":"1 つのブレンド パーセントが両方の値を満たす必要があります。 GH が KH とは異なるソース比を必要とする場合、2 つのソースを混合するだけでは両方の目標を達成することはできません。このツールはレシピを作成するのではなく、それを報告します。","Which units can I convert?":"どの単位を変換できますか?","German degrees (°dH), French degrees (°fH), mg/L as CaCO3 (ppm), and milliequivalents per litre (meq/L). The selected unit applies to every hardness input and result.":"ドイツ度 (°dH)、フランス度 (°fH)、CaCO3 (ppm) としての mg/L、およびリットルあたりのミリ当量 (meq/L)。選択した単位は、すべての硬度の入力と結果に適用されます。","Is this a pH calculator or a fish-care recommendation?":"これは pH 計算機ですか、それとも魚の飼育に関する推奨事項ですか?","No. pH does not mix linearly, and suitable aquarium water depends on species and other chemistry. This tool only estimates GH/KH blend proportions from supplied measurements.":"いいえ。 pH は直線的に混合するわけではなく、適切な水族館の水は種やその他の化学的性質によって異なります。このツールは、提供された測定値から GH/KH ブレンド比率のみを推定します。","Water source A":"水源 A","Water source B":"水源 B","Source A label":"ソース A ラベル","Source B label":"ソース B ラベル","Enter measured GH and KH for each source. For example, source A can be tap water and source B reverse-osmosis water.":"各光源の測定された GH と KH を入力します。たとえば、ソース A は水道水、ソース B は逆浸透水にすることができます。","Hardness unit":"硬度単位","German degrees (°dH)":"ドイツ度 (°dH)","French degrees (°fH)":"フランス度 (°fH)","mg/L as CaCO3 (ppm)":"mg/L as CaCO3 (ppm)","Milliequivalents per litre (meq/L)":"ミリ当量/リットル (meq/L)","General hardness (GH)":"一般硬度(GH)","Carbonate hardness (KH)":"炭酸塩硬度 (KH)","Target water":"対象水","Final batch volume (litres)":"最終バッチ量 (リットル)","Calculate blend":"ブレンドの計算","Clear values":"値をクリア","Enter both water sources and your target GH/KH.":"水源とターゲット GH/KH の両方を入力します。","Both target values can be reached with one blend ratio.":"1 つのブレンド比で両方の目標値を達成できます。","GH and KH require different blend ratios; these two sources cannot reach both targets together.":"GH と KH は異なるブレンド比を必要とします。これら 2 つのソースは両方のターゲットに同時に到達することはできません。","At least one target is outside the range between the two source waters.":"少なくとも 1 つのターゲットが 2 つの源水域間の範囲外にあります。","Source A volume":"ソース A ボリューム","Source B volume":"ソース B ボリューム","Source A share":"ソース A シェア","Predicted blend":"予測ブレンド","Predicted GH":"予測された GH","Predicted KH":"予測された KH","Source A share required by GH":"GH が必要とするソース A シェア","Source A share required by KH":"KH が必要とするソース A シェア","Comparison tolerance":"比較許容差","Unit conversion: 1 °dH = 17.848 mg/L CaCO3; 1 °fH = 10 mg/L CaCO3; 1 meq/L = 50 mg/L CaCO3.":"単位換算: 1 °dH = 17.848 mg/L CaCO3; 1 °fH = 10 mg/L CaCO3; 1 meq/L = 50 mg/L CaCO3。","All calculations run locally in this browser; no water measurements are uploaded.":"すべての計算はこのブラウザでローカルに実行されます。水の測定値はアップロードされません。","Check the values: hardness must be 0–10,000 and final volume 0–100,000 litres.":"値を確認してください: 硬度は 0 ～ 10,000、最終体積は 0 ～ 100,000 リットルである必要があります。","Unit conversion factors":"単位換算係数","mg/L as CaCO3":"mg/L as CaCO3","meq/L":"meq/L","A compatible result is an estimate within 0.05 °dH; real test kits and water chemistry have measurement variation.":"互換性のある結果は、0.05 °dH 以内の推定値です。実際の検査キットと水の化学には測定値のばらつきがあります。"},"ko":{"Aquarium Water Mixing Calculator":"수족관 물 혼합 계산기","Aquarium Water Mixing Calculator — Free GH & KH Planner":"수족관 물 혼합 계산기 — 무료 GH & KH 플래너","Mix two water sources by measured GH and KH. Convert German, French, ppm and meq/L hardness units, check if both targets are compatible, and calculate litres locally.":"측정된 GH와 KH를 통해 두 가지 수원을 혼합합니다. 독일어, 프랑스어, ppm 및 meq/L 경도 단위를 변환하고 두 목표가 호환되는지 확인하고 로컬에서 리터를 계산합니다.","Plan an aquarium water blend from two measured sources. The calculator solves general hardness (GH) and carbonate hardness (KH) together, rather than assuming reverse-osmosis water is exactly zero.":"두 개의 측정된 소스에서 수족관 물 혼합을 계획합니다. 계산기는 역삼투압 물이 정확히 0이라고 가정하는 대신 일반 경도(GH)와 탄산염 경도(KH)를 함께 계산합니다.","Example: mix tap water at GH 10 / KH 5 with RO water at GH 0 / KH 0. A 50% blend produces about GH 5 / KH 2.5; a different pair of targets may require incompatible blend ratios.":"예: GH 10 / KH 5의 수돗물과 GH 0 / KH 0의 RO 물을 혼합합니다. 50% 블렌드는 약 GH 5/KH 2.5를 생산하며; 서로 다른 대상 쌍에는 호환되지 않는 혼합 비율이 필요할 수 있습니다.","Each hardness value is converted to German degrees for calculation. GH and KH are treated as linearly mixable measured concentrations; the tool checks both independently and only gives a water recipe when the two results agree within 0.05 °dH.":"각 경도 값은 계산을 위해 독일 도로 변환됩니다. GH와 KH는 선형적으로 혼합 가능한 측정 농도로 처리됩니다. 도구는 두 가지를 독립적으로 확인하고 두 결과가 0.05 °dH 내에서 일치하는 경우에만 물 레시피를 제공합니다.","This is a mixing estimate, not a pH or species-care recommendation. It does not model remineralization, buffers, acids, substrate effects, evaporation or measurement error. Test your water and follow reliable aquarium-care guidance.":"이것은 혼합 추정치이며 pH 또는 종 관리 권장 사항이 아닙니다. 재석회화, 완충액, 산, 기질 효과, 증발 또는 측정 오류를 모델링하지 않습니다. 물을 테스트하고 신뢰할 수 있는 수족관 관리 지침을 따르십시오.","Mixing example":"믹싱 예","How GH/KH mixing works":"GH/KH 혼합 작동 방식","Aquarium water mixing questions":"수족관 물 혼합 질문","Assumptions and limits":"가정 및 제한","What do GH and KH mean?":"GH와 KH는 무엇을 의미합니까?","GH is general hardness, mainly dissolved calcium and magnesium. KH is carbonate hardness/alkalinity as reported by your test. They are separate measurements and are not interchangeable.":"GH는 일반적인 경도로 주로 용해된 칼슘과 마그네슘을 의미합니다. KH는 테스트에서 보고된 탄산염 경도/알칼리도입니다. 이는 별도의 측정값이므로 서로 바꿔 사용할 수 없습니다.","Does reverse-osmosis water always have zero hardness?":"역삼투수는 항상 경도가 0입니까?","No. Enter the GH and KH you actually measured for both sources. The calculator does not silently assume either source is pure water.":"아니요. 두 소스에 대해 실제로 측정한 GH와 KH를 입력합니다. 계산기는 어느 소스도 순수한 물이라고 자동으로 가정하지 않습니다.","Why can my GH and KH targets be incompatible?":"내 GH 및 KH 대상이 호환되지 않는 이유는 무엇입니까?","One blend percentage must satisfy both values. If GH requires a different source ratio from KH, two-source mixing alone cannot reach both targets; the tool reports that instead of making up a recipe.":"하나의 혼합 비율이 두 값을 모두 충족해야 합니다. GH가 KH와 다른 소스 비율을 요구하는 경우 두 소스 혼합만으로는 두 목표에 모두 도달할 수 없습니다. 도구는 레시피를 구성하는 대신 이를 보고합니다.","Which units can I convert?":"어떤 단위를 변환할 수 있습니까?","German degrees (°dH), French degrees (°fH), mg/L as CaCO3 (ppm), and milliequivalents per litre (meq/L). The selected unit applies to every hardness input and result.":"독일 온도(°dH), 프랑스 온도(°fH), mg/L(CaCO3)(ppm) 및 리터당 밀리당량(meq/L). 선택한 단위는 모든 경도 입력 및 결과에 적용됩니다.","Is this a pH calculator or a fish-care recommendation?":"이것은 pH 계산기입니까 아니면 어류 관리 권장 사항입니까?","No. pH does not mix linearly, and suitable aquarium water depends on species and other chemistry. This tool only estimates GH/KH blend proportions from supplied measurements.":"아니요. pH는 선형적으로 혼합되지 않으며 적합한 수족관 물은 종 및 기타 화학 물질에 따라 다릅니다. 이 도구는 제공된 측정값에서 GH/KH 혼합 비율만 추정합니다.","Water source A":"수원 A","Water source B":"수원 B","Source A label":"소스 A 레이블","Source B label":"소스 B 레이블","Enter measured GH and KH for each source. For example, source A can be tap water and source B reverse-osmosis water.":"각 소스에 대해 측정된 GH 및 KH를 입력하세요. 예를 들어, 소스 A는 수돗물이고 소스 B는 역삼투수일 수 있습니다.","Hardness unit":"경도 단위","German degrees (°dH)":"독일 온도(°dH)","French degrees (°fH)":"프랑스 각도(°fH)","mg/L as CaCO3 (ppm)":"mg/L(CaCO3(ppm))","Milliequivalents per litre (meq/L)":"리터당 밀리당량(meq/L)","General hardness (GH)":"일반경도(GH)","Carbonate hardness (KH)":"탄산염 경도(KH)","Target water":"목표수","Final batch volume (litres)":"최종 배치 볼륨(리터)","Calculate blend":"혼합 계산","Clear values":"값 지우기","Enter both water sources and your target GH/KH.":"수원과 목표 GH/KH를 모두 입력하세요.","Both target values can be reached with one blend ratio.":"하나의 혼합 비율로 두 목표 값 모두에 도달할 수 있습니다.","GH and KH require different blend ratios; these two sources cannot reach both targets together.":"GH와 KH에는 서로 다른 혼합 비율이 필요합니다. 이 두 소스는 두 목표에 동시에 도달할 수 없습니다.","At least one target is outside the range between the two source waters.":"적어도 하나의 대상이 두 원수 사이의 범위 밖에 있습니다.","Source A volume":"소스 A 볼륨","Source B volume":"소스 B 볼륨","Source A share":"소스 A 공유","Predicted blend":"예측된 혼합","Predicted GH":"GH 예측","Predicted KH":"KH를 예측함","Source A share required by GH":"소스 GH에 필요한 A 공유","Source A share required by KH":"소스 KH에서 요구하는 A 공유","Comparison tolerance":"비교 공차","Unit conversion: 1 °dH = 17.848 mg/L CaCO3; 1 °fH = 10 mg/L CaCO3; 1 meq/L = 50 mg/L CaCO3.":"단위 변환: 1 °dH = 17.848 mg/L CaCO3; 1 °fH = 10 mg/L CaCO3; 1 meq/L = 50 mg/L CaCO3.","All calculations run locally in this browser; no water measurements are uploaded.":"모든 계산은 이 브라우저에서 로컬로 실행됩니다. 물 측정값은 업로드되지 않습니다.","Check the values: hardness must be 0–10,000 and final volume 0–100,000 litres.":"값 확인: 경도는 0–10,000 및 최종 볼륨 0–100,000 리터여야 합니다.","Unit conversion factors":"단위 변환 계수","mg/L as CaCO3":"mg/L(CaCO3)","meq/L":"meq/L","A compatible result is an estimate within 0.05 °dH; real test kits and water chemistry have measurement variation.":"호환 가능한 결과는 0.05 °dH 이내의 추정치입니다. 실제 테스트 키트와 수질 화학에는 측정 변화가 있습니다."},"mr":{"Aquarium Water Mixing Calculator":"एक्वेरियम वॉटर मिक्सिंग कॅल्क्युलेटर","Aquarium Water Mixing Calculator — Free GH & KH Planner":"एक्वेरियम वॉटर मिक्सिंग कॅल्क्युलेटर - मोफत जीएच आणि केएच प्लॅनर","Mix two water sources by measured GH and KH. Convert German, French, ppm and meq/L hardness units, check if both targets are compatible, and calculate litres locally.":"GH आणि KH मोजून दोन जलस्रोत मिसळा. जर्मन, फ्रेंच, ppm आणि meq/L कठोरता युनिट्समध्ये रूपांतरित करा, दोन्ही लक्ष्ये सुसंगत आहेत का ते तपासा आणि स्थानिक पातळीवर लिटरची गणना करा.","Plan an aquarium water blend from two measured sources. The calculator solves general hardness (GH) and carbonate hardness (KH) together, rather than assuming reverse-osmosis water is exactly zero.":"दोन मोजलेल्या स्रोतांमधून एक्वैरियम वॉटर मिश्रणाची योजना करा. कॅल्क्युलेटर रिव्हर्स-ऑस्मोसिस पाणी अगदी शून्य आहे असे गृहीत धरण्याऐवजी सामान्य कडकपणा (GH) आणि कार्बोनेट कठोरता (KH) एकत्र सोडवतो.","Example: mix tap water at GH 10 / KH 5 with RO water at GH 0 / KH 0. A 50% blend produces about GH 5 / KH 2.5; a different pair of targets may require incompatible blend ratios.":"उदाहरण: GH 10 / KH 5 येथे नळाचे पाणी GH 0 / KH 0 येथे RO पाण्यामध्ये मिसळा. एक 50% मिश्रण सुमारे GH 5 / KH 2.5 तयार करते; लक्ष्यांच्या भिन्न जोडीला विसंगत मिश्रण गुणोत्तरांची आवश्यकता असू शकते.","Each hardness value is converted to German degrees for calculation. GH and KH are treated as linearly mixable measured concentrations; the tool checks both independently and only gives a water recipe when the two results agree within 0.05 °dH.":"गणनेसाठी प्रत्येक कडकपणाचे मूल्य जर्मन अंशांमध्ये रूपांतरित केले जाते. GH आणि KH ला रेखीय मिसळता येण्याजोग्या मोजलेल्या एकाग्रता मानल्या जातात; साधन दोन्ही स्वतंत्रपणे तपासते आणि जेव्हा दोन परिणाम 0.05 °dH मध्ये सहमत असतील तेव्हाच पाण्याची रेसिपी देते.","This is a mixing estimate, not a pH or species-care recommendation. It does not model remineralization, buffers, acids, substrate effects, evaporation or measurement error. Test your water and follow reliable aquarium-care guidance.":"हा मिक्सिंग अंदाज आहे, pH किंवा प्रजाती-काळजीची शिफारस नाही. हे पुनर्खनिजीकरण, बफर, ऍसिड, सब्सट्रेट इफेक्ट्स, बाष्पीभवन किंवा मापन त्रुटीचे मॉडेल करत नाही. तुमच्या पाण्याची चाचणी करा आणि विश्वासार्ह मत्स्यालय-काळजी मार्गदर्शनाचे अनुसरण करा.","Mixing example":"मिश्रण उदाहरण","How GH/KH mixing works":"GH/KH मिक्सिंग कसे कार्य करते","Aquarium water mixing questions":"एक्वेरियम वॉटर मिक्सिंग प्रश्न","Assumptions and limits":"गृहीतके आणि मर्यादा","What do GH and KH mean?":"GH आणि KH चा अर्थ काय आहे?","GH is general hardness, mainly dissolved calcium and magnesium. KH is carbonate hardness/alkalinity as reported by your test. They are separate measurements and are not interchangeable.":"GH म्हणजे सामान्य कडकपणा, प्रामुख्याने विरघळलेले कॅल्शियम आणि मॅग्नेशियम. KH म्हणजे तुमच्या चाचणीने नोंदवल्यानुसार कार्बोनेट कडकपणा/क्षारता. ते वेगळे मोजमाप आहेत आणि अदलाबदल करण्यायोग्य नाहीत.","Does reverse-osmosis water always have zero hardness?":"रिव्हर्स ऑस्मोसिस पाण्यामध्ये नेहमी शून्य कठोरता असते का?","No. Enter the GH and KH you actually measured for both sources. The calculator does not silently assume either source is pure water.":"नं. दोन्ही स्त्रोतांसाठी तुम्ही प्रत्यक्षात मोजलेले GH आणि KH प्रविष्ट करा. कॅल्क्युलेटर कोणताही स्रोत शुद्ध पाणी आहे असे शांतपणे गृहीत धरत नाही.","Why can my GH and KH targets be incompatible?":"माझे GH आणि KH लक्ष्य विसंगत का असू शकतात?","One blend percentage must satisfy both values. If GH requires a different source ratio from KH, two-source mixing alone cannot reach both targets; the tool reports that instead of making up a recipe.":"एक मिश्रण टक्केवारीने दोन्ही मूल्ये पूर्ण करणे आवश्यक आहे. जर GH ला KH पेक्षा भिन्न स्त्रोत गुणोत्तर आवश्यक असेल, तर केवळ दोन-स्रोत मिश्रण दोन्ही लक्ष्यांपर्यंत पोहोचू शकत नाही; साधन रेसिपी बनवण्याऐवजी अहवाल देते.","Which units can I convert?":"मी कोणते युनिट रूपांतरित करू शकतो?","German degrees (°dH), French degrees (°fH), mg/L as CaCO3 (ppm), and milliequivalents per litre (meq/L). The selected unit applies to every hardness input and result.":"जर्मन अंश (°dH), फ्रेंच अंश (°fH), mg/L CaCO3 (ppm) म्हणून आणि मिली समतुल्य प्रति लिटर (meq/L). निवडलेले युनिट प्रत्येक कडकपणा इनपुट आणि परिणामांवर लागू होते.","Is this a pH calculator or a fish-care recommendation?":"हे पीएच कॅल्क्युलेटर आहे की फिश-केअर शिफारस आहे?","No. pH does not mix linearly, and suitable aquarium water depends on species and other chemistry. This tool only estimates GH/KH blend proportions from supplied measurements.":"नं. pH रेखीयरित्या मिसळत नाही आणि योग्य मत्स्यालयातील पाणी प्रजाती आणि इतर रसायनांवर अवलंबून असते. हे साधन पुरवलेल्या मोजमापांमधून फक्त GH/KH मिश्रित प्रमाणांचा अंदाज लावते.","Water source A":"जलस्रोत A","Water source B":"जलस्रोत B","Source A label":"स्रोत A लेबल","Source B label":"स्रोत B लेबल","Enter measured GH and KH for each source. For example, source A can be tap water and source B reverse-osmosis water.":"प्रत्येक स्त्रोतासाठी मोजलेले GH आणि KH प्रविष्ट करा. उदाहरणार्थ, स्रोत A हे नळाचे पाणी आणि स्रोत B रिव्हर्स-ऑस्मोसिस पाणी असू शकते.","Hardness unit":"हार्डनेस युनिट","German degrees (°dH)":"जर्मन अंश (°dH)","French degrees (°fH)":"फ्रेंच अंश (°fH)","mg/L as CaCO3 (ppm)":"mg/L CaCO3 (ppm) म्हणून","Milliequivalents per litre (meq/L)":"मिली समतुल्य प्रति लिटर (meq/L)","General hardness (GH)":"सामान्य कडकपणा (GH)","Carbonate hardness (KH)":"कार्बोनेट कडकपणा (KH)","Target water":"लक्ष्य पाणी","Final batch volume (litres)":"अंतिम बॅच व्हॉल्यूम (लिटर)","Calculate blend":"मिश्रणाची गणना करा","Clear values":"मूल्ये साफ करा","Enter both water sources and your target GH/KH.":"पाण्याचे स्त्रोत आणि तुमचे लक्ष्य GH/KH दोन्ही प्रविष्ट करा.","Both target values can be reached with one blend ratio.":"दोन्ही लक्ष्य मूल्ये एका मिश्रण गुणोत्तराने गाठली जाऊ शकतात.","GH and KH require different blend ratios; these two sources cannot reach both targets together.":"GH आणि KH साठी भिन्न मिश्रण गुणोत्तर आवश्यक आहे; हे दोन स्त्रोत एकत्रितपणे दोन्ही लक्ष्यांपर्यंत पोहोचू शकत नाहीत.","At least one target is outside the range between the two source waters.":"किमान एक लक्ष्य दोन स्त्रोतांच्या पाण्याच्या श्रेणीच्या बाहेर आहे.","Source A volume":"स्रोत A खंड","Source B volume":"स्रोत B खंड","Source A share":"स्रोत A शेअर","Predicted blend":"अंदाजित मिश्रण","Predicted GH":"अंदाजित GH","Predicted KH":"अंदाजित KH","Source A share required by GH":"स्रोत GH साठी आवश्यक असलेला शेअर","Source A share required by KH":"KH साठी आवश्यक असलेला एक शेअर","Comparison tolerance":"तुलना सहिष्णुता","Unit conversion: 1 °dH = 17.848 mg/L CaCO3; 1 °fH = 10 mg/L CaCO3; 1 meq/L = 50 mg/L CaCO3.":"युनिट रूपांतरण: 1 °dH = 17.848 mg/L CaCO3; 1 °fH = 10 mg/L CaCO3; 1 meq/L = 50 mg/L CaCO3.","All calculations run locally in this browser; no water measurements are uploaded.":"सर्व गणना या ब्राउझरमध्ये स्थानिक पातळीवर चालतात; पाण्याचे कोणतेही मोजमाप अपलोड केलेले नाही.","Check the values: hardness must be 0–10,000 and final volume 0–100,000 litres.":"मूल्ये तपासा: कडकपणा 0–10,000 आणि अंतिम व्हॉल्यूम 0–100,000 लिटर असणे आवश्यक आहे.","Unit conversion factors":"युनिट रूपांतरण घटक","mg/L as CaCO3":"mg/L CaCO3 म्हणून","meq/L":"meq/L","A compatible result is an estimate within 0.05 °dH; real test kits and water chemistry have measurement variation.":"एक सुसंगत परिणाम हा 0.05 °dH मधील अंदाज आहे; वास्तविक चाचणी किट आणि पाण्याच्या रसायनशास्त्रामध्ये मापन भिन्नता आहे."},"ms":{"Aquarium Water Mixing Calculator":"Kalkulator Bancuhan Air Akuarium","Aquarium Water Mixing Calculator — Free GH & KH Planner":"Kalkulator Bancuhan Air Akuarium — Perancang GH & KH Percuma","Mix two water sources by measured GH and KH. Convert German, French, ppm and meq/L hardness units, check if both targets are compatible, and calculate litres locally.":"Campur dua sumber air mengikut GH dan KH yang disukat. Tukar unit kekerasan Jerman, Perancis, ppm dan meq/L, semak sama ada kedua-dua sasaran serasi dan hitung liter secara setempat.","Plan an aquarium water blend from two measured sources. The calculator solves general hardness (GH) and carbonate hardness (KH) together, rather than assuming reverse-osmosis water is exactly zero.":"Rancang campuran air akuarium daripada dua sumber yang diukur. Kalkulator menyelesaikan kekerasan am (GH) dan kekerasan karbonat (KH) bersama-sama, dan bukannya menganggap air reverse-osmosis betul-betul sifar.","Example: mix tap water at GH 10 / KH 5 with RO water at GH 0 / KH 0. A 50% blend produces about GH 5 / KH 2.5; a different pair of targets may require incompatible blend ratios.":"Contoh: campurkan air paip di GH 10 / KH 5 dengan air RO di GH 0 / KH 0. Campuran 50% menghasilkan kira-kira GH 5 / KH 2.5; sepasang sasaran yang berbeza mungkin memerlukan nisbah campuran yang tidak serasi.","Each hardness value is converted to German degrees for calculation. GH and KH are treated as linearly mixable measured concentrations; the tool checks both independently and only gives a water recipe when the two results agree within 0.05 °dH.":"Setiap nilai kekerasan ditukar kepada darjah Jerman untuk pengiraan. GH dan KH dianggap sebagai kepekatan terukur boleh campur secara linear; alat memeriksa kedua-duanya secara bebas dan hanya memberikan resipi air apabila kedua-dua keputusan bersetuju dalam 0.05 °dH.","This is a mixing estimate, not a pH or species-care recommendation. It does not model remineralization, buffers, acids, substrate effects, evaporation or measurement error. Test your water and follow reliable aquarium-care guidance.":"Ini ialah anggaran pencampuran, bukan cadangan pH atau penjagaan spesies. Ia tidak memodelkan pemineralan semula, penimbal, asid, kesan substrat, sejatan atau ralat pengukuran. Uji air anda dan ikuti panduan penjagaan akuarium yang boleh dipercayai.","Mixing example":"Contoh pencampuran","How GH/KH mixing works":"Cara pencampuran GH/KH berfungsi","Aquarium water mixing questions":"Soalan bancuhan air akuarium","Assumptions and limits":"Andaian dan had","What do GH and KH mean?":"Apakah maksud GH dan KH?","GH is general hardness, mainly dissolved calcium and magnesium. KH is carbonate hardness/alkalinity as reported by your test. They are separate measurements and are not interchangeable.":"GH ialah kekerasan umum, terutamanya kalsium dan magnesium terlarut. KH ialah kekerasan/alkali karbonat seperti yang dilaporkan oleh ujian anda. Ia adalah ukuran yang berasingan dan tidak boleh ditukar ganti.","Does reverse-osmosis water always have zero hardness?":"Adakah air reverse-osmosis sentiasa mempunyai kekerasan sifar?","No. Enter the GH and KH you actually measured for both sources. The calculator does not silently assume either source is pure water.":"No. Masukkan GH dan KH yang sebenarnya anda ukur untuk kedua-dua sumber. Kalkulator tidak secara senyap menganggap mana-mana sumber adalah air tulen.","Why can my GH and KH targets be incompatible?":"Mengapa sasaran GH dan KH saya boleh tidak serasi?","One blend percentage must satisfy both values. If GH requires a different source ratio from KH, two-source mixing alone cannot reach both targets; the tool reports that instead of making up a recipe.":"Satu peratusan campuran mesti memenuhi kedua-dua nilai. Jika GH memerlukan nisbah sumber yang berbeza daripada KH, pencampuran dua sumber sahaja tidak boleh mencapai kedua-dua sasaran; alat melaporkan bahawa bukannya membuat resipi.","Which units can I convert?":"Unit yang manakah boleh saya tukar?","German degrees (°dH), French degrees (°fH), mg/L as CaCO3 (ppm), and milliequivalents per litre (meq/L). The selected unit applies to every hardness input and result.":"darjah Jerman (°dH), darjah Perancis (°fH), mg/L sebagai CaCO3 (ppm), dan setara milli seliter (meq/L). Unit yang dipilih digunakan untuk setiap input kekerasan dan hasil.","Is this a pH calculator or a fish-care recommendation?":"Adakah ini kalkulator pH atau cadangan penjagaan ikan?","No. pH does not mix linearly, and suitable aquarium water depends on species and other chemistry. This tool only estimates GH/KH blend proportions from supplied measurements.":"No. pH tidak bercampur secara linear, dan air akuarium yang sesuai bergantung pada spesies dan kimia lain. Alat ini hanya menganggarkan perkadaran campuran GH/KH daripada ukuran yang dibekalkan.","Water source A":"Sumber air A","Water source B":"Sumber air B","Source A label":"Sumber Label A","Source B label":"Label Sumber B","Enter measured GH and KH for each source. For example, source A can be tap water and source B reverse-osmosis water.":"Masukkan GH dan KH yang diukur untuk setiap sumber. Sebagai contoh, sumber A boleh menjadi air paip dan sumber B air reverse-osmosis.","Hardness unit":"Unit kekerasan","German degrees (°dH)":"darjah Jerman (°dH)","French degrees (°fH)":"darjah Perancis (°fH)","mg/L as CaCO3 (ppm)":"mg/L sebagai CaCO3 (ppm)","Milliequivalents per litre (meq/L)":"Milliequivalents seliter (meq/L)","General hardness (GH)":"Kekerasan am (GH)","Carbonate hardness (KH)":"Kekerasan karbonat (KH)","Target water":"Air sasaran","Final batch volume (litres)":"Volume batch akhir (liter)","Calculate blend":"Kira adunan","Clear values":"Kosongkan nilai","Enter both water sources and your target GH/KH.":"Masukkan kedua-dua sumber air dan sasaran GH/KH anda.","Both target values can be reached with one blend ratio.":"Kedua-dua nilai sasaran boleh dicapai dengan satu nisbah campuran.","GH and KH require different blend ratios; these two sources cannot reach both targets together.":"GH dan KH memerlukan nisbah campuran yang berbeza; kedua-dua sumber ini tidak boleh mencapai kedua-dua sasaran bersama-sama.","At least one target is outside the range between the two source waters.":"Sekurang-kurangnya satu sasaran berada di luar julat antara dua sumber air.","Source A volume":"Sumber A volum","Source B volume":"Sumber B volum","Source A share":"Sumber A perkongsian","Predicted blend":"Campuran yang diramalkan","Predicted GH":"GH yang diramalkan","Predicted KH":"Diramalkan KH","Source A share required by GH":"Sumber Saham yang diperlukan oleh GH","Source A share required by KH":"Sumber Saham yang diperlukan oleh KH","Comparison tolerance":"Toleransi perbandingan","Unit conversion: 1 °dH = 17.848 mg/L CaCO3; 1 °fH = 10 mg/L CaCO3; 1 meq/L = 50 mg/L CaCO3.":"Penukaran unit: 1 °dH = 17.848 mg/L CaCO3; 1 °fH = 10 mg/L CaCO3; 1 meq/L = 50 mg/L CaCO3.","All calculations run locally in this browser; no water measurements are uploaded.":"Semua pengiraan dijalankan secara setempat dalam penyemak imbas ini; tiada sukatan air dimuat naik.","Check the values: hardness must be 0–10,000 and final volume 0–100,000 litres.":"Semak nilai: kekerasan mestilah 0–10,000 dan volum akhir 0–100,000 liter.","Unit conversion factors":"Faktor penukaran unit","mg/L as CaCO3":"mg/L sebagai CaCO3","meq/L":"meq/L","A compatible result is an estimate within 0.05 °dH; real test kits and water chemistry have measurement variation.":"Hasil yang serasi ialah anggaran dalam 0.05 °dH; kit ujian sebenar dan kimia air mempunyai variasi ukuran."},"nb":{"Aquarium Water Mixing Calculator":"Akvarievannblandekalkulator","Aquarium Water Mixing Calculator — Free GH & KH Planner":"Akvarievannblandingskalkulator — Gratis GH & KH-planlegger","Mix two water sources by measured GH and KH. Convert German, French, ppm and meq/L hardness units, check if both targets are compatible, and calculate litres locally.":"Bland to vannkilder med målt GH og KH. Konverter tyske, franske, ppm og meq/L hardhetsenheter, sjekk om begge målene er kompatible, og beregn liter lokalt.","Plan an aquarium water blend from two measured sources. The calculator solves general hardness (GH) and carbonate hardness (KH) together, rather than assuming reverse-osmosis water is exactly zero.":"Planlegg en akvarievannblanding fra to målte kilder. Kalkulatoren løser generell hardhet (GH) og karbonathardhet (KH) sammen, i stedet for å anta at vann med omvendt osmose er nøyaktig null.","Example: mix tap water at GH 10 / KH 5 with RO water at GH 0 / KH 0. A 50% blend produces about GH 5 / KH 2.5; a different pair of targets may require incompatible blend ratios.":"Eksempel: bland vann fra springen ved GH 10 / KH 5 med RO-vann ved GH 0 / KH 0. En 50% blanding produserer ca GH 5 / KH 2.5; et annet par med mål kan kreve inkompatible blandingsforhold.","Each hardness value is converted to German degrees for calculation. GH and KH are treated as linearly mixable measured concentrations; the tool checks both independently and only gives a water recipe when the two results agree within 0.05 °dH.":"Hver hardhetsverdi konverteres til tyske grader for beregning. GH og KH behandles som lineært blandbare målte konsentrasjoner; verktøyet sjekker begge uavhengig og gir bare en vannoppskrift når de to resultatene stemmer overens innenfor 0.05 °dH.","This is a mixing estimate, not a pH or species-care recommendation. It does not model remineralization, buffers, acids, substrate effects, evaporation or measurement error. Test your water and follow reliable aquarium-care guidance.":"Dette er et blandingsestimat, ikke en pH-anbefaling eller artspleie. Den modellerer ikke remineralisering, buffere, syrer, substrateffekter, fordampning eller målefeil. Test vannet ditt og følg pålitelige veiledning for akvariepleie.","Mixing example":"Blandeeksempel","How GH/KH mixing works":"Hvordan GH/KH-blanding fungerer","Aquarium water mixing questions":"Akvarievannblandingsspørsmål","Assumptions and limits":"Forutsetninger og grenser","What do GH and KH mean?":"Hva betyr GH og KH?","GH is general hardness, mainly dissolved calcium and magnesium. KH is carbonate hardness/alkalinity as reported by your test. They are separate measurements and are not interchangeable.":"GH er generell hardhet, hovedsakelig oppløst kalsium og magnesium. KH er karbonathardhet/alkalinitet som rapportert av testen din. De er separate mål og er ikke utskiftbare.","Does reverse-osmosis water always have zero hardness?":"Har vann med omvendt osmose alltid null hardhet?","No. Enter the GH and KH you actually measured for both sources. The calculator does not silently assume either source is pure water.":"Nr. Skriv inn GH og KH du faktisk målte for begge kildene. Kalkulatoren antar ikke stille at noen av kildene er rent vann.","Why can my GH and KH targets be incompatible?":"Hvorfor kan GH- og KH-målene mine være inkompatible?","One blend percentage must satisfy both values. If GH requires a different source ratio from KH, two-source mixing alone cannot reach both targets; the tool reports that instead of making up a recipe.":"En blandingsprosent må tilfredsstille begge verdiene. Hvis GH krever et annet kildeforhold enn KH, kan ikke to-kildeblanding alene nå begge målene; verktøyet rapporterer at i stedet for å lage en oppskrift.","Which units can I convert?":"Hvilke enheter kan jeg konvertere?","German degrees (°dH), French degrees (°fH), mg/L as CaCO3 (ppm), and milliequivalents per litre (meq/L). The selected unit applies to every hardness input and result.":"tyske grader (°dH), franske grader (°fH), mg/L som CaCO3 (ppm), og milliekvivalenter per liter (mekv/L). Den valgte enheten gjelder for alle hardhetsinndata og resultat.","Is this a pH calculator or a fish-care recommendation?":"Er dette en pH-kalkulator eller en fiskestellsanbefaling?","No. pH does not mix linearly, and suitable aquarium water depends on species and other chemistry. This tool only estimates GH/KH blend proportions from supplied measurements.":"Nr. pH blandes ikke lineært, og egnet akvarievann avhenger av arter og annen kjemi. Dette verktøyet estimerer kun GH/KH-blandingsforhold fra leverte målinger.","Water source A":"Vannkilde A","Water source B":"Vannkilde B","Source A label":"Kilde A-etikett","Source B label":"Kilde B-etikett","Enter measured GH and KH for each source. For example, source A can be tap water and source B reverse-osmosis water.":"Angi målt GH og KH for hver kilde. For eksempel kan kilde A være vann fra springen og kilde B omvendt osmosevann.","Hardness unit":"Hardhetsenhet","German degrees (°dH)":"tyske grader (°dH)","French degrees (°fH)":"Franske grader (°fH)","mg/L as CaCO3 (ppm)":"mg/L som CaCO3 (ppm)","Milliequivalents per litre (meq/L)":"Milliekvivalenter per liter (mekv/l)","General hardness (GH)":"Generell hardhet (GH)","Carbonate hardness (KH)":"Karbonathardhet (KH)","Target water":"Målvann","Final batch volume (litres)":"Endelig batchvolum (liter)","Calculate blend":"Beregn blanding","Clear values":"Slett verdier","Enter both water sources and your target GH/KH.":"Skriv inn både vannkilder og målet GH/KH.","Both target values can be reached with one blend ratio.":"Begge målverdiene kan nås med ett blandingsforhold.","GH and KH require different blend ratios; these two sources cannot reach both targets together.":"GH og KH krever forskjellige blandingsforhold; disse to kildene kan ikke nå begge målene sammen.","At least one target is outside the range between the two source waters.":"Minst ett mål er utenfor området mellom de to kildevannene.","Source A volume":"Kilde A-volum","Source B volume":"Kilde B-volum","Source A share":"Kilde A-andel","Predicted blend":"Forutsagt blanding","Predicted GH":"Spådd GH","Predicted KH":"Spådd KH","Source A share required by GH":"Kilde En andel kreves av GH","Source A share required by KH":"Kilde En andel kreves av KH","Comparison tolerance":"Sammenligningstoleranse","Unit conversion: 1 °dH = 17.848 mg/L CaCO3; 1 °fH = 10 mg/L CaCO3; 1 meq/L = 50 mg/L CaCO3.":"Enhetskonvertering: 1 °dH = 17.848 mg/L CaCO3; 1 °fH = 10 mg/L CaCO3; 1 mekv/L = 50 mg/L CaCO3.","All calculations run locally in this browser; no water measurements are uploaded.":"Alle beregninger kjøres lokalt i denne nettleseren; ingen vannmålinger lastes opp.","Check the values: hardness must be 0–10,000 and final volume 0–100,000 litres.":"Sjekk verdiene: hardheten må være 0–10,000 og sluttvolum 0–100,000 liter.","Unit conversion factors":"Enhetsomregningsfaktorer","mg/L as CaCO3":"mg/L som CaCO3","meq/L":"mekv/L","A compatible result is an estimate within 0.05 °dH; real test kits and water chemistry have measurement variation.":"Et kompatibelt resultat er et estimat innenfor 0.05 °dH; ekte testsett og vannkjemi har målevariasjon."},"nl":{"Aquarium Water Mixing Calculator":"Rekenmachine voor het mengen van aquariumwater","Aquarium Water Mixing Calculator — Free GH & KH Planner":"Aquariumwatermengcalculator — Gratis GH- en KH-planner","Mix two water sources by measured GH and KH. Convert German, French, ppm and meq/L hardness units, check if both targets are compatible, and calculate litres locally.":"Meng twee waterbronnen op gemeten GH en KH. Converteer Duitse, Franse, ppm en meq/L hardheidseenheden, controleer of beide doelen compatibel zijn en bereken de liters lokaal.","Plan an aquarium water blend from two measured sources. The calculator solves general hardness (GH) and carbonate hardness (KH) together, rather than assuming reverse-osmosis water is exactly zero.":"Plan een aquariumwatermengsel uit twee gemeten bronnen. De rekenmachine berekent de algemene hardheid (GH) en de carbonaathardheid (KH) samen, in plaats van aan te nemen dat water bij omgekeerde osmose precies nul is.","Example: mix tap water at GH 10 / KH 5 with RO water at GH 0 / KH 0. A 50% blend produces about GH 5 / KH 2.5; a different pair of targets may require incompatible blend ratios.":"Voorbeeld: meng kraanwater bij GH 10 / KH 5 met RO-water bij GH 0 / KH 0. Een mengsel van 50% produceert ongeveer GH 5 / KH 2.5; een ander paar doelen kan incompatibele mengverhoudingen vereisen.","Each hardness value is converted to German degrees for calculation. GH and KH are treated as linearly mixable measured concentrations; the tool checks both independently and only gives a water recipe when the two results agree within 0.05 °dH.":"Elke hardheidswaarde wordt voor berekening omgezet in Duitse graden. GH en KH worden behandeld als lineair mengbare gemeten concentraties; de tool controleert beide onafhankelijk en geeft alleen een waterrecept weer als de twee resultaten overeenkomen binnen 0.05 °dH.","This is a mixing estimate, not a pH or species-care recommendation. It does not model remineralization, buffers, acids, substrate effects, evaporation or measurement error. Test your water and follow reliable aquarium-care guidance.":"Dit is een mengschatting, geen pH- of soortverzorgingsaanbeveling. Het modelleert geen remineralisatie, buffers, zuren, substraateffecten, verdamping of meetfouten. Test uw water en volg betrouwbare richtlijnen voor aquariumonderhoud.","Mixing example":"Mengvoorbeeld","How GH/KH mixing works":"Hoe GH/KH-mengen werkt","Aquarium water mixing questions":"Vragen voor het mengen van aquariumwater","Assumptions and limits":"Aannames en limieten","What do GH and KH mean?":"Wat betekenen GH en KH?","GH is general hardness, mainly dissolved calcium and magnesium. KH is carbonate hardness/alkalinity as reported by your test. They are separate measurements and are not interchangeable.":"GH is algemene hardheid, voornamelijk opgelost calcium en magnesium. KH is de carbonaathardheid/alkaliteit zoals gerapporteerd door uw test. Het zijn afzonderlijke metingen en niet uitwisselbaar.","Does reverse-osmosis water always have zero hardness?":"Heeft omgekeerd osmosewater altijd een hardheid van nul?","No. Enter the GH and KH you actually measured for both sources. The calculator does not silently assume either source is pure water.":"Nr. Voer voor beide bronnen de GH en KH in die u daadwerkelijk heeft gemeten. De rekenmachine gaat er niet stilletjes van uit dat beide bronnen zuiver water zijn.","Why can my GH and KH targets be incompatible?":"Waarom kunnen mijn GH- en KH-doelstellingen incompatibel zijn?","One blend percentage must satisfy both values. If GH requires a different source ratio from KH, two-source mixing alone cannot reach both targets; the tool reports that instead of making up a recipe.":"Eén mengpercentage moet aan beide waarden voldoen. Als GH een andere bronverhouding vereist dan KH, kan het mengen van twee bronnen alleen niet beide doelen bereiken; de tool meldt dat in plaats van een recept te verzinnen.","Which units can I convert?":"Welke eenheden kan ik omrekenen?","German degrees (°dH), French degrees (°fH), mg/L as CaCO3 (ppm), and milliequivalents per litre (meq/L). The selected unit applies to every hardness input and result.":"Duitse graden (°dH), Franse graden (°fH), mg/L als CaCO3 (ppm) en milli-equivalenten per liter (meq/L). De geselecteerde eenheid geldt voor elke hardheidsinvoer en resultaat.","Is this a pH calculator or a fish-care recommendation?":"Is dit een pH-calculator of een aanbeveling voor de verzorging van vissen?","No. pH does not mix linearly, and suitable aquarium water depends on species and other chemistry. This tool only estimates GH/KH blend proportions from supplied measurements.":"Nr. De pH mengt zich niet lineair en geschikt aquariumwater is afhankelijk van de soort en andere chemie. Deze tool schat alleen de GH/KH-mengselverhoudingen op basis van de geleverde metingen.","Water source A":"Waterbron A","Water source B":"Waterbron B","Source A label":"Bron A-label","Source B label":"Bron B-label","Enter measured GH and KH for each source. For example, source A can be tap water and source B reverse-osmosis water.":"Voer de gemeten GH en KH in voor elke bron. Bron A kan bijvoorbeeld leidingwater zijn en bron B omgekeerde osmosewater.","Hardness unit":"Hardheidseenheid","German degrees (°dH)":"Duitse graden (°dH)","French degrees (°fH)":"Franse graden (°fH)","mg/L as CaCO3 (ppm)":"mg/L als CaCO3 (ppm)","Milliequivalents per litre (meq/L)":"Millie-equivalenten per liter (meq/L)","General hardness (GH)":"Algemene hardheid (GH)","Carbonate hardness (KH)":"Carbonaathardheid (KH)","Target water":"Doelwater","Final batch volume (litres)":"Eindbatchvolume (liter)","Calculate blend":"Bereken het mengsel","Clear values":"Duidelijke waarden","Enter both water sources and your target GH/KH.":"Voer zowel de waterbronnen als uw beoogde GH/KH in.","Both target values can be reached with one blend ratio.":"Beide streefwaarden kunnen met één mengverhouding worden bereikt.","GH and KH require different blend ratios; these two sources cannot reach both targets together.":"GH en KH vereisen verschillende mengverhoudingen; deze twee bronnen kunnen beide doelstellingen niet samen bereiken.","At least one target is outside the range between the two source waters.":"Minstens één doel bevindt zich buiten het bereik tussen de twee bronwateren.","Source A volume":"Bron A-volume","Source B volume":"Bron B-volume","Source A share":"Bron A-aandeel","Predicted blend":"Voorspelde blend","Predicted GH":"Voorspelde GH","Predicted KH":"Voorspelde KH","Source A share required by GH":"Bron A-aandeel vereist door GH","Source A share required by KH":"Bron Een aandeel vereist door KH","Comparison tolerance":"Vergelijkingstolerantie","Unit conversion: 1 °dH = 17.848 mg/L CaCO3; 1 °fH = 10 mg/L CaCO3; 1 meq/L = 50 mg/L CaCO3.":"Eenheidconversie: 1 °dH = 17.848 mg/L CaCO3; 1 °fH = 10 mg/L CaCO3; 1 meq/L = 50 mg/L CaCO3.","All calculations run locally in this browser; no water measurements are uploaded.":"Alle berekeningen worden lokaal in deze browser uitgevoerd; er worden geen watermetingen geüpload.","Check the values: hardness must be 0–10,000 and final volume 0–100,000 litres.":"Controleer de waarden: de hardheid moet 0–10,000 zijn en het eindvolume 0–100,000 liter.","Unit conversion factors":"Omrekeningsfactoren voor eenheden","mg/L as CaCO3":"mg/L als CaCO3","meq/L":"meq/L","A compatible result is an estimate within 0.05 °dH; real test kits and water chemistry have measurement variation.":"Een compatibel resultaat is een schatting binnen 0.05 °dH; echte testkits en waterchemie hebben meetvariatie."},"pl":{"Aquarium Water Mixing Calculator":"Kalkulator mieszania wody w akwarium","Aquarium Water Mixing Calculator — Free GH & KH Planner":"Kalkulator mieszania wody w akwarium — bezpłatny planista GH i KH","Mix two water sources by measured GH and KH. Convert German, French, ppm and meq/L hardness units, check if both targets are compatible, and calculate litres locally.":"Wymieszaj dwa źródła wody na podstawie zmierzonych GH i KH. Konwertuj jednostki twardości niemieckie, francuskie, ppm i meq/L, sprawdź, czy oba wartości docelowe są zgodne i lokalnie oblicz litry.","Plan an aquarium water blend from two measured sources. The calculator solves general hardness (GH) and carbonate hardness (KH) together, rather than assuming reverse-osmosis water is exactly zero.":"Zaplanuj mieszankę wody w akwarium z dwóch zmierzonych źródeł. Kalkulator oblicza twardość ogólną (GH) i twardość węglanową (KH) razem, zamiast zakładać, że woda po odwróconej osmozie wynosi dokładnie zero.","Example: mix tap water at GH 10 / KH 5 with RO water at GH 0 / KH 0. A 50% blend produces about GH 5 / KH 2.5; a different pair of targets may require incompatible blend ratios.":"Przykład: zmieszaj wodę kranową w GH 10 / KH 5 z wodą RO w GH 0 / KH 0. Mieszanka 50% daje około GH 5 / KH 2.5; inna para celów może wymagać niezgodnych proporcji mieszania.","Each hardness value is converted to German degrees for calculation. GH and KH are treated as linearly mixable measured concentrations; the tool checks both independently and only gives a water recipe when the two results agree within 0.05 °dH.":"Każda wartość twardości jest w celu obliczeń przeliczana na stopnie niemieckie. GH i KH traktuje się jako liniowo mieszające się mierzone stężenia; narzędzie sprawdza oba niezależnie i podaje recepturę wody tylko wtedy, gdy oba wyniki zgadzają się w zakresie 0.05 °dH.","This is a mixing estimate, not a pH or species-care recommendation. It does not model remineralization, buffers, acids, substrate effects, evaporation or measurement error. Test your water and follow reliable aquarium-care guidance.":"To jest oszacowanie mieszania, a nie zalecenie dotyczące pH lub pielęgnacji gatunku. Nie modeluje remineralizacji, buforów, kwasów, efektów substratu, parowania ani błędu pomiaru. Sprawdź swoją wodę i postępuj zgodnie z niezawodnymi wskazówkami dotyczącymi pielęgnacji akwarium.","Mixing example":"Przykład mieszania","How GH/KH mixing works":"Jak działa mieszanie GH/KH","Aquarium water mixing questions":"Pytania dotyczące mieszania wody w akwarium","Assumptions and limits":"Założenia i ograniczenia","What do GH and KH mean?":"Co oznaczają GH i KH?","GH is general hardness, mainly dissolved calcium and magnesium. KH is carbonate hardness/alkalinity as reported by your test. They are separate measurements and are not interchangeable.":"GH to twardość ogólna, głównie rozpuszczony wapń i magnez. KH to twardość/zasadowość węglanowa podana w teście. Są to oddzielne pomiary i nie można ich stosować zamiennie.","Does reverse-osmosis water always have zero hardness?":"Czy woda z odwróconej osmozy zawsze ma zerową twardość?","No. Enter the GH and KH you actually measured for both sources. The calculator does not silently assume either source is pure water.":"Nie. Wprowadź faktycznie zmierzone wartości GH i KH dla obu źródeł. Kalkulator nie zakłada po cichu, że którekolwiek ze źródeł to czysta woda.","Why can my GH and KH targets be incompatible?":"Dlaczego moje cele GH i KH mogą być niezgodne?","One blend percentage must satisfy both values. If GH requires a different source ratio from KH, two-source mixing alone cannot reach both targets; the tool reports that instead of making up a recipe.":"Jeden procent mieszanki musi spełniać obie wartości. Jeśli GH wymaga innego stosunku źródeł niż KH, samo mieszanie dwóch źródeł nie jest w stanie osiągnąć obu celów; narzędzie zgłasza to zamiast tworzyć przepis.","Which units can I convert?":"Jakie jednostki mogę konwertować?","German degrees (°dH), French degrees (°fH), mg/L as CaCO3 (ppm), and milliequivalents per litre (meq/L). The selected unit applies to every hardness input and result.":"Stopnie niemieckie (°dH), stopnie francuskie (°fH), mg/L jako CaCO3 (ppm) i miliekwiwalenty na litr (meq/L). Wybrana jednostka dotyczy wszystkich danych wejściowych i wyników twardości.","Is this a pH calculator or a fish-care recommendation?":"Czy to kalkulator pH, czy zalecenie dotyczące pielęgnacji ryb?","No. pH does not mix linearly, and suitable aquarium water depends on species and other chemistry. This tool only estimates GH/KH blend proportions from supplied measurements.":"Nie. pH nie miesza się liniowo, a odpowiednia woda akwariowa zależy od gatunku i innych parametrów chemicznych. To narzędzie szacuje jedynie proporcje mieszanki GH/KH na podstawie dostarczonych pomiarów.","Water source A":"Źródło wody A","Water source B":"Źródło wody B","Source A label":"Etykieta źródła A","Source B label":"Etykieta źródła B","Enter measured GH and KH for each source. For example, source A can be tap water and source B reverse-osmosis water.":"Wprowadź zmierzone GH i KH dla każdego źródła. Na przykład źródłem A może być woda z kranu, a źródłem B woda z odwróconej osmozy.","Hardness unit":"Jednostka twardości","German degrees (°dH)":"Stopnie niemieckie (°dH)","French degrees (°fH)":"Stopnie francuskie (°fH)","mg/L as CaCO3 (ppm)":"mg/L jako CaCO3 (ppm)","Milliequivalents per litre (meq/L)":"Miliekwiwalenty na litr (meq/L)","General hardness (GH)":"Twardość ogólna (GH)","Carbonate hardness (KH)":"Twardość węglanowa (KH)","Target water":"Woda docelowa","Final batch volume (litres)":"Końcowa objętość partii (litry)","Calculate blend":"Oblicz mieszankę","Clear values":"Wyczyść wartości","Enter both water sources and your target GH/KH.":"Wprowadź oba źródła wody i docelowy poziom GH/KH.","Both target values can be reached with one blend ratio.":"Obie wartości docelowe można osiągnąć przy jednym stosunku mieszania.","GH and KH require different blend ratios; these two sources cannot reach both targets together.":"GH i KH wymagają różnych proporcji mieszania; te dwa źródła nie mogą jednocześnie osiągnąć obu celów.","At least one target is outside the range between the two source waters.":"Co najmniej jeden cel znajduje się poza zasięgiem pomiędzy dwoma wodami źródłowymi.","Source A volume":"Wolumin źródłowy A","Source B volume":"Wolumin źródła B","Source A share":"Udział źródłowy A","Predicted blend":"Przewidywana mieszanka","Predicted GH":"Przewidywany GH","Predicted KH":"Przewidywana wartość KH","Source A share required by GH":"Źródło Udział A wymagany przez GH","Source A share required by KH":"Źródło Udział A wymagany przez KH","Comparison tolerance":"Tolerancja porównawcza","Unit conversion: 1 °dH = 17.848 mg/L CaCO3; 1 °fH = 10 mg/L CaCO3; 1 meq/L = 50 mg/L CaCO3.":"Konwersja jednostek: 1 °dH = 17.848 mg/L CaCO3; 1 °fH = 10 mg/L CaCO3; 1 meq/L = 50 mg/L CaCO3.","All calculations run locally in this browser; no water measurements are uploaded.":"Wszystkie obliczenia są uruchamiane lokalnie w tej przeglądarce; nie są przesyłane żadne pomiary wody.","Check the values: hardness must be 0–10,000 and final volume 0–100,000 litres.":"Sprawdź wartości: twardość musi wynosić 0–10,000, a końcowa objętość 0–100,000 litrów.","Unit conversion factors":"Współczynniki konwersji jednostek","mg/L as CaCO3":"mg/L jako CaCO3","meq/L":"meq/L","A compatible result is an estimate within 0.05 °dH; real test kits and water chemistry have measurement variation.":"Zgodny wynik to oszacowanie w zakresie 0.05 °dH; Prawdziwe zestawy testowe i chemia wody mają różnice w pomiarach."},"pt":{"Aquarium Water Mixing Calculator":"Calculadora de mistura de água de aquário","Aquarium Water Mixing Calculator — Free GH & KH Planner":"Calculadora de mistura de água de aquário - Planejador GH e KH grátis","Mix two water sources by measured GH and KH. Convert German, French, ppm and meq/L hardness units, check if both targets are compatible, and calculate litres locally.":"Misture duas fontes de água medindo GH e KH. Converta unidades de dureza alemãs, francesas, ppm e meq/L, verifique se ambos os alvos são compatíveis e calcule litros localmente.","Plan an aquarium water blend from two measured sources. The calculator solves general hardness (GH) and carbonate hardness (KH) together, rather than assuming reverse-osmosis water is exactly zero.":"Planeje uma mistura de água de aquário a partir de duas fontes medidas. A calculadora resolve a dureza geral (GH) e a dureza carbonática (KH) juntas, em vez de assumir que a água de osmose reversa é exatamente zero.","Example: mix tap water at GH 10 / KH 5 with RO water at GH 0 / KH 0. A 50% blend produces about GH 5 / KH 2.5; a different pair of targets may require incompatible blend ratios.":"Exemplo: misture água da torneira em GH 10 / KH 5 com água RO em GH 0 / KH 0. Uma mistura 50% produz cerca de GH 5 / KH 2.5; um par diferente de alvos pode exigir proporções de mistura incompatíveis.","Each hardness value is converted to German degrees for calculation. GH and KH are treated as linearly mixable measured concentrations; the tool checks both independently and only gives a water recipe when the two results agree within 0.05 °dH.":"Cada valor de dureza é convertido em graus alemães para cálculo. GH e KH são tratados como concentrações medidas linearmente miscíveis; a ferramenta verifica ambos de forma independente e só fornece uma receita de água quando os dois resultados concordam dentro de 0.05 °dH.","This is a mixing estimate, not a pH or species-care recommendation. It does not model remineralization, buffers, acids, substrate effects, evaporation or measurement error. Test your water and follow reliable aquarium-care guidance.":"Esta é uma estimativa de mistura, não um pH ou recomendação de cuidados com as espécies. Não modela remineralização, tampões, ácidos, efeitos de substrato, evaporação ou erro de medição. Teste sua água e siga orientações confiáveis ​​sobre cuidados com o aquário.","Mixing example":"Exemplo de mistura","How GH/KH mixing works":"Como funciona a mistura GH/KH","Aquarium water mixing questions":"Perguntas sobre mistura de água de aquário","Assumptions and limits":"Suposições e limites","What do GH and KH mean?":"O que significam GH e KH?","GH is general hardness, mainly dissolved calcium and magnesium. KH is carbonate hardness/alkalinity as reported by your test. They are separate measurements and are not interchangeable.":"GH é a dureza geral, principalmente cálcio e magnésio dissolvidos. KH é a dureza/alcalinidade do carbonato conforme relatado pelo seu teste. São medidas separadas e não são intercambiáveis.","Does reverse-osmosis water always have zero hardness?":"A água de osmose reversa sempre tem dureza zero?","No. Enter the GH and KH you actually measured for both sources. The calculator does not silently assume either source is pure water.":"Não. Insira o GH e o KH que você realmente mediu para ambas as fontes. A calculadora não assume silenciosamente que nenhuma das fontes seja água pura.","Why can my GH and KH targets be incompatible?":"Por que meus alvos de GH e KH podem ser incompatíveis?","One blend percentage must satisfy both values. If GH requires a different source ratio from KH, two-source mixing alone cannot reach both targets; the tool reports that instead of making up a recipe.":"Uma porcentagem de mistura deve satisfazer ambos os valores. Se o GH exigir uma proporção de fonte diferente do KH, a mistura de duas fontes por si só não poderá atingir ambos os alvos; a ferramenta informa isso em vez de inventar uma receita.","Which units can I convert?":"Quais unidades posso converter?","German degrees (°dH), French degrees (°fH), mg/L as CaCO3 (ppm), and milliequivalents per litre (meq/L). The selected unit applies to every hardness input and result.":"Graus alemães (°dH), graus franceses (°fH), mg/L como CaCO3 (ppm) e miliequivalentes por litro (meq/L). A unidade selecionada se aplica a cada entrada e resultado de dureza.","Is this a pH calculator or a fish-care recommendation?":"Esta é uma calculadora de pH ou uma recomendação de cuidados com os peixes?","No. pH does not mix linearly, and suitable aquarium water depends on species and other chemistry. This tool only estimates GH/KH blend proportions from supplied measurements.":"Não. O pH não se mistura linearmente e a água adequada do aquário depende das espécies e de outros produtos químicos. Esta ferramenta estima apenas as proporções da mistura GH/KH a partir das medições fornecidas.","Water source A":"Fonte de água A","Water source B":"Fonte de água B","Source A label":"Etiqueta de origem A","Source B label":"Etiqueta Fonte B","Enter measured GH and KH for each source. For example, source A can be tap water and source B reverse-osmosis water.":"Insira GH e KH medidos para cada fonte. Por exemplo, a fonte A pode ser água da torneira e a fonte B água de osmose reversa.","Hardness unit":"Unidade de dureza","German degrees (°dH)":"Graus alemães (°dH)","French degrees (°fH)":"Graus franceses (°fH)","mg/L as CaCO3 (ppm)":"mg/L como CaCO3 (ppm)","Milliequivalents per litre (meq/L)":"Miliequivalentes por litro (meq/L)","General hardness (GH)":"Dureza geral (GH)","Carbonate hardness (KH)":"Dureza de carbonato (KH)","Target water":"Água alvo","Final batch volume (litres)":"Volume final do lote (litros)","Calculate blend":"Calcular mistura","Clear values":"Limpar valores","Enter both water sources and your target GH/KH.":"Insira ambas as fontes de água e seu GH/KH alvo.","Both target values can be reached with one blend ratio.":"Ambos os valores alvo podem ser alcançados com uma proporção de mistura.","GH and KH require different blend ratios; these two sources cannot reach both targets together.":"GH e KH requerem proporções de mistura diferentes; estas duas fontes não podem atingir os dois objectivos em conjunto.","At least one target is outside the range between the two source waters.":"Pelo menos um alvo está fora do intervalo entre as duas fontes de água.","Source A volume":"Volume da fonte A","Source B volume":"Volume da fonte B","Source A share":"Compartilhamento da fonte A","Predicted blend":"Mistura prevista","Predicted GH":"GH previsto","Predicted KH":"KH previsto","Source A share required by GH":"Compartilhamento de origem A exigido pelo GH","Source A share required by KH":"Compartilhamento de origem A exigido por KH","Comparison tolerance":"Tolerância de comparação","Unit conversion: 1 °dH = 17.848 mg/L CaCO3; 1 °fH = 10 mg/L CaCO3; 1 meq/L = 50 mg/L CaCO3.":"Conversão de unidades: 1 °dH = 17.848 mg/L CaCO3; 1 °fH = 10 mg/L CaCO3; 1 meq/L = 50 mg/L CaCO3.","All calculations run locally in this browser; no water measurements are uploaded.":"Todos os cálculos são executados localmente neste navegador; nenhuma medição de água é carregada.","Check the values: hardness must be 0–10,000 and final volume 0–100,000 litres.":"Verifique os valores: a dureza deve ser 0–10,000 e o volume final 0–100,000 litros.","Unit conversion factors":"Fatores de conversão de unidades","mg/L as CaCO3":"mg/L como CaCO3","meq/L":"meq/L","A compatible result is an estimate within 0.05 °dH; real test kits and water chemistry have measurement variation.":"Um resultado compatível é uma estimativa dentro de 0.05 °dH; kits de teste reais e química da água têm variação de medição."},"ru":{"Aquarium Water Mixing Calculator":"Калькулятор смешивания аквариумной воды","Aquarium Water Mixing Calculator — Free GH & KH Planner":"Калькулятор смешивания аквариумной воды — бесплатный планировщик GH и KH","Mix two water sources by measured GH and KH. Convert German, French, ppm and meq/L hardness units, check if both targets are compatible, and calculate litres locally.":"Смешайте два источника воды по измеренным значениям GH и KH. Преобразуйте немецкие, французские, ppm и единицы жесткости мэкв/л, проверьте, совместимы ли обе цели, и рассчитайте литры локально.","Plan an aquarium water blend from two measured sources. The calculator solves general hardness (GH) and carbonate hardness (KH) together, rather than assuming reverse-osmosis water is exactly zero.":"Спланируйте смешивание аквариумной воды из двух измеренных источников. Калькулятор рассчитывает общую жесткость (GH) и карбонатную жесткость (KH) вместе, а не предполагает, что вода обратного осмоса равна нулю.","Example: mix tap water at GH 10 / KH 5 with RO water at GH 0 / KH 0. A 50% blend produces about GH 5 / KH 2.5; a different pair of targets may require incompatible blend ratios.":"Пример: смешайте водопроводную воду в GH 10 / KH 5 с водой обратного осмоса в GH 0 / KH 0. Смесь 50% дает около GH 5 / KH 2.5; другая пара целей может потребовать несовместимых соотношений смеси.","Each hardness value is converted to German degrees for calculation. GH and KH are treated as linearly mixable measured concentrations; the tool checks both independently and only gives a water recipe when the two results agree within 0.05 °dH.":"Каждое значение твердости для расчета конвертируется в немецкие градусы. GH и KH рассматриваются как измеренные концентрации, которые можно линейно смешивать; инструмент проверяет оба варианта независимо и выдает рецепт воды только тогда, когда два результата совпадают в пределах 0.05 °dH.","This is a mixing estimate, not a pH or species-care recommendation. It does not model remineralization, buffers, acids, substrate effects, evaporation or measurement error. Test your water and follow reliable aquarium-care guidance.":"Это оценка смешивания, а не рекомендация по pH или уходу за видами. Он не моделирует реминерализацию, буферы, кислоты, эффекты субстрата, испарение или ошибку измерения. Проверьте свою воду и следуйте надежным рекомендациям по уходу за аквариумом.","Mixing example":"Пример смешивания","How GH/KH mixing works":"Как работает смешивание GH/KH","Aquarium water mixing questions":"Вопросы по смешиванию воды в аквариуме","Assumptions and limits":"Допущения и ограничения","What do GH and KH mean?":"Что означают GH и KH?","GH is general hardness, mainly dissolved calcium and magnesium. KH is carbonate hardness/alkalinity as reported by your test. They are separate measurements and are not interchangeable.":"GH — общая жесткость, в основном растворенный кальций и магний. KH — это карбонатная жесткость/щелочность по данным вашего теста. Это отдельные измерения и не являются взаимозаменяемыми.","Does reverse-osmosis water always have zero hardness?":"Всегда ли вода обратного осмоса имеет нулевую жесткость?","No. Enter the GH and KH you actually measured for both sources. The calculator does not silently assume either source is pure water.":"Нет. Введите значения GH и KH, которые вы фактически измерили для обоих источников. Калькулятор не предполагает молча, что любой из источников является чистой водой.","Why can my GH and KH targets be incompatible?":"Почему мои цели GH и KH могут быть несовместимы?","One blend percentage must satisfy both values. If GH requires a different source ratio from KH, two-source mixing alone cannot reach both targets; the tool reports that instead of making up a recipe.":"Один процент смеси должен удовлетворять обоим значениям. Если GH требует другого соотношения источников, чем KH, одно только смешивание двух источников не может достичь обеих целей; инструмент сообщает об этом вместо составления рецепта.","Which units can I convert?":"Какие единицы измерения я могу конвертировать?","German degrees (°dH), French degrees (°fH), mg/L as CaCO3 (ppm), and milliequivalents per litre (meq/L). The selected unit applies to every hardness input and result.":"Немецкие градусы (°dH), французские градусы (°fH), мг/л в виде CaCO3 (ppm) и миллиэквиваленты на литр (мэкв/л). Выбранная единица измерения применяется ко всем входным данным и результатам твердости.","Is this a pH calculator or a fish-care recommendation?":"Это калькулятор pH или рекомендации по уходу за рыбками?","No. pH does not mix linearly, and suitable aquarium water depends on species and other chemistry. This tool only estimates GH/KH blend proportions from supplied measurements.":"Нет. Уровень pH не является линейным, и подходящая аквариумная вода зависит от вида и другого химического состава. Этот инструмент оценивает только пропорции смеси GH/KH на основе предоставленных измерений.","Water source A":"Источник воды А","Water source B":"Источник воды B","Source A label":"Ярлык источника A","Source B label":"Этикетка источника B","Enter measured GH and KH for each source. For example, source A can be tap water and source B reverse-osmosis water.":"Введите измеренные значения GH и KH для каждого источника. Например, источником A может быть водопроводная вода, а источником B - вода обратного осмоса.","Hardness unit":"Единица твердости","German degrees (°dH)":"Немецкие градусы (°dH)","French degrees (°fH)":"Французские градусы (°fH)","mg/L as CaCO3 (ppm)":"мг/л в виде CaCO3 (ppm)","Milliequivalents per litre (meq/L)":"Миллиэквиваленты на литр (мэкв/л)","General hardness (GH)":"Общая твердость (GH)","Carbonate hardness (KH)":"Карбонатная жесткость (KH)","Target water":"Целевая вода","Final batch volume (litres)":"Конечный объем партии (литры)","Calculate blend":"Рассчитать смесь","Clear values":"Очистить значения","Enter both water sources and your target GH/KH.":"Введите оба источника воды и целевой показатель GH/KH.","Both target values can be reached with one blend ratio.":"Оба целевых значения могут быть достигнуты с помощью одного соотношения компонентов смеси.","GH and KH require different blend ratios; these two sources cannot reach both targets together.":"GH и KH требуют разных пропорций смеси; эти два источника не могут одновременно достичь обеих целей.","At least one target is outside the range between the two source waters.":"По крайней мере одна цель находится за пределами диапазона между двумя источниками воды.","Source A volume":"Источник A, том","Source B volume":"Том источника B","Source A share":"Источник А, доля","Predicted blend":"Прогнозируемая смесь","Predicted GH":"Прогнозируемый рост роста","Predicted KH":"Предсказанный KH","Source A share required by GH":"Источник Доля, требуемая GH","Source A share required by KH":"Источник Доля A, требуемая KH","Comparison tolerance":"Допуск сравнения","Unit conversion: 1 °dH = 17.848 mg/L CaCO3; 1 °fH = 10 mg/L CaCO3; 1 meq/L = 50 mg/L CaCO3.":"Преобразование единиц измерения: 1 °dH = 17.848 мг/л CaCO3; 1 °fH = 10 мг/л CaCO3; 1 мэкв/л = 50 мг/л CaCO3.","All calculations run locally in this browser; no water measurements are uploaded.":"Все вычисления выполняются локально в этом браузере; измерения воды не загружаются.","Check the values: hardness must be 0–10,000 and final volume 0–100,000 litres.":"Проверьте значения: жесткость должна быть 0–10,000, а конечный объем 0–100,000 литров.","Unit conversion factors":"Коэффициенты пересчета единиц измерения","mg/L as CaCO3":"мг/л в виде CaCO3","meq/L":"мэкв/л","A compatible result is an estimate within 0.05 °dH; real test kits and water chemistry have measurement variation.":"Совместимый результат — это оценка в пределах 0.05 °dH; реальные тестовые наборы и химический состав воды имеют различия в измерениях."},"sv":{"Aquarium Water Mixing Calculator":"Akvarievattenblandningskalkylator","Aquarium Water Mixing Calculator — Free GH & KH Planner":"Akvarievattenblandningskalkylator — Gratis GH & KH Planner","Mix two water sources by measured GH and KH. Convert German, French, ppm and meq/L hardness units, check if both targets are compatible, and calculate litres locally.":"Blanda två vattenkällor med uppmätt GH och KH. Konvertera tyska, franska, ppm och meq/L hårdhetsenheter, kontrollera om båda målen är kompatibla och beräkna liter lokalt.","Plan an aquarium water blend from two measured sources. The calculator solves general hardness (GH) and carbonate hardness (KH) together, rather than assuming reverse-osmosis water is exactly zero.":"Planera en akvarievattenblandning från två uppmätta källor. Kalkylatorn löser generell hårdhet (GH) och karbonathårdhet (KH) tillsammans, snarare än att anta att vatten med omvänd osmos är exakt noll.","Example: mix tap water at GH 10 / KH 5 with RO water at GH 0 / KH 0. A 50% blend produces about GH 5 / KH 2.5; a different pair of targets may require incompatible blend ratios.":"Exempel: blanda kranvatten vid GH 10 / KH 5 med RO-vatten vid GH 0 / KH 0. En 50% blandning producerar ungefär GH 5 / KH 2.5; ett annat par av mål kan kräva inkompatibla blandningsförhållanden.","Each hardness value is converted to German degrees for calculation. GH and KH are treated as linearly mixable measured concentrations; the tool checks both independently and only gives a water recipe when the two results agree within 0.05 °dH.":"Varje hårdhetsvärde omvandlas till tyska grader för beräkning. GH och KH behandlas som linjärt blandbara uppmätta koncentrationer; verktyget kontrollerar båda oberoende och ger bara ett vattenrecept när de två resultaten överensstämmer inom 0.05 °dH.","This is a mixing estimate, not a pH or species-care recommendation. It does not model remineralization, buffers, acids, substrate effects, evaporation or measurement error. Test your water and follow reliable aquarium-care guidance.":"Detta är en blandningsuppskattning, inte en rekommendation för pH eller artvård. Den modellerar inte remineralisering, buffertar, syror, substrateffekter, förångning eller mätfel. Testa ditt vatten och följ tillförlitliga akvarievårdsanvisningar.","Mixing example":"Blandningsexempel","How GH/KH mixing works":"Hur GH/KH-blandning fungerar","Aquarium water mixing questions":"Akvarievattenblandningsfrågor","Assumptions and limits":"Antaganden och gränser","What do GH and KH mean?":"Vad betyder GH och KH?","GH is general hardness, mainly dissolved calcium and magnesium. KH is carbonate hardness/alkalinity as reported by your test. They are separate measurements and are not interchangeable.":"GH är generell hårdhet, främst löst kalcium och magnesium. KH är karbonathårdhet/alkalinitet enligt ditt test. De är separata mått och är inte utbytbara.","Does reverse-osmosis water always have zero hardness?":"Har vatten med omvänd osmos alltid noll hårdhet?","No. Enter the GH and KH you actually measured for both sources. The calculator does not silently assume either source is pure water.":"Nr. Ange GH och KH du faktiskt mätte för båda källorna. Kalkylatorn antar inte tyst att någon av källorna är rent vatten.","Why can my GH and KH targets be incompatible?":"Varför kan mina GH- och KH-mål vara inkompatibla?","One blend percentage must satisfy both values. If GH requires a different source ratio from KH, two-source mixing alone cannot reach both targets; the tool reports that instead of making up a recipe.":"En blandningsprocent måste uppfylla båda värdena. Om GH kräver ett annat källförhållande än KH, kan tvåkällsblandning ensam inte nå båda målen; verktyget rapporterar att istället för att hitta på ett recept.","Which units can I convert?":"Vilka enheter kan jag konvertera?","German degrees (°dH), French degrees (°fH), mg/L as CaCO3 (ppm), and milliequivalents per litre (meq/L). The selected unit applies to every hardness input and result.":"tyska grader (°dH), franska grader (°fH), mg/L som CaCO3 (ppm) och milliekvivalenter per liter (mekv/L). Den valda enheten gäller för varje hårdhetsinmatning och resultat.","Is this a pH calculator or a fish-care recommendation?":"Är detta en pH-kalkylator eller en fiskvårdsrekommendation?","No. pH does not mix linearly, and suitable aquarium water depends on species and other chemistry. This tool only estimates GH/KH blend proportions from supplied measurements.":"Nr. pH blandas inte linjärt, och lämpligt akvarievatten beror på arter och annan kemi. Detta verktyg uppskattar endast GH/KH-blandningsproportioner från medföljande mått.","Water source A":"Vattenkälla A","Water source B":"Vattenkälla B","Source A label":"Källa A-etikett","Source B label":"Källa B-etikett","Enter measured GH and KH for each source. For example, source A can be tap water and source B reverse-osmosis water.":"Ange uppmätt GH och KH för varje källa. Till exempel kan källa A vara kranvatten och källa B vatten med omvänd osmos.","Hardness unit":"Hårdhetsenhet","German degrees (°dH)":"Tyska grader (°dH)","French degrees (°fH)":"Franska grader (°fH)","mg/L as CaCO3 (ppm)":"mg/L som CaCO3 (ppm)","Milliequivalents per litre (meq/L)":"Milliekvivalenter per liter (mekv/l)","General hardness (GH)":"Allmän hårdhet (GH)","Carbonate hardness (KH)":"Karbonathårdhet (KH)","Target water":"Målvatten","Final batch volume (litres)":"Slutlig batchvolym (liter)","Calculate blend":"Beräkna blandning","Clear values":"Rensa värden","Enter both water sources and your target GH/KH.":"Ange både vattenkällor och ditt mål GH/KH.","Both target values can be reached with one blend ratio.":"Båda målvärdena kan nås med ett blandningsförhållande.","GH and KH require different blend ratios; these two sources cannot reach both targets together.":"GH och KH kräver olika blandningsförhållanden; dessa två källor kan inte nå båda målen tillsammans.","At least one target is outside the range between the two source waters.":"Minst ett mål ligger utanför intervallet mellan de två källvattnen.","Source A volume":"Källa A volym","Source B volume":"Källa B volym","Source A share":"Källa A-andel","Predicted blend":"Förutspådd blandning","Predicted GH":"Förutspådd GH","Predicted KH":"Förutspådd KH","Source A share required by GH":"Källa En andel som krävs av GH","Source A share required by KH":"Källa En andel som krävs av KH","Comparison tolerance":"Jämförelsestolerans","Unit conversion: 1 °dH = 17.848 mg/L CaCO3; 1 °fH = 10 mg/L CaCO3; 1 meq/L = 50 mg/L CaCO3.":"Enhetskonvertering: 1 °dH = 17.848 mg/L CaCO3; 1 °fH = 10 mg/L CaCO3; 1 mekv/L = 50 mg/L CaCO3.","All calculations run locally in this browser; no water measurements are uploaded.":"Alla beräkningar körs lokalt i den här webbläsaren; inga vattenmätningar laddas upp.","Check the values: hardness must be 0–10,000 and final volume 0–100,000 litres.":"Kontrollera värdena: hårdheten måste vara 0–10,000 och slutvolymen 0–100,000 liter.","Unit conversion factors":"Enhetsomvandlingsfaktorer","mg/L as CaCO3":"mg/L som CaCO3","meq/L":"mekv/L","A compatible result is an estimate within 0.05 °dH; real test kits and water chemistry have measurement variation.":"Ett kompatibelt resultat är en uppskattning inom 0.05 °dH; riktiga testkit och vattenkemi har mätvariationer."},"sw":{"Aquarium Water Mixing Calculator":"Kikokotoo cha Kuchanganya Maji ya Aquarium","Aquarium Water Mixing Calculator — Free GH & KH Planner":"Kikokotoo cha Kuchanganya Maji ya Aquarium - Kipangaji cha GH bila malipo na KH","Mix two water sources by measured GH and KH. Convert German, French, ppm and meq/L hardness units, check if both targets are compatible, and calculate litres locally.":"Changanya vyanzo viwili vya maji kwa kipimo cha GH na KH. Badilisha vitengo vya ugumu vya Kijerumani, Kifaransa, ppm na meq/L, angalia ikiwa malengo yote mawili yanalingana na ukokote lita katika eneo lako.","Plan an aquarium water blend from two measured sources. The calculator solves general hardness (GH) and carbonate hardness (KH) together, rather than assuming reverse-osmosis water is exactly zero.":"Panga mchanganyiko wa maji ya aquarium kutoka vyanzo viwili vilivyopimwa. Kikokotoo kinatatua ugumu wa jumla (GH) na ugumu wa kaboni (KH) pamoja, badala ya kuchukulia kuwa maji ya reverse-osmosis ni sufuri haswa.","Example: mix tap water at GH 10 / KH 5 with RO water at GH 0 / KH 0. A 50% blend produces about GH 5 / KH 2.5; a different pair of targets may require incompatible blend ratios.":"Mfano: changanya maji ya bomba kwenye GH 10 / KH 5 na RO maji kwa GH 0 / KH 0. Mchanganyiko wa 50% hutoa kuhusu GH 5 / KH 2.5; jozi tofauti ya shabaha inaweza kuhitaji uwiano wa mchanganyiko usiolingana.","Each hardness value is converted to German degrees for calculation. GH and KH are treated as linearly mixable measured concentrations; the tool checks both independently and only gives a water recipe when the two results agree within 0.05 °dH.":"Kila thamani ya ugumu inabadilishwa kuwa digrii za Kijerumani kwa kukokotoa. GH na KH huchukuliwa kama viwango vya kipimo vinavyoweza kuchanganya; zana hukagua zote mbili kwa kujitegemea na kutoa kichocheo cha maji tu wakati matokeo mawili yanapokubaliana ndani ya 0.05 °dH.","This is a mixing estimate, not a pH or species-care recommendation. It does not model remineralization, buffers, acids, substrate effects, evaporation or measurement error. Test your water and follow reliable aquarium-care guidance.":"Hili ni makadirio mseto, si pH au pendekezo la utunzaji wa spishi. Haifanyi mfano wa kurejesha madini, vihifadhi, asidi, athari za substrate, uvukizi au hitilafu ya kipimo. Jaribu maji yako na ufuate mwongozo wa kuaminika wa utunzaji wa maji.","Mixing example":"Mfano wa kuchanganya","How GH/KH mixing works":"Jinsi uchanganyaji wa GH/KH unavyofanya kazi","Aquarium water mixing questions":"Maswali ya kuchanganya maji ya Aquarium","Assumptions and limits":"Mawazo na mipaka","What do GH and KH mean?":"Je, GH na KH inamaanisha nini?","GH is general hardness, mainly dissolved calcium and magnesium. KH is carbonate hardness/alkalinity as reported by your test. They are separate measurements and are not interchangeable.":"GH ni ugumu wa jumla, hasa kalsiamu iliyoyeyushwa na magnesiamu. KH ni ugumu wa kaboni/alkali kama ilivyoripotiwa na jaribio lako. Ni vipimo tofauti na havibadilishwi.","Does reverse-osmosis water always have zero hardness?":"Je, maji ya reverse-osmosis huwa na ugumu sufuri kila wakati?","No. Enter the GH and KH you actually measured for both sources. The calculator does not silently assume either source is pure water.":"Na. Weka GH na KH ulizopima kwa vyanzo vyote viwili. Kikokotoo hakichukui kimya chanzo chochote ni maji safi.","Why can my GH and KH targets be incompatible?":"Kwa nini shabaha zangu za GH na KH zinaweza kutofautiana?","One blend percentage must satisfy both values. If GH requires a different source ratio from KH, two-source mixing alone cannot reach both targets; the tool reports that instead of making up a recipe.":"Asilimia moja ya mchanganyiko lazima itimize thamani zote mbili. Ikiwa GH inahitaji uwiano tofauti wa chanzo kutoka kwa KH, mchanganyiko wa vyanzo viwili pekee hauwezi kufikia malengo yote mawili; chombo kinaripoti kuwa badala ya kutengeneza kichocheo.","Which units can I convert?":"Ni vitengo vipi ninaweza kubadilisha?","German degrees (°dH), French degrees (°fH), mg/L as CaCO3 (ppm), and milliequivalents per litre (meq/L). The selected unit applies to every hardness input and result.":"Digrii za Kijerumani (°dH), digrii za Kifaransa (°fH), mg/L kama CaCO3 (ppm), na milliequivalents kwa lita (meq/L). Kitengo kilichochaguliwa kinatumika kwa kila pembejeo na matokeo ya ugumu.","Is this a pH calculator or a fish-care recommendation?":"Je, hiki ni kikokotoo cha pH au pendekezo la utunzaji wa samaki?","No. pH does not mix linearly, and suitable aquarium water depends on species and other chemistry. This tool only estimates GH/KH blend proportions from supplied measurements.":"Na. pH haichanganyiki kwa mstari, na maji ya aquarium yanafaa hutegemea aina na kemia nyingine. Zana hii inakadiria tu uwiano wa mchanganyiko wa GH/KH kutoka kwa vipimo vilivyotolewa.","Water source A":"Chanzo cha maji A","Water source B":"Chanzo cha maji B","Source A label":"Chanzo A lebo","Source B label":"Chanzo B","Enter measured GH and KH for each source. For example, source A can be tap water and source B reverse-osmosis water.":"Ingiza GH na KH iliyopimwa kwa kila chanzo. Kwa mfano, chanzo A kinaweza kuwa maji ya bomba na chanzo B reverse-osmosis maji.","Hardness unit":"Kitengo cha ugumu","German degrees (°dH)":"Digrii za Kijerumani (°dH)","French degrees (°fH)":"digrii za Kifaransa (°fH)","mg/L as CaCO3 (ppm)":"mg/L kama CaCO3 (ppm)","Milliequivalents per litre (meq/L)":"Milliequivalents kwa lita (meq/L)","General hardness (GH)":"Ugumu wa jumla (GH)","Carbonate hardness (KH)":"Ugumu wa kaboni (KH)","Target water":"Maji lengwa","Final batch volume (litres)":"Kiasi cha bechi ya mwisho (lita)","Calculate blend":"Mahesabu ya mchanganyiko","Clear values":"Futa maadili","Enter both water sources and your target GH/KH.":"Ingiza vyanzo vyote vya maji na GH/KH unayolenga.","Both target values can be reached with one blend ratio.":"Thamani zote mbili lengwa zinaweza kufikiwa kwa uwiano mmoja wa mchanganyiko.","GH and KH require different blend ratios; these two sources cannot reach both targets together.":"GH na KH zinahitaji uwiano tofauti wa mchanganyiko; vyanzo hivi viwili haviwezi kufikia malengo yote mawili kwa pamoja.","At least one target is outside the range between the two source waters.":"Angalau lengo moja liko nje ya masafa kati ya vyanzo viwili vya maji.","Source A volume":"Chanzo A kiasi","Source B volume":"Chanzo B kiasi","Source A share":"Chanzo A","Predicted blend":"Mchanganyiko uliotabiriwa","Predicted GH":"Iliyotabiriwa GH","Predicted KH":"Iliyotabiriwa KH","Source A share required by GH":"Chanzo Hisa inahitajika na GH","Source A share required by KH":"Chanzo Hisa inahitajika na KH","Comparison tolerance":"Uvumilivu wa kulinganisha","Unit conversion: 1 °dH = 17.848 mg/L CaCO3; 1 °fH = 10 mg/L CaCO3; 1 meq/L = 50 mg/L CaCO3.":"Ubadilishaji wa kitengo: 1 °dH = 17.848 mg/L CaCO3; 1 °fH = 10 mg/L CaCO3; 1 meq/L = 50 mg/L CaCO3.","All calculations run locally in this browser; no water measurements are uploaded.":"Mahesabu yote yanaendeshwa ndani ya kivinjari hiki; hakuna vipimo vya maji vinavyopakiwa.","Check the values: hardness must be 0–10,000 and final volume 0–100,000 litres.":"Angalia thamani: ugumu lazima uwe 0–10,000 na ujazo wa mwisho 0–100,000 lita.","Unit conversion factors":"Vitengo vya ubadilishaji","mg/L as CaCO3":"mg/L kama CaCO3","meq/L":"meq/L","A compatible result is an estimate within 0.05 °dH; real test kits and water chemistry have measurement variation.":"Matokeo yanayolingana ni makadirio ndani ya 0.05 °dH; vifaa vya majaribio halisi na kemia ya maji vina tofauti ya kipimo."},"ta":{"Aquarium Water Mixing Calculator":"அக்வாரியம் வாட்டர் மிக்ஸிங் கால்குலேட்டர்","Aquarium Water Mixing Calculator — Free GH & KH Planner":"Aquarium Water Mixing Calculator — இலவச GH & KH திட்டமிடுபவர்","Mix two water sources by measured GH and KH. Convert German, French, ppm and meq/L hardness units, check if both targets are compatible, and calculate litres locally.":"அளக்கப்பட்ட GH மற்றும் KH மூலம் இரண்டு நீர் ஆதாரங்களைக் கலக்கவும். ஜெர்மன், பிரஞ்சு, ppm மற்றும் meq/L கடினத்தன்மை அலகுகளை மாற்றவும், இரண்டு இலக்குகளும் இணக்கமாக உள்ளதா எனச் சரிபார்த்து, உள்நாட்டில் லிட்டர்களைக் கணக்கிடவும்.","Plan an aquarium water blend from two measured sources. The calculator solves general hardness (GH) and carbonate hardness (KH) together, rather than assuming reverse-osmosis water is exactly zero.":"அளவிக்கப்பட்ட இரண்டு மூலங்களிலிருந்து மீன் நீர் கலவையைத் திட்டமிடுங்கள். கால்குலேட்டர் பொது கடினத்தன்மை (GH) மற்றும் கார்பனேட் கடினத்தன்மை (KH) ஆகியவற்றை ஒன்றாக தீர்க்கிறது, மாறாக தலைகீழ் சவ்வூடுபரவல் நீர் சரியாக பூஜ்ஜியம் என்று கருதுகிறது.","Example: mix tap water at GH 10 / KH 5 with RO water at GH 0 / KH 0. A 50% blend produces about GH 5 / KH 2.5; a different pair of targets may require incompatible blend ratios.":"எடுத்துக்காட்டு: குழாய் நீரை GH 10 / KH 5 இல் RO நீருடன் GH 0 / KH 0 இல் கலக்கவும். ஒரு 50% கலவை சுமார் GH 5 / KH 2.5; வெவ்வேறு ஜோடி இலக்குகளுக்கு பொருந்தாத கலப்பு விகிதங்கள் தேவைப்படலாம்.","Each hardness value is converted to German degrees for calculation. GH and KH are treated as linearly mixable measured concentrations; the tool checks both independently and only gives a water recipe when the two results agree within 0.05 °dH.":"ஒவ்வொரு கடினத்தன்மை மதிப்பும் கணக்கிடுவதற்காக ஜெர்மன் டிகிரிக்கு மாற்றப்படுகிறது. GH மற்றும் KH ஆகியவை நேரியல் முறையில் கலக்கக்கூடிய அளவிடப்பட்ட செறிவுகளாகக் கருதப்படுகின்றன; இரண்டு முடிவுகளும் 0.05 °dH க்குள் ஒத்துப்போகும் போது கருவி இரண்டையும் சுயாதீனமாகச் சரிபார்த்து, தண்ணீர் செய்முறையை மட்டுமே வழங்குகிறது.","This is a mixing estimate, not a pH or species-care recommendation. It does not model remineralization, buffers, acids, substrate effects, evaporation or measurement error. Test your water and follow reliable aquarium-care guidance.":"இது கலப்பு மதிப்பீடு, pH அல்லது இனங்கள் பராமரிப்பு பரிந்துரை அல்ல. இது மீளுருவாக்கம், பஃபர்கள், அமிலங்கள், அடி மூலக்கூறு விளைவுகள், ஆவியாதல் அல்லது அளவீட்டுப் பிழையை மாதிரியாகக் கொண்டிருக்கவில்லை. உங்கள் தண்ணீரைச் சோதித்து, நம்பகமான மீன்வள பராமரிப்பு வழிகாட்டுதலைப் பின்பற்றவும்.","Mixing example":"கலவை உதாரணம்","How GH/KH mixing works":"GH/KH கலவை எவ்வாறு செயல்படுகிறது","Aquarium water mixing questions":"அக்வாரியம் வாட்டர் கலக்கும் கேள்விகள்","Assumptions and limits":"அனுமானங்கள் மற்றும் வரம்புகள்","What do GH and KH mean?":"GH மற்றும் KH என்றால் என்ன?","GH is general hardness, mainly dissolved calcium and magnesium. KH is carbonate hardness/alkalinity as reported by your test. They are separate measurements and are not interchangeable.":"GH என்பது பொதுவான கடினத்தன்மை, முக்கியமாக கரைந்த கால்சியம் மற்றும் மெக்னீசியம். KH என்பது கார்பனேட் கடினத்தன்மை/காரத்தன்மை என்பது உங்கள் சோதனையில் தெரிவிக்கப்பட்டுள்ளது. அவை தனித்தனி அளவீடுகள் மற்றும் ஒன்றுக்கொன்று மாற்ற முடியாதவை.","Does reverse-osmosis water always have zero hardness?":"தலைகீழ் சவ்வூடுபரவல் நீர் எப்போதும் பூஜ்ஜிய கடினத்தன்மை கொண்டதா?","No. Enter the GH and KH you actually measured for both sources. The calculator does not silently assume either source is pure water.":"எண். இரண்டு மூலங்களுக்கும் நீங்கள் உண்மையில் அளவிடப்பட்ட GH மற்றும் KH ஐ உள்ளிடவும். கால்குலேட்டர் எந்த ஆதாரமும் தூய நீர் என்று அமைதியாக கருதவில்லை.","Why can my GH and KH targets be incompatible?":"எனது GH மற்றும் KH இலக்குகள் ஏன் பொருந்தாது?","One blend percentage must satisfy both values. If GH requires a different source ratio from KH, two-source mixing alone cannot reach both targets; the tool reports that instead of making up a recipe.":"ஒரு கலப்பு சதவீதம் இரண்டு மதிப்புகளையும் பூர்த்தி செய்ய வேண்டும். GH க்கு KH இலிருந்து வேறுபட்ட மூல விகிதம் தேவைப்பட்டால், இரண்டு-மூலக் கலவை மட்டுமே இரண்டு இலக்குகளையும் அடைய முடியாது; ஒரு செய்முறையை உருவாக்குவதற்கு பதிலாக என்று கருவி தெரிவிக்கிறது.","Which units can I convert?":"நான் எந்த யூனிட்களை மாற்றலாம்?","German degrees (°dH), French degrees (°fH), mg/L as CaCO3 (ppm), and milliequivalents per litre (meq/L). The selected unit applies to every hardness input and result.":"ஜெர்மன் டிகிரி (°dH), பிரஞ்சு டிகிரி (°fH), mg/L என CaCO3 (பிபிஎம்), மற்றும் ஒரு லிட்டருக்கு மில்லிகிவெலண்டுகள் (meq/L). தேர்ந்தெடுக்கப்பட்ட அலகு ஒவ்வொரு கடினத்தன்மை உள்ளீடு மற்றும் முடிவுகளுக்கு பொருந்தும்.","Is this a pH calculator or a fish-care recommendation?":"இது pH கால்குலேட்டரா அல்லது மீன் பராமரிப்புப் பரிந்துரையா?","No. pH does not mix linearly, and suitable aquarium water depends on species and other chemistry. This tool only estimates GH/KH blend proportions from supplied measurements.":"எண். pH நேர்கோட்டில் கலக்காது, மேலும் பொருத்தமான மீன் நீர் இனங்கள் மற்றும் பிற வேதியியலை சார்ந்துள்ளது. இந்த கருவி வழங்கப்பட்ட அளவீடுகளிலிருந்து GH/KH கலப்பு விகிதத்தை மட்டுமே மதிப்பிடுகிறது.","Water source A":"நீர் ஆதாரம் ஏ","Water source B":"நீர் ஆதாரம் பி","Source A label":"Source A லேபிள்","Source B label":"மூல B லேபிள்","Enter measured GH and KH for each source. For example, source A can be tap water and source B reverse-osmosis water.":"ஒவ்வொரு மூலத்திற்கும் அளவிடப்பட்ட GH மற்றும் KH ஐ உள்ளிடவும். எடுத்துக்காட்டாக, மூல A என்பது குழாய் நீராகவும் மற்றும் ஆதாரம் B ரிவர்ஸ் சவ்வூடுபரவல் நீராகவும் இருக்கலாம்.","Hardness unit":"கடினத்தன்மை அலகு","German degrees (°dH)":"ஜெர்மன் டிகிரி (°dH)","French degrees (°fH)":"பிரஞ்சு டிகிரி (°fH)","mg/L as CaCO3 (ppm)":"mg/L ஆக CaCO3 (பிபிஎம்)","Milliequivalents per litre (meq/L)":"லிட்டருக்கு மில்லி சமமானவை (meq/L)","General hardness (GH)":"பொது கடினத்தன்மை (GH)","Carbonate hardness (KH)":"கார்பனேட் கடினத்தன்மை (KH)","Target water":"இலக்கு நீர்","Final batch volume (litres)":"இறுதி தொகுதி அளவு (லிட்டர்)","Calculate blend":"கலவையைக் கணக்கிடு","Clear values":"மதிப்புகளை அழிக்கவும்","Enter both water sources and your target GH/KH.":"நீர் ஆதாரங்கள் மற்றும் உங்கள் இலக்கு GH/KH இரண்டையும் உள்ளிடவும்.","Both target values can be reached with one blend ratio.":"இரண்டு இலக்கு மதிப்புகளையும் ஒரு கலப்பு விகிதத்தில் அடையலாம்.","GH and KH require different blend ratios; these two sources cannot reach both targets together.":"GH மற்றும் KH க்கு வெவ்வேறு கலப்பு விகிதங்கள் தேவை; இந்த இரண்டு ஆதாரங்களும் ஒன்றாக இரு இலக்குகளையும் அடைய முடியாது.","At least one target is outside the range between the two source waters.":"குறைந்தது ஒரு இலக்காவது இரண்டு மூல நீர்நிலைகளுக்கு இடையே வரம்பிற்கு வெளியே உள்ளது.","Source A volume":"மூல A தொகுதி","Source B volume":"மூல B தொகுதி","Source A share":"Source A share","Predicted blend":"கணிக்கப்பட்ட கலவை","Predicted GH":"கணிக்கப்பட்ட GH","Predicted KH":"கணிக்கப்பட்ட KH","Source A share required by GH":"ஆதாரம் GH க்கு தேவையான பங்கு","Source A share required by KH":"மூலம் KH க்கு ஒரு பங்கு தேவை","Comparison tolerance":"ஒப்பீடு சகிப்புத்தன்மை","Unit conversion: 1 °dH = 17.848 mg/L CaCO3; 1 °fH = 10 mg/L CaCO3; 1 meq/L = 50 mg/L CaCO3.":"அலகு மாற்றம்: 1 °dH = 17.848 mg/L CaCO3; 1 °fH = 10 mg/L CaCO3; 1 meq/L = 50 mg/L CaCO3.","All calculations run locally in this browser; no water measurements are uploaded.":"இந்த உலாவியில் அனைத்து கணக்கீடுகளும் உள்நாட்டில் இயங்கும்; நீர் அளவீடுகள் பதிவேற்றப்படவில்லை.","Check the values: hardness must be 0–10,000 and final volume 0–100,000 litres.":"மதிப்புகளைச் சரிபார்க்கவும்: கடினத்தன்மை 0–10,000 மற்றும் இறுதி தொகுதி 0-100,000 லிட்டராக இருக்க வேண்டும்.","Unit conversion factors":"அலகு மாற்ற காரணிகள்","mg/L as CaCO3":"mg/L ஆக CaCO3","meq/L":"meq/L","A compatible result is an estimate within 0.05 °dH; real test kits and water chemistry have measurement variation.":"இணக்கமான முடிவு என்பது 0.05 °dH க்குள் மதிப்பீடு ஆகும்; உண்மையான சோதனைக் கருவிகள் மற்றும் நீர் வேதியியல் ஆகியவை அளவீட்டு மாறுபாட்டைக் கொண்டுள்ளன."},"te":{"Aquarium Water Mixing Calculator":"అక్వేరియం వాటర్ మిక్సింగ్ కాలిక్యులేటర్","Aquarium Water Mixing Calculator — Free GH & KH Planner":"అక్వేరియం వాటర్ మిక్సింగ్ కాలిక్యులేటర్ — ఉచిత GH & KH ప్లానర్","Mix two water sources by measured GH and KH. Convert German, French, ppm and meq/L hardness units, check if both targets are compatible, and calculate litres locally.":"కొలిచిన GH మరియు KH ద్వారా రెండు నీటి వనరులను కలపండి. జర్మన్, ఫ్రెంచ్, ppm మరియు meq/L కాఠిన్యం యూనిట్‌లను మార్చండి, రెండు లక్ష్యాలు అనుకూలంగా ఉన్నాయో లేదో తనిఖీ చేయండి మరియు స్థానికంగా లీటర్లను లెక్కించండి.","Plan an aquarium water blend from two measured sources. The calculator solves general hardness (GH) and carbonate hardness (KH) together, rather than assuming reverse-osmosis water is exactly zero.":"రెండు కొలిచిన మూలాల నుండి అక్వేరియం నీటి మిశ్రమాన్ని ప్లాన్ చేయండి. కాలిక్యులేటర్ సాధారణ కాఠిన్యం (GH) మరియు కార్బోనేట్ కాఠిన్యాన్ని (KH) కలిసి పరిష్కరిస్తుంది, రివర్స్-ఓస్మోసిస్ నీరు ఖచ్చితంగా సున్నా అని భావించడం కంటే.","Example: mix tap water at GH 10 / KH 5 with RO water at GH 0 / KH 0. A 50% blend produces about GH 5 / KH 2.5; a different pair of targets may require incompatible blend ratios.":"ఉదాహరణ: పంపు నీటిని GH 10 / KH 5 వద్ద RO వాటర్‌తో GH 0 / KH 0 వద్ద కలపండి. ఒక 50% మిశ్రమం దాదాపు GH 5 / KH 2.5ని ఉత్పత్తి చేస్తుంది; వేరొక జత లక్ష్యాలకు అననుకూల మిశ్రమ నిష్పత్తులు అవసరం కావచ్చు.","Each hardness value is converted to German degrees for calculation. GH and KH are treated as linearly mixable measured concentrations; the tool checks both independently and only gives a water recipe when the two results agree within 0.05 °dH.":"గణన కోసం ప్రతి కాఠిన్యం విలువ జర్మన్ డిగ్రీలకు మార్చబడుతుంది. GH మరియు KHలను సరళంగా కలపగలిగే కొలిచిన సాంద్రతలుగా పరిగణిస్తారు; సాధనం స్వతంత్రంగా రెండింటినీ తనిఖీ చేస్తుంది మరియు 0.05 °dH లోపల రెండు ఫలితాలు ఏకీభవించినప్పుడు మాత్రమే నీటి వంటకాన్ని అందిస్తుంది.","This is a mixing estimate, not a pH or species-care recommendation. It does not model remineralization, buffers, acids, substrate effects, evaporation or measurement error. Test your water and follow reliable aquarium-care guidance.":"ఇది మిక్సింగ్ అంచనా, pH లేదా జాతుల సంరక్షణ సిఫార్సు కాదు. ఇది రీమినరలైజేషన్, బఫర్‌లు, యాసిడ్‌లు, సబ్‌స్ట్రేట్ ఎఫెక్ట్స్, బాష్పీభవనం లేదా కొలత లోపాన్ని మోడల్ చేయదు. మీ నీటిని పరీక్షించండి మరియు నమ్మకమైన అక్వేరియం-కేర్ మార్గదర్శకాలను అనుసరించండి.","Mixing example":"మిక్సింగ్ ఉదాహరణ","How GH/KH mixing works":"GH/KH మిక్సింగ్ ఎలా పని చేస్తుంది","Aquarium water mixing questions":"అక్వేరియం వాటర్ మిక్సింగ్ ప్రశ్నలు","Assumptions and limits":"ఊహలు మరియు పరిమితులు","What do GH and KH mean?":"GH మరియు KH అంటే ఏమిటి?","GH is general hardness, mainly dissolved calcium and magnesium. KH is carbonate hardness/alkalinity as reported by your test. They are separate measurements and are not interchangeable.":"GH అనేది సాధారణ కాఠిన్యం, ప్రధానంగా కరిగిన కాల్షియం మరియు మెగ్నీషియం. KH అనేది మీ పరీక్ష ద్వారా నివేదించబడిన కార్బోనేట్ కాఠిన్యం/క్షారత్వం. అవి వేర్వేరు కొలతలు మరియు పరస్పరం మార్చుకోలేవు.","Does reverse-osmosis water always have zero hardness?":"రివర్స్ ఆస్మాసిస్ నీరు ఎల్లప్పుడూ సున్నా కాఠిన్యాన్ని కలిగి ఉంటుందా?","No. Enter the GH and KH you actually measured for both sources. The calculator does not silently assume either source is pure water.":"నం. మీరు రెండు మూలాధారాల కోసం కొలిచిన GH మరియు KHలను నమోదు చేయండి. కాలిక్యులేటర్ ఏదైనా మూలం స్వచ్ఛమైన నీరు అని నిశ్శబ్దంగా భావించదు.","Why can my GH and KH targets be incompatible?":"నా GH మరియు KH లక్ష్యాలు ఎందుకు అనుకూలంగా ఉండవు?","One blend percentage must satisfy both values. If GH requires a different source ratio from KH, two-source mixing alone cannot reach both targets; the tool reports that instead of making up a recipe.":"ఒక మిశ్రమ శాతం తప్పనిసరిగా రెండు విలువలను సంతృప్తిపరచాలి. GHకి KH నుండి వేరొక మూలాధార నిష్పత్తి అవసరమైతే, రెండు-మూలాల మిక్సింగ్ మాత్రమే రెండు లక్ష్యాలను చేరుకోలేదు; సాధనం ఒక రెసిపీని తయారు చేయడానికి బదులుగా నివేదిస్తుంది.","Which units can I convert?":"నేను ఏ యూనిట్లను మార్చగలను?","German degrees (°dH), French degrees (°fH), mg/L as CaCO3 (ppm), and milliequivalents per litre (meq/L). The selected unit applies to every hardness input and result.":"జర్మన్ డిగ్రీలు (°dH), ఫ్రెంచ్ డిగ్రీలు (°fH), mg/Lగా CaCO3 (ppm), మరియు లీటరుకు మిల్లీక్వివలెంట్‌లు (meq/L). ఎంచుకున్న యూనిట్ ప్రతి కాఠిన్యం ఇన్‌పుట్ మరియు ఫలితానికి వర్తిస్తుంది.","Is this a pH calculator or a fish-care recommendation?":"ఇది pH కాలిక్యులేటర్ లేదా చేపల సంరక్షణ సిఫార్సునా?","No. pH does not mix linearly, and suitable aquarium water depends on species and other chemistry. This tool only estimates GH/KH blend proportions from supplied measurements.":"నం. pH సరళంగా కలపదు మరియు తగిన అక్వేరియం నీరు జాతులు మరియు ఇతర రసాయన శాస్త్రంపై ఆధారపడి ఉంటుంది. ఈ సాధనం సరఫరా చేయబడిన కొలతల నుండి GH/KH మిశ్రమ నిష్పత్తిని మాత్రమే అంచనా వేస్తుంది.","Water source A":"నీటి వనరు A","Water source B":"నీటి వనరు B","Source A label":"మూలం A లేబుల్","Source B label":"మూలం B లేబుల్","Enter measured GH and KH for each source. For example, source A can be tap water and source B reverse-osmosis water.":"ప్రతి మూలానికి కొలిచిన GH మరియు KHలను నమోదు చేయండి. ఉదాహరణకు, మూలం A అనేది పంపు నీరు మరియు మూలం B రివర్స్-ఆస్మాసిస్ నీరు.","Hardness unit":"కాఠిన్యం యూనిట్","German degrees (°dH)":"జర్మన్ డిగ్రీలు (°dH)","French degrees (°fH)":"ఫ్రెంచ్ డిగ్రీలు (°fH)","mg/L as CaCO3 (ppm)":"mg/Lగా CaCO3 (ppm)","Milliequivalents per litre (meq/L)":"లీటరుకు మిల్లీ ఈక్వివెంట్స్ (meq/L)","General hardness (GH)":"సాధారణ కాఠిన్యం (GH)","Carbonate hardness (KH)":"కార్బోనేట్ కాఠిన్యం (KH)","Target water":"టార్గెట్ వాటర్","Final batch volume (litres)":"ఫైనల్ బ్యాచ్ వాల్యూమ్ (లీటర్లు)","Calculate blend":"బ్లెండ్‌ను లెక్కించండి","Clear values":"విలువలను క్లియర్ చేయండి","Enter both water sources and your target GH/KH.":"నీటి వనరులు మరియు మీ లక్ష్యం GH/KH రెండింటినీ నమోదు చేయండి.","Both target values can be reached with one blend ratio.":"రెండు లక్ష్య విలువలను ఒక మిశ్రమ నిష్పత్తితో చేరుకోవచ్చు.","GH and KH require different blend ratios; these two sources cannot reach both targets together.":"GH మరియు KHలకు వేర్వేరు మిశ్రమ నిష్పత్తులు అవసరం; ఈ రెండు మూలాలు కలిసి రెండు లక్ష్యాలను చేరుకోలేవు.","At least one target is outside the range between the two source waters.":"రెండు మూలాధార జలాల మధ్య కనీసం ఒక లక్ష్యం పరిధి వెలుపల ఉంది.","Source A volume":"మూలం A వాల్యూమ్","Source B volume":"మూలం B వాల్యూమ్","Source A share":"మూలం A షేర్","Predicted blend":"ఊహించిన మిశ్రమం","Predicted GH":"ఊహించబడిన GH","Predicted KH":"అంచనా KH","Source A share required by GH":"మూలం GHకి అవసరమైన వాటా","Source A share required by KH":"మూలం KHకి అవసరమైన వాటా","Comparison tolerance":"పోలిక సహనం","Unit conversion: 1 °dH = 17.848 mg/L CaCO3; 1 °fH = 10 mg/L CaCO3; 1 meq/L = 50 mg/L CaCO3.":"యూనిట్ మార్పిడి: 1 °dH = 17.848 mg/L CaCO3; 1 °fH = 10 mg/L CaCO3; 1 meq/L = 50 mg/L CaCO3.","All calculations run locally in this browser; no water measurements are uploaded.":"ఈ బ్రౌజర్‌లో అన్ని గణనలు స్థానికంగా అమలవుతాయి; నీటి కొలతలు అప్‌లోడ్ చేయబడలేదు.","Check the values: hardness must be 0–10,000 and final volume 0–100,000 litres.":"విలువలను తనిఖీ చేయండి: కాఠిన్యం తప్పనిసరిగా 0–10,000 మరియు చివరి వాల్యూమ్ 0–100,000 లీటర్లు ఉండాలి.","Unit conversion factors":"యూనిట్ మార్పిడి కారకాలు","mg/L as CaCO3":"mg/L గా CaCO3","meq/L":"meq/L","A compatible result is an estimate within 0.05 °dH; real test kits and water chemistry have measurement variation.":"అనుకూల ఫలితం 0.05 °dH లోపల అంచనా; నిజమైన టెస్ట్ కిట్‌లు మరియు నీటి కెమిస్ట్రీ కొలత వైవిధ్యాన్ని కలిగి ఉంటాయి."},"th":{"Aquarium Water Mixing Calculator":"เครื่องคิดเลขผสมน้ำตู้ปลา","Aquarium Water Mixing Calculator — Free GH & KH Planner":"เครื่องคำนวณการผสมน้ำในตู้ปลา — ฟรี GH & KH Planner","Mix two water sources by measured GH and KH. Convert German, French, ppm and meq/L hardness units, check if both targets are compatible, and calculate litres locally.":"ผสมแหล่งน้ำสองแห่งโดยวัด GH และ KH แปลงหน่วยความแข็งของเยอรมัน ฝรั่งเศส ppm และ meq/L ตรวจสอบว่าทั้งสองเป้าหมายเข้ากันได้หรือไม่ และคำนวณลิตรในพื้นที่","Plan an aquarium water blend from two measured sources. The calculator solves general hardness (GH) and carbonate hardness (KH) together, rather than assuming reverse-osmosis water is exactly zero.":"วางแผนการผสมน้ำในตู้ปลาจากแหล่งที่ตรวจวัดได้สองแหล่ง เครื่องคิดเลขจะแก้ความกระด้างทั่วไป (GH) และความกระด้างของคาร์บอเนต (KH) ร่วมกัน แทนที่จะคิดว่าน้ำรีเวิร์สออสโมซิสมีค่าเป็นศูนย์พอดี","Example: mix tap water at GH 10 / KH 5 with RO water at GH 0 / KH 0. A 50% blend produces about GH 5 / KH 2.5; a different pair of targets may require incompatible blend ratios.":"ตัวอย่าง: ผสมน้ำประปาที่ GH 10 / KH 5 กับน้ำ RO ที่ GH 0 / KH 0 การผสมผสาน 50% ให้ผลลัพธ์ประมาณ GH 5 / KH 2.5; เป้าหมายคู่อื่นอาจต้องใช้อัตราส่วนการผสมผสานที่เข้ากันไม่ได้","Each hardness value is converted to German degrees for calculation. GH and KH are treated as linearly mixable measured concentrations; the tool checks both independently and only gives a water recipe when the two results agree within 0.05 °dH.":"ค่าความแข็งแต่ละค่าจะถูกแปลงเป็นองศาเยอรมันเพื่อการคำนวณ GH และ KH ถือเป็นความเข้มข้นที่วัดได้แบบผสมเชิงเส้นได้ เครื่องมือจะตรวจสอบทั้งอย่างอิสระและให้สูตรน้ำเฉพาะเมื่อผลลัพธ์ทั้งสองสอดคล้องกันภายใน 0.05 °dH","This is a mixing estimate, not a pH or species-care recommendation. It does not model remineralization, buffers, acids, substrate effects, evaporation or measurement error. Test your water and follow reliable aquarium-care guidance.":"นี่คือค่าประมาณแบบผสม ไม่ใช่คำแนะนำเกี่ยวกับ pH หรือการดูแลสายพันธุ์ มันไม่ได้จำลองการจำลองแร่ธาตุ บัฟเฟอร์ กรด ผลกระทบของสารตั้งต้น การระเหย หรือข้อผิดพลาดในการวัดค่า ทดสอบน้ำของคุณและปฏิบัติตามคำแนะนำในการดูแลตู้ปลาที่เชื่อถือได้","Mixing example":"ตัวอย่างการผสม","How GH/KH mixing works":"วิธีการทำงานของการผสม GH/KH","Aquarium water mixing questions":"คำถามเกี่ยวกับการผสมน้ำในตู้ปลา","Assumptions and limits":"สมมติฐานและข้อจำกัด","What do GH and KH mean?":"GH และ KH หมายถึงอะไร","GH is general hardness, mainly dissolved calcium and magnesium. KH is carbonate hardness/alkalinity as reported by your test. They are separate measurements and are not interchangeable.":"GH คือความแข็งทั่วไป โดยส่วนใหญ่จะละลายแคลเซียมและแมกนีเซียม KH คือความแข็งของคาร์บอเนต/ความเป็นด่างตามที่รายงานโดยการทดสอบของคุณ เป็นการวัดแยกกันและไม่สามารถใช้แทนกันได้","Does reverse-osmosis water always have zero hardness?":"น้ำรีเวอร์สออสโมซิสมีความกระด้างเป็นศูนย์เสมอไปหรือไม่","No. Enter the GH and KH you actually measured for both sources. The calculator does not silently assume either source is pure water.":"No. ป้อน GH และ KH ที่คุณวัดได้จริงสำหรับทั้งสองแหล่ง เครื่องคิดเลขไม่ได้ถือว่าแหล่งใดแหล่งหนึ่งเป็นน้ำบริสุทธิ์","Why can my GH and KH targets be incompatible?":"เหตุใดเป้าหมาย GH และ KH ของฉันจึงเข้ากันไม่ได้","One blend percentage must satisfy both values. If GH requires a different source ratio from KH, two-source mixing alone cannot reach both targets; the tool reports that instead of making up a recipe.":"หนึ่งเปอร์เซ็นต์การผสมผสานต้องเป็นไปตามค่าทั้งสองค่า หาก GH ต้องการอัตราส่วนแหล่งที่มาที่แตกต่างจาก KH การผสมสองแหล่งเพียงอย่างเดียวไม่สามารถเข้าถึงทั้งสองเป้าหมายได้ เครื่องมือรายงานว่าแทนที่จะทำสูตร","Which units can I convert?":"ฉันสามารถแปลงหน่วยใดได้บ้าง","German degrees (°dH), French degrees (°fH), mg/L as CaCO3 (ppm), and milliequivalents per litre (meq/L). The selected unit applies to every hardness input and result.":"องศาเยอรมัน (°dH), องศาฝรั่งเศส (°fH), mg/L เป็น CaCO3 (ppm) และมิลลิเทียบเท่าต่อลิตร (meq/L) หน่วยที่เลือกใช้กับทุกค่าความแข็งและผลลัพธ์","Is this a pH calculator or a fish-care recommendation?":"นี่คือเครื่องคำนวณ pH หรือคำแนะนำในการดูแลปลา","No. pH does not mix linearly, and suitable aquarium water depends on species and other chemistry. This tool only estimates GH/KH blend proportions from supplied measurements.":"No. ค่า pH จะไม่ผสมกันเป็นเส้นตรง และน้ำในตู้ปลาที่เหมาะสมนั้นขึ้นอยู่กับสายพันธุ์และเคมีอื่นๆ เครื่องมือนี้จะประมาณเฉพาะสัดส่วนการผสมผสาน GH/KH จากการวัดที่ให้มา","Water source A":"แหล่งน้ำ A","Water source B":"แหล่งน้ำB","Source A label":"ป้ายแหล่งที่มา A","Source B label":"ป้ายแหล่งที่มา B","Enter measured GH and KH for each source. For example, source A can be tap water and source B reverse-osmosis water.":"ป้อน GH และ KH ที่วัดได้สำหรับแต่ละแหล่ง ตัวอย่างเช่น แหล่ง A อาจเป็นน้ำประปาและน้ำรีเวิร์สออสโมซิสจากแหล่ง B","Hardness unit":"หน่วยความแข็ง","German degrees (°dH)":"องศาเยอรมัน (°dH)","French degrees (°fH)":"องศาฝรั่งเศส (°fH)","mg/L as CaCO3 (ppm)":"มก./ลิตร เป็น CaCO3 (ppm)","Milliequivalents per litre (meq/L)":"มิลลิเทียบเท่าต่อลิตร (meq/L)","General hardness (GH)":"ความแข็งทั่วไป (GH)","Carbonate hardness (KH)":"ความแข็งคาร์บอเนต (KH)","Target water":"น้ำเป้าหมาย","Final batch volume (litres)":"ปริมาตรชุดสุดท้าย (ลิตร)","Calculate blend":"คำนวณส่วนผสม","Clear values":"ล้างค่า","Enter both water sources and your target GH/KH.":"ป้อนทั้งแหล่งน้ำและ GH/KH เป้าหมายของคุณ","Both target values can be reached with one blend ratio.":"สามารถเข้าถึงค่าเป้าหมายทั้งสองได้ด้วยอัตราส่วนการผสมเดียว","GH and KH require different blend ratios; these two sources cannot reach both targets together.":"GH และ KH ต้องการอัตราส่วนการผสมที่แตกต่างกัน แหล่งที่มาทั้งสองนี้ไม่สามารถเข้าถึงเป้าหมายทั้งสองร่วมกันได้","At least one target is outside the range between the two source waters.":"มีเป้าหมายอย่างน้อยหนึ่งเป้าหมายอยู่นอกช่วงระหว่างแหล่งน้ำทั้งสองแห่ง","Source A volume":"แหล่งที่มาของวอลุ่ม A","Source B volume":"วอลุ่มแหล่งที่มา B","Source A share":"แหล่งที่มา A การแชร์","Predicted blend":"ส่วนผสมที่คาดการณ์ไว้","Predicted GH":"GH ที่คาดการณ์ไว้","Predicted KH":"คำทำนาย KH","Source A share required by GH":"แหล่งที่มา A ที่ต้องการโดย GH","Source A share required by KH":"แหล่งที่มา A ส่วนแบ่งที่ต้องการโดย KH","Comparison tolerance":"ความทนทานต่อการเปรียบเทียบ","Unit conversion: 1 °dH = 17.848 mg/L CaCO3; 1 °fH = 10 mg/L CaCO3; 1 meq/L = 50 mg/L CaCO3.":"การแปลงหน่วย: 1 °dH = 17.848 มก./ลิตร CaCO3; 1 °fH = 10 มก./ลิตร CaCO3; 1 เมคิว/ลิตร = 50 มก./ลิตร CaCO3","All calculations run locally in this browser; no water measurements are uploaded.":"การคำนวณทั้งหมดทำงานภายในเบราว์เซอร์นี้ ไม่มีการอัปโหลดการวัดน้ำ","Check the values: hardness must be 0–10,000 and final volume 0–100,000 litres.":"ตรวจสอบค่า: ความแข็งต้องเป็น 0–10,000 และปริมาตรสุดท้าย 0–100,000 ลิตร","Unit conversion factors":"ปัจจัยการแปลงหน่วย","mg/L as CaCO3":"มก./ลิตรเป็น CaCO3","meq/L":"meq/L","A compatible result is an estimate within 0.05 °dH; real test kits and water chemistry have measurement variation.":"ผลลัพธ์ที่เข้ากันได้คือค่าประมาณภายใน 0.05 °dH; ชุดทดสอบจริงและเคมีของน้ำมีความแปรผันในการวัด"},"tl":{"Aquarium Water Mixing Calculator":"Aquarium Water Mixing Calculator","Aquarium Water Mixing Calculator — Free GH & KH Planner":"Aquarium Water Mixing Calculator — Libreng Planner ng GH at KH","Mix two water sources by measured GH and KH. Convert German, French, ppm and meq/L hardness units, check if both targets are compatible, and calculate litres locally.":"Paghaluin ang dalawang pinagmumulan ng tubig ayon sa sinusukat na GH at KH. I-convert ang mga unit ng hardness ng German, French, ppm at meq/L, tingnan kung magkatugma ang parehong mga target, at lokal na kalkulahin ang mga litro.","Plan an aquarium water blend from two measured sources. The calculator solves general hardness (GH) and carbonate hardness (KH) together, rather than assuming reverse-osmosis water is exactly zero.":"Magplano ng timpla ng tubig sa aquarium mula sa dalawang sinusukat na pinagmumulan. Ang calculator ay nagso-solve ng general hardness (GH) at carbonate hardness (KH) nang magkasama, sa halip na ipagpalagay na ang reverse-osmosis na tubig ay eksaktong zero.","Example: mix tap water at GH 10 / KH 5 with RO water at GH 0 / KH 0. A 50% blend produces about GH 5 / KH 2.5; a different pair of targets may require incompatible blend ratios.":"Halimbawa: paghaluin ang tubig sa gripo sa GH 10 / KH 5 sa RO water sa GH 0 / KH 0. Ang isang 50% na timpla ay gumagawa ng humigit-kumulang GH 5 / KH 2.5; ang ibang pares ng mga target ay maaaring mangailangan ng hindi tugmang mga ratio ng timpla.","Each hardness value is converted to German degrees for calculation. GH and KH are treated as linearly mixable measured concentrations; the tool checks both independently and only gives a water recipe when the two results agree within 0.05 °dH.":"Ang bawat value ng hardness ay kino-convert sa German degrees para sa pagkalkula. Ang GH at KH ay tinatrato bilang linearly mixable measured concentrations; ang tool ay nagsusuri ng parehong independyente at nagbibigay lamang ng isang recipe ng tubig kapag ang dalawang resulta ay sumang-ayon sa loob ng 0.05 °dH.","This is a mixing estimate, not a pH or species-care recommendation. It does not model remineralization, buffers, acids, substrate effects, evaporation or measurement error. Test your water and follow reliable aquarium-care guidance.":"Ito ay isang paghahalo na pagtatantya, hindi isang pH o rekomendasyon sa pangangalaga ng species. Hindi ito nagmomodelo ng remineralization, buffer, acid, substrate effect, evaporation o error sa pagsukat. Subukan ang iyong tubig at sundin ang maaasahang gabay sa pangangalaga sa aquarium.","Mixing example":"Halimbawa ng paghahalo","How GH/KH mixing works":"Paano gumagana ang paghahalo ng GH/KH","Aquarium water mixing questions":"Mga tanong sa paghahalo ng tubig sa aquarium","Assumptions and limits":"Mga pagpapalagay at limitasyon","What do GH and KH mean?":"Ano ang ibig sabihin ng GH at KH?\nAng","GH is general hardness, mainly dissolved calcium and magnesium. KH is carbonate hardness/alkalinity as reported by your test. They are separate measurements and are not interchangeable.":"GH ay pangkalahatang katigasan, pangunahin ang natunaw na calcium at magnesium. Ang KH ay carbonate hardness/alkalinity gaya ng iniulat ng iyong pagsubok. Ang mga ito ay hiwalay na mga sukat at hindi mapapalitan.","Does reverse-osmosis water always have zero hardness?":"Palagi bang walang tigas ang reverse-osmosis na tubig?","No. Enter the GH and KH you actually measured for both sources. The calculator does not silently assume either source is pure water.":"Hindi. Ilagay ang GH at KH na aktwal mong sinukat para sa parehong pinagmulan. Ang calculator ay hindi tahimik na ipinapalagay ang alinman sa pinagmulan ay purong tubig.","Why can my GH and KH targets be incompatible?":"Bakit maaaring hindi magkatugma ang aking mga target na GH at KH?","One blend percentage must satisfy both values. If GH requires a different source ratio from KH, two-source mixing alone cannot reach both targets; the tool reports that instead of making up a recipe.":"Dapat matugunan ng isang porsyento ng timpla ang parehong mga halaga. Kung ang GH ay nangangailangan ng ibang source ratio mula sa KH, ang dalawang pinagmumulan na paghahalo lamang ay hindi makakaabot sa parehong mga target; ang tool ay nag-uulat na sa halip na gumawa ng isang recipe.","Which units can I convert?":"Aling mga unit ang maaari kong i-convert?","German degrees (°dH), French degrees (°fH), mg/L as CaCO3 (ppm), and milliequivalents per litre (meq/L). The selected unit applies to every hardness input and result.":"German degrees (°dH), French degrees (°fH), mg/L bilang CaCO3 (ppm), at milliequivalents kada litro (meq/L). Nalalapat ang napiling unit sa bawat input at resulta ng hardness.","Is this a pH calculator or a fish-care recommendation?":"Ito ba ay isang pH calculator o isang rekomendasyon sa pangangalaga ng isda?","No. pH does not mix linearly, and suitable aquarium water depends on species and other chemistry. This tool only estimates GH/KH blend proportions from supplied measurements.":"Hindi. Ang pH ay hindi magkakahalo nang linear, at ang angkop na tubig sa aquarium ay nakasalalay sa mga species at iba pang kimika. Tinatantya lang ng tool na ito ang mga proporsyon ng timpla ng GH/KH mula sa mga ibinigay na sukat.","Water source A":"Pinagmulan ng tubig A","Water source B":"Pinagmulan ng tubig B","Source A label":"Pinagmulan A label","Source B label":"Label ng Source B","Enter measured GH and KH for each source. For example, source A can be tap water and source B reverse-osmosis water.":"Ilagay ang sinusukat na GH at KH para sa bawat source. Halimbawa, ang source A ay maaaring tubig mula sa gripo at source B na reverse-osmosis na tubig.","Hardness unit":"Hardness unit","German degrees (°dH)":"German degrees (°dH)","French degrees (°fH)":"French degrees (°fH)","mg/L as CaCO3 (ppm)":"mg/L bilang CaCO3 (ppm)","Milliequivalents per litre (meq/L)":"Milliequivalents bawat litro (meq/L)","General hardness (GH)":"Pangkalahatang tigas (GH)","Carbonate hardness (KH)":"Carbonate na tigas (KH)","Target water":"Target na tubig","Final batch volume (litres)":"Panghuling dami ng batch (litro)","Calculate blend":"Kalkulahin ang timpla","Clear values":"I-clear ang mga value","Enter both water sources and your target GH/KH.":"Ilagay ang parehong pinagmumulan ng tubig at ang iyong target na GH/KH.","Both target values can be reached with one blend ratio.":"Maaaring maabot ang parehong target na value sa isang blend ratio.\nAng","GH and KH require different blend ratios; these two sources cannot reach both targets together.":"GH at KH ay nangangailangan ng iba't ibang mga ratio ng timpla; hindi maaaring maabot ng dalawang mapagkukunang ito ang parehong mga target nang magkasama.","At least one target is outside the range between the two source waters.":"Hindi bababa sa isang target ang nasa labas ng saklaw sa pagitan ng dalawang pinagmumulan ng tubig.","Source A volume":"Source A volume","Source B volume":"Source B volume","Source A share":"Source A share","Predicted blend":"Hinalaang timpla","Predicted GH":"Hula na GH","Predicted KH":"Hulaang KH","Source A share required by GH":"Source A share na kailangan ng GH","Source A share required by KH":"Source A share na kailangan ni KH","Comparison tolerance":"Pagpapaubaya sa paghahambing","Unit conversion: 1 °dH = 17.848 mg/L CaCO3; 1 °fH = 10 mg/L CaCO3; 1 meq/L = 50 mg/L CaCO3.":"Conversion ng unit: 1 °dH = 17.848 mg/L CaCO3; 1 °fH = 10 mg/L CaCO3; 1 meq/L = 50 mg/L CaCO3.","All calculations run locally in this browser; no water measurements are uploaded.":"Lahat ng kalkulasyon ay lokal na tumatakbo sa browser na ito; walang mga sukat ng tubig na na-upload.","Check the values: hardness must be 0–10,000 and final volume 0–100,000 litres.":"Suriin ang mga halaga: ang tigas ay dapat na 0–10,000 at huling volume na 0–100,000 litro.","Unit conversion factors":"Mga salik ng conversion ng unit","mg/L as CaCO3":"mg/L bilang CaCO3","meq/L":"meq/L","A compatible result is an estimate within 0.05 °dH; real test kits and water chemistry have measurement variation.":"Ang isang katugmang resulta ay isang pagtatantya sa loob ng 0.05 °dH; Ang mga totoong test kit at water chemistry ay may pagkakaiba-iba sa pagsukat."},"tr":{"Aquarium Water Mixing Calculator":"Akvaryum Suyu Karışım Hesaplayıcı","Aquarium Water Mixing Calculator — Free GH & KH Planner":"Akvaryum Suyu Karışım Hesaplayıcısı — Ücretsiz GH ve KH Planlayıcı","Mix two water sources by measured GH and KH. Convert German, French, ppm and meq/L hardness units, check if both targets are compatible, and calculate litres locally.":"İki su kaynağını GH ve KH'yi ölçerek karıştırın. Almanca, Fransızca, ppm ve meq/L sertlik birimlerini dönüştürün, her iki hedefin de uyumlu olup olmadığını kontrol edin ve litreyi yerel olarak hesaplayın.","Plan an aquarium water blend from two measured sources. The calculator solves general hardness (GH) and carbonate hardness (KH) together, rather than assuming reverse-osmosis water is exactly zero.":"İki ölçülen kaynaktan bir akvaryum suyu karışımı planlayın. Hesap makinesi, ters ozmoz suyunun tam olarak sıfır olduğunu varsaymak yerine, genel sertliği (GH) ve karbonat sertliğini (KH) birlikte çözer.","Example: mix tap water at GH 10 / KH 5 with RO water at GH 0 / KH 0. A 50% blend produces about GH 5 / KH 2.5; a different pair of targets may require incompatible blend ratios.":"Örnek: GH 10 / KH 5 değerindeki musluk suyunu GH 0 / KH 0 değerindeki RO suyuyla karıştırın. %50'lik bir karışım yaklaşık GH 5 / KH 2.5 üretir; farklı bir hedef çifti uyumsuz karışım oranları gerektirebilir.","Each hardness value is converted to German degrees for calculation. GH and KH are treated as linearly mixable measured concentrations; the tool checks both independently and only gives a water recipe when the two results agree within 0.05 °dH.":"Hesaplama için her sertlik değeri Alman derecesine dönüştürülür. GH ve KH, doğrusal olarak karıştırılabilir ölçülen konsantrasyonlar olarak ele alınır; araç her ikisini de bağımsız olarak kontrol eder ve yalnızca iki sonuç 0.05 °dH dahilinde uyumlu olduğunda bir su tarifi verir.","This is a mixing estimate, not a pH or species-care recommendation. It does not model remineralization, buffers, acids, substrate effects, evaporation or measurement error. Test your water and follow reliable aquarium-care guidance.":"Bu bir karışım tahminidir, pH veya tür bakımı önerisi değildir. Remineralizasyonu, tamponları, asitleri, substrat etkilerini, buharlaşmayı veya ölçüm hatasını modellemez. Suyunuzu test edin ve güvenilir akvaryum bakımı rehberliğini takip edin.","Mixing example":"Karıştırma örneği","How GH/KH mixing works":"GH/KH karıştırma nasıl çalışır?","Aquarium water mixing questions":"Akvaryum suyu karıştırma soruları","Assumptions and limits":"Varsayımlar ve sınırlar","What do GH and KH mean?":"GH ve KH ne anlama geliyor?","GH is general hardness, mainly dissolved calcium and magnesium. KH is carbonate hardness/alkalinity as reported by your test. They are separate measurements and are not interchangeable.":"GH, esas olarak çözünmüş kalsiyum ve magnezyumdan oluşan genel sertliktir. KH, testinizde bildirildiği üzere karbonat sertliği/alkaliliğidir. Bunlar ayrı ölçümlerdir ve birbirlerinin yerine kullanılamazlar.","Does reverse-osmosis water always have zero hardness?":"Ters ozmoz suyunun sertliği her zaman sıfır mı olur?","No. Enter the GH and KH you actually measured for both sources. The calculator does not silently assume either source is pure water.":"Hayır. Her iki kaynak için de ölçtüğünüz GH ve KH değerlerini girin. Hesap makinesi, her iki kaynağın da saf su olduğunu sessizce varsaymaz.","Why can my GH and KH targets be incompatible?":"GH ve KH hedeflerim neden uyumsuz olabilir?","One blend percentage must satisfy both values. If GH requires a different source ratio from KH, two-source mixing alone cannot reach both targets; the tool reports that instead of making up a recipe.":"Bir karışım yüzdesi her iki değeri de karşılamalıdır. GH, KH'den farklı bir kaynak oranı gerektiriyorsa, iki kaynağın karıştırılması tek başına her iki hedefe de ulaşamaz; araç, bir tarif oluşturmak yerine bunu bildirir.","Which units can I convert?":"Hangi birimleri dönüştürebilirim?","German degrees (°dH), French degrees (°fH), mg/L as CaCO3 (ppm), and milliequivalents per litre (meq/L). The selected unit applies to every hardness input and result.":"Alman derecesi (°dH), Fransız derecesi (°fH), CaCO3 (ppm) olarak mg/L ve litre başına milieşdeğer (meq/L). Seçilen birim her sertlik girişi ve sonucuna uygulanır.","Is this a pH calculator or a fish-care recommendation?":"Bu bir pH hesaplayıcı mı yoksa balık bakımı önerisi mi?","No. pH does not mix linearly, and suitable aquarium water depends on species and other chemistry. This tool only estimates GH/KH blend proportions from supplied measurements.":"Hayır. pH doğrusal olarak karışmaz ve uygun akvaryum suyu türe ve diğer kimyaya bağlıdır. Bu araç yalnızca sağlanan ölçümlerden GH/KH karışım oranlarını tahmin eder.","Water source A":"Su kaynağı A","Water source B":"Su kaynağı B","Source A label":"Kaynak A etiketi","Source B label":"Kaynak B etiketi","Enter measured GH and KH for each source. For example, source A can be tap water and source B reverse-osmosis water.":"Her kaynak için ölçülen GH ve KH'yi girin. Örneğin, A kaynağı musluk suyu ve B kaynağı ters ozmoz suyu olabilir.","Hardness unit":"Sertlik birimi","German degrees (°dH)":"Alman derecesi (°dH)","French degrees (°fH)":"Fransız derecesi (°fH)","mg/L as CaCO3 (ppm)":"mg/L CaCO3 olarak (ppm)","Milliequivalents per litre (meq/L)":"Litre başına milieşdeğer (meq/L)","General hardness (GH)":"Genel sertlik (GH)","Carbonate hardness (KH)":"Karbonat sertliği (KH)","Target water":"Hedef su","Final batch volume (litres)":"Son parti hacmi (litre)","Calculate blend":"Karışımı hesapla","Clear values":"Değerleri temizle","Enter both water sources and your target GH/KH.":"Hem su kaynaklarını hem de hedef GH/KH'nizi girin.","Both target values can be reached with one blend ratio.":"Tek bir karışım oranıyla her iki hedef değere de ulaşılabilir.","GH and KH require different blend ratios; these two sources cannot reach both targets together.":"GH ve KH farklı karışım oranları gerektirir; bu iki kaynak her iki hedefe bir arada ulaşamaz.","At least one target is outside the range between the two source waters.":"En az bir hedef, iki kaynak su arasındaki aralığın dışında.","Source A volume":"Kaynak A birimi","Source B volume":"Kaynak B hacmi","Source A share":"Kaynak A","Predicted blend":"Öngörülen karışım","Predicted GH":"Tahmini GH","Predicted KH":"Tahmini KH","Source A share required by GH":"Kaynak GH'nin gerektirdiği bir pay","Source A share required by KH":"Kaynak KH'nin gerektirdiği bir pay","Comparison tolerance":"Karşılaştırma toleransı","Unit conversion: 1 °dH = 17.848 mg/L CaCO3; 1 °fH = 10 mg/L CaCO3; 1 meq/L = 50 mg/L CaCO3.":"Birim dönüştürme: 1 °dH = 17.848 mg/L CaCO3; 1 °fH = 10 mg/L CaCO3; 1 meq/L = 50 mg/L CaCO3.","All calculations run locally in this browser; no water measurements are uploaded.":"Tüm hesaplamalar yerel olarak bu tarayıcıda gerçekleştirilir; su ölçümleri yüklenmedi.","Check the values: hardness must be 0–10,000 and final volume 0–100,000 litres.":"Değerleri kontrol edin: sertlik 0–10,000 ve son hacim 0–100,000 litre olmalıdır.","Unit conversion factors":"Birim dönüştürme faktörleri","mg/L as CaCO3":"mg/L CaCO3 olarak","meq/L":"meq/L","A compatible result is an estimate within 0.05 °dH; real test kits and water chemistry have measurement variation.":"Uyumlu bir sonuç, 0.05 °dH dahilindeki bir tahmindir; gerçek test kitleri ve su kimyası ölçüm farklılıklarına sahiptir."},"uk":{"Aquarium Water Mixing Calculator":"Калькулятор змішування акваріумної води","Aquarium Water Mixing Calculator — Free GH & KH Planner":"Калькулятор змішування акваріумної води — безкоштовний планувальник GH і KH","Mix two water sources by measured GH and KH. Convert German, French, ppm and meq/L hardness units, check if both targets are compatible, and calculate litres locally.":"Змішайте два джерела води за виміряними GH і KH. Перетворюйте німецькі, французькі одиниці твердості, проміле та мекв/л, перевіряйте, чи сумісні обидві цілі, та обчислюйте літри локально.","Plan an aquarium water blend from two measured sources. The calculator solves general hardness (GH) and carbonate hardness (KH) together, rather than assuming reverse-osmosis water is exactly zero.":"Сплануйте суміш акваріумної води з двох виміряних джерел. Калькулятор розраховує загальну жорсткість (GH) і карбонатну жорсткість (KH) разом, замість того, щоб припускати, що зворотноосмотична вода рівна нулю.","Example: mix tap water at GH 10 / KH 5 with RO water at GH 0 / KH 0. A 50% blend produces about GH 5 / KH 2.5; a different pair of targets may require incompatible blend ratios.":"Приклад: змішайте водопровідну воду при GH 10 / KH 5 з RO водою при GH 0 / KH 0. Суміш 50% дає приблизно GH 5 / KH 2.5; інша пара мішеней може потребувати несумісних пропорцій суміші.","Each hardness value is converted to German degrees for calculation. GH and KH are treated as linearly mixable measured concentrations; the tool checks both independently and only gives a water recipe when the two results agree within 0.05 °dH.":"Кожне значення твердості конвертується в німецькі градуси для розрахунку. GH і KH розглядаються як лінійно змішувані виміряні концентрації; інструмент перевіряє обидва незалежно та дає рецепт води лише тоді, коли два результати збігаються в межах 0.05 °dH.","This is a mixing estimate, not a pH or species-care recommendation. It does not model remineralization, buffers, acids, substrate effects, evaporation or measurement error. Test your water and follow reliable aquarium-care guidance.":"Це оцінка змішування, а не рН чи рекомендація щодо догляду за видами. Він не моделює ремінералізацію, буфери, кислоти, вплив субстрату, випаровування або помилку вимірювання. Перевірте свою воду та дотримуйтесь надійних вказівок щодо догляду за акваріумом.","Mixing example":"Приклад змішування","How GH/KH mixing works":"Як працює змішування GH/KH","Aquarium water mixing questions":"Питання про змішування акваріумної води","Assumptions and limits":"Припущення та обмеження","What do GH and KH mean?":"Що означають GH і KH?","GH is general hardness, mainly dissolved calcium and magnesium. KH is carbonate hardness/alkalinity as reported by your test. They are separate measurements and are not interchangeable.":"GH — загальна твердість, головним чином розчинений кальцій і магній. KH – це карбонатна жорсткість/лужність, як повідомляє ваш тест. Це окремі вимірювання, які не є взаємозамінними.","Does reverse-osmosis water always have zero hardness?":"Чи завжди вода зі зворотним осмосом має нульову жорсткість?","No. Enter the GH and KH you actually measured for both sources. The calculator does not silently assume either source is pure water.":"№ Введіть GH і KH, які ви фактично виміряли для обох джерел. Калькулятор мовчки не припускає, що джерело є чистою водою.","Why can my GH and KH targets be incompatible?":"Чому мої цілі GH і KH можуть бути несумісними?","One blend percentage must satisfy both values. If GH requires a different source ratio from KH, two-source mixing alone cannot reach both targets; the tool reports that instead of making up a recipe.":"Один відсоток суміші має задовольняти обидва значення. Якщо для GH потрібне інше співвідношення джерел, ніж KH, змішування з двох джерел не може досягти обох цілей; інструмент повідомляє, що замість того, щоб скласти рецепт.","Which units can I convert?":"Які одиниці я можу конвертувати?","German degrees (°dH), French degrees (°fH), mg/L as CaCO3 (ppm), and milliequivalents per litre (meq/L). The selected unit applies to every hardness input and result.":"Німецькі градуси (°dH), французькі градуси (°fH), мг/л як CaCO3 (ppm) і міліеквіваленти на літр (мекв/л). Вибрані одиниці вимірювання застосовуються до кожного вхідного значення твердості та результату.","Is this a pH calculator or a fish-care recommendation?":"Це калькулятор pH чи рекомендація щодо догляду за рибками?","No. pH does not mix linearly, and suitable aquarium water depends on species and other chemistry. This tool only estimates GH/KH blend proportions from supplied measurements.":"№ РН не змішується лінійно, і відповідна акваріумна вода залежить від виду та інших хімічних складів. Цей інструмент оцінює лише пропорції суміші GH/KH за наданими вимірюваннями.","Water source A":"Джерело води А","Water source B":"Джерело води B","Source A label":"Мітка джерела A","Source B label":"Етикетка джерела B","Enter measured GH and KH for each source. For example, source A can be tap water and source B reverse-osmosis water.":"Введіть виміряні GH і KH для кожного джерела. Наприклад, джерелом А може бути водопровідна вода, а джерелом В — вода зворотного осмосу.","Hardness unit":"Одиниця твердості","German degrees (°dH)":"Німецькі градуси (°dH)","French degrees (°fH)":"Французькі градуси (°fH)","mg/L as CaCO3 (ppm)":"мг/л як CaCO3 (ppm)","Milliequivalents per litre (meq/L)":"Міліеквіваленти на літр (мекв/л)","General hardness (GH)":"Загальна твердість (GH)","Carbonate hardness (KH)":"Карбонатна твердість (KH)","Target water":"Цільова вода","Final batch volume (litres)":"Кінцевий об'єм партії (літри)","Calculate blend":"Обчислити суміш","Clear values":"Очистити значення","Enter both water sources and your target GH/KH.":"Введіть джерела води та ваш цільовий GH/KH.","Both target values can be reached with one blend ratio.":"Обидва цільових значення можна досягти за допомогою одного співвідношення суміші.","GH and KH require different blend ratios; these two sources cannot reach both targets together.":"GH і KH потребують різних пропорцій суміші; ці два джерела не можуть досягти обох цілей разом.","At least one target is outside the range between the two source waters.":"Принаймні одна ціль знаходиться за межами діапазону між двома водами джерела.","Source A volume":"Джерело А том","Source B volume":"Том джерела B","Source A share":"Акція джерела A","Predicted blend":"Прогнозована суміш","Predicted GH":"Прогнозований GH","Predicted KH":"Прогнозований КХ","Source A share required by GH":"Джерело Частка, яку вимагає GH","Source A share required by KH":"Джерело Частка, яку вимагає KH","Comparison tolerance":"Допуск до порівняння","Unit conversion: 1 °dH = 17.848 mg/L CaCO3; 1 °fH = 10 mg/L CaCO3; 1 meq/L = 50 mg/L CaCO3.":"Перетворення одиниць: 1 °dH = 17.848 мг/л CaCO3; 1 °fH = 10 мг/л CaCO3; 1 мекв/л = 50 мг/л CaCO3.","All calculations run locally in this browser; no water measurements are uploaded.":"Усі обчислення виконуються локально в цьому браузері; вимірювання води не завантажуються.","Check the values: hardness must be 0–10,000 and final volume 0–100,000 litres.":"Перевірте значення: жорсткість має бути 0–10,000, а кінцевий об’єм 0–100,000 літрів.","Unit conversion factors":"Коефіцієнти перетворення одиниць","mg/L as CaCO3":"мг/л як CaCO3","meq/L":"мекв/л","A compatible result is an estimate within 0.05 °dH; real test kits and water chemistry have measurement variation.":"Сумісним результатом є оцінка в межах 0.05 °dH; реальні тестові набори та хімічний аналіз води мають варіації вимірювань."},"ur":{"Aquarium Water Mixing Calculator":"ایکویریم واٹر مکسنگ کیلکولیٹر","Aquarium Water Mixing Calculator — Free GH & KH Planner":"ایکویریم واٹر مکسنگ کیلکولیٹر - مفت GH & KH منصوبہ ساز","Mix two water sources by measured GH and KH. Convert German, French, ppm and meq/L hardness units, check if both targets are compatible, and calculate litres locally.":"پانی کے دو ذرائع کو GH اور KH کے حساب سے مکس کریں۔ جرمن، فرانسیسی، ppm اور meq/L سختی یونٹس میں تبدیل کریں، چیک کریں کہ آیا دونوں اہداف مطابقت رکھتے ہیں، اور مقامی طور پر لیٹر کا حساب لگائیں۔","Plan an aquarium water blend from two measured sources. The calculator solves general hardness (GH) and carbonate hardness (KH) together, rather than assuming reverse-osmosis water is exactly zero.":"کیلکولیٹر عام سختی (GH) اور کاربونیٹ سختی (KH) کو ایک ساتھ حل کرتا ہے، بجائے اس کے کہ یہ فرض کر لیں کہ ریورس-آسموس پانی بالکل صفر ہے۔","Example: mix tap water at GH 10 / KH 5 with RO water at GH 0 / KH 0. A 50% blend produces about GH 5 / KH 2.5; a different pair of targets may require incompatible blend ratios.":"مثال: GH 10 / KH 5 پر نل کے پانی کو GH 0 / KH 0 پر RO پانی کے ساتھ ملائیں۔ ایک 50% مرکب تقریبا GH 5 / KH 2.5 پیدا کرتا ہے؛ اہداف کی ایک مختلف جوڑی کو غیر مطابقت پذیر مرکب تناسب کی ضرورت ہو سکتی ہے۔","Each hardness value is converted to German degrees for calculation. GH and KH are treated as linearly mixable measured concentrations; the tool checks both independently and only gives a water recipe when the two results agree within 0.05 °dH.":"ہر سختی کی قدر کو حساب کے لیے جرمن ڈگریوں میں تبدیل کیا جاتا ہے۔ GH اور KH کو لکیری طور پر مکس ایبل پیمائش شدہ ارتکاز سمجھا جاتا ہے۔ ٹول آزادانہ طور پر دونوں کو چیک کرتا ہے اور صرف پانی کی ترکیب دیتا ہے جب دونوں نتائج 0.05 °dH کے اندر متفق ہوں۔","This is a mixing estimate, not a pH or species-care recommendation. It does not model remineralization, buffers, acids, substrate effects, evaporation or measurement error. Test your water and follow reliable aquarium-care guidance.":"یہ اختلاط کا تخمینہ ہے، pH یا پرجاتیوں کی دیکھ بھال کی سفارش نہیں۔ یہ دوبارہ معدنیات، بفر، تیزاب، سبسٹریٹ اثرات، بخارات یا پیمائش کی غلطی کا ماڈل نہیں بناتا ہے۔ اپنے پانی کی جانچ کریں اور ایکویریم کی دیکھ بھال کی قابل اعتماد رہنمائی پر عمل کریں۔","Mixing example":"مکسنگ کی مثال","How GH/KH mixing works":"GH/KH مکسنگ کیسے کام کرتی ہے۔","Aquarium water mixing questions":"ایکویریم کے پانی میں ملاوٹ کے سوالات","Assumptions and limits":"مفروضات اور حدود","What do GH and KH mean?":"GH اور KH کا کیا مطلب ہے؟","GH is general hardness, mainly dissolved calcium and magnesium. KH is carbonate hardness/alkalinity as reported by your test. They are separate measurements and are not interchangeable.":"GH عمومی سختی ہے، بنیادی طور پر تحلیل شدہ کیلشیم اور میگنیشیم۔ KH کاربونیٹ کی سختی/الکلینیٹی ہے جیسا کہ آپ کے ٹیسٹ سے رپورٹ کیا گیا ہے۔ وہ الگ الگ پیمائش ہیں اور قابل تبادلہ نہیں ہیں۔","Does reverse-osmosis water always have zero hardness?":"کیا ریورس اوسموسس پانی میں ہمیشہ صفر سختی ہوتی ہے؟","No. Enter the GH and KH you actually measured for both sources. The calculator does not silently assume either source is pure water.":"No GH اور KH درج کریں جو آپ نے اصل میں دونوں ذرائع کے لیے ماپا ہے۔ کیلکولیٹر خاموشی سے یہ نہیں مانتا کہ کوئی بھی ذریعہ خالص پانی ہے۔","Why can my GH and KH targets be incompatible?":"میرے GH اور KH اہداف غیر موافق کیوں ہو سکتے ہیں؟","One blend percentage must satisfy both values. If GH requires a different source ratio from KH, two-source mixing alone cannot reach both targets; the tool reports that instead of making up a recipe.":"ایک مرکب فیصد دونوں قدروں کو پورا کرتا ہے۔ اگر GH کو KH سے مختلف ماخذ کا تناسب درکار ہے، تو اکیلے دو ذرائع کا اختلاط دونوں اہداف تک نہیں پہنچ سکتا۔ ٹول رپورٹ کرتا ہے کہ نسخہ بنانے کے بجائے۔","Which units can I convert?":"میں کن یونٹوں کو تبدیل کر سکتا ہوں؟","German degrees (°dH), French degrees (°fH), mg/L as CaCO3 (ppm), and milliequivalents per litre (meq/L). The selected unit applies to every hardness input and result.":"جرمن ڈگری (°dH)، فرانسیسی ڈگری (°fH)، mg/L بطور CaCO3 (ppm)، اور ملی مساوی فی لیٹر (meq/L)۔ منتخب کردہ یونٹ ہر سختی کے ان پٹ اور نتیجہ پر لاگو ہوتا ہے۔","Is this a pH calculator or a fish-care recommendation?":"کیا یہ پی ایچ کیلکولیٹر ہے یا مچھلی کی دیکھ بھال کی سفارش؟","No. pH does not mix linearly, and suitable aquarium water depends on species and other chemistry. This tool only estimates GH/KH blend proportions from supplied measurements.":"No pH لکیری طور پر مکس نہیں ہوتا ہے، اور مناسب ایکویریم پانی پرجاتیوں اور دیگر کیمسٹری پر منحصر ہے۔ یہ ٹول فراہم کردہ پیمائش سے صرف GH/KH مرکب تناسب کا تخمینہ لگاتا ہے۔","Water source A":"پانی کا ذریعہ A","Water source B":"پانی کا ذریعہ B","Source A label":"ماخذ A لیبل","Source B label":"ماخذ B لیبل","Enter measured GH and KH for each source. For example, source A can be tap water and source B reverse-osmosis water.":"ہر ماخذ کے لیے ماپا GH اور KH درج کریں۔ مثال کے طور پر، منبع A نل کا پانی اور منبع B ریورس-اسموسس پانی ہو سکتا ہے۔","Hardness unit":"سختی یونٹ","German degrees (°dH)":"جرمن ڈگری (°dH)","French degrees (°fH)":"فرانسیسی ڈگری (°fH)","mg/L as CaCO3 (ppm)":"mg/L بطور CaCO3 (ppm)","Milliequivalents per litre (meq/L)":"ملی مساوی فی لیٹر (meq/L)","General hardness (GH)":"عمومی سختی (GH)","Carbonate hardness (KH)":"کاربونیٹ سختی (KH)","Target water":"ٹارگٹ واٹر","Final batch volume (litres)":"فائنل بیچ والیوم (لیٹر)","Calculate blend":"ملاوٹ کا حساب لگائیں۔","Clear values":"واضح اقدار","Enter both water sources and your target GH/KH.":"پانی کے ذرائع اور اپنا ہدف GH/KH دونوں درج کریں۔","Both target values can be reached with one blend ratio.":"دونوں ہدف کی قدروں کو ایک مرکب تناسب کے ساتھ حاصل کیا جا سکتا ہے۔","GH and KH require different blend ratios; these two sources cannot reach both targets together.":"GH اور KH کو مختلف مرکب تناسب کی ضرورت ہوتی ہے۔ یہ دونوں ذرائع ایک ساتھ دونوں اہداف تک نہیں پہنچ سکتے۔","At least one target is outside the range between the two source waters.":"کم از کم ایک ہدف دو ماخذ پانیوں کے درمیان کی حد سے باہر ہے۔","Source A volume":"ماخذ A والیوم","Source B volume":"ماخذ B والیوم","Source A share":"ماخذ ایک حصہ","Predicted blend":"پیش گوئی شدہ مرکب","Predicted GH":"پیش گوئی شدہ GH","Predicted KH":"پیش گوئی KH","Source A share required by GH":"ذریعہ GH کو مطلوبہ حصہ","Source A share required by KH":"ماخذ ایک حصہ KH کے لیے درکار ہے۔","Comparison tolerance":"موازنہ رواداری","Unit conversion: 1 °dH = 17.848 mg/L CaCO3; 1 °fH = 10 mg/L CaCO3; 1 meq/L = 50 mg/L CaCO3.":"یونٹ کی تبدیلی: 1 °dH = 17.848 mg/L CaCO3؛ 1 °fH = 10 mg/L CaCO3؛ 1 meq/L = 50 mg/L CaCO3۔","All calculations run locally in this browser; no water measurements are uploaded.":"تمام حسابات اس براؤزر میں مقامی طور پر چلتے ہیں۔ کوئی پانی کی پیمائش اپ لوڈ نہیں کر رہے ہیں.","Check the values: hardness must be 0–10,000 and final volume 0–100,000 litres.":"قدریں چیک کریں: سختی 0–10,000 اور آخری والیوم 0–100,000 لیٹر ہونی چاہیے۔","Unit conversion factors":"یونٹ کی تبدیلی کے عوامل","mg/L as CaCO3":"mg/L بطور CaCO3","meq/L":"meq/L","A compatible result is an estimate within 0.05 °dH; real test kits and water chemistry have measurement variation.":"ایک مطابقت پذیر نتیجہ 0.05 °dH کے اندر ایک تخمینہ ہے۔ اصلی ٹیسٹ کٹس اور پانی کی کیمسٹری میں پیمائش کی تبدیلی ہوتی ہے۔"},"vi":{"Aquarium Water Mixing Calculator":"Máy tính trộn nước bể cá","Aquarium Water Mixing Calculator — Free GH & KH Planner":"Máy tính trộn nước bể cá — Công cụ lập kế hoạch GH & KH miễn phí","Mix two water sources by measured GH and KH. Convert German, French, ppm and meq/L hardness units, check if both targets are compatible, and calculate litres locally.":"Trộn hai nguồn nước bằng GH và KH đo được. Chuyển đổi các đơn vị độ cứng của Đức, Pháp, ppm và meq/L, kiểm tra xem cả hai mục tiêu có tương thích hay không và tính toán lít cục bộ.","Plan an aquarium water blend from two measured sources. The calculator solves general hardness (GH) and carbonate hardness (KH) together, rather than assuming reverse-osmosis water is exactly zero.":"Lên kế hoạch pha trộn nước hồ cá từ hai nguồn đo được. Máy tính giải quyết độ cứng chung (GH) và độ cứng cacbonat (KH), thay vì giả sử nước thẩm thấu ngược chính xác bằng 0.","Example: mix tap water at GH 10 / KH 5 with RO water at GH 0 / KH 0. A 50% blend produces about GH 5 / KH 2.5; a different pair of targets may require incompatible blend ratios.":"Ví dụ: trộn nước máy tại GH 10 / KH 5 với nước RO tại GH 0 / KH 0. Hỗn hợp 50% tạo ra khoảng GH 5 / KH 2.5; một cặp mục tiêu khác có thể yêu cầu tỷ lệ pha trộn không tương thích.","Each hardness value is converted to German degrees for calculation. GH and KH are treated as linearly mixable measured concentrations; the tool checks both independently and only gives a water recipe when the two results agree within 0.05 °dH.":"Mỗi giá trị độ cứng được chuyển đổi sang độ Đức để tính toán. GH và KH được coi là nồng độ đo được có thể trộn tuyến tính; công cụ này kiểm tra cả hai cách độc lập và chỉ đưa ra công thức nước khi hai kết quả khớp nhau trong phạm vi 0.05 °dH.","This is a mixing estimate, not a pH or species-care recommendation. It does not model remineralization, buffers, acids, substrate effects, evaporation or measurement error. Test your water and follow reliable aquarium-care guidance.":"Đây là ước tính pha trộn, không phải khuyến nghị về độ pH hoặc cách chăm sóc loài. Nó không mô hình hóa quá trình tái khoáng, chất đệm, axit, hiệu ứng cơ chất, sự bay hơi hoặc lỗi đo lường. Kiểm tra nước của bạn và làm theo hướng dẫn chăm sóc bể cá đáng tin cậy.","Mixing example":"Ví dụ về trộn","How GH/KH mixing works":"Cách hoạt động của quá trình trộn GH/KH","Aquarium water mixing questions":"Câu hỏi pha nước bể cá","Assumptions and limits":"Giả định và giới hạn","What do GH and KH mean?":"GH và KH có nghĩa là gì?","GH is general hardness, mainly dissolved calcium and magnesium. KH is carbonate hardness/alkalinity as reported by your test. They are separate measurements and are not interchangeable.":"GH là độ cứng chung, chủ yếu là canxi và magie hòa tan. KH là độ cứng/kiềm cacbonat theo kết quả thử nghiệm của bạn. Chúng là các phép đo riêng biệt và không thể thay thế cho nhau.","Does reverse-osmosis water always have zero hardness?":"Nước thẩm thấu ngược luôn có độ cứng bằng 0?","No. Enter the GH and KH you actually measured for both sources. The calculator does not silently assume either source is pure water.":"Không. Nhập GH và KH bạn thực sự đo được cho cả hai nguồn. Máy tính không âm thầm cho rằng nguồn nào cũng là nước tinh khiết.","Why can my GH and KH targets be incompatible?":"Tại sao mục tiêu GH và KH của tôi có thể không tương thích?","One blend percentage must satisfy both values. If GH requires a different source ratio from KH, two-source mixing alone cannot reach both targets; the tool reports that instead of making up a recipe.":"Một tỷ lệ phần trăm pha trộn phải đáp ứng cả hai giá trị. Nếu GH yêu cầu tỷ lệ nguồn khác với KH thì việc trộn hai nguồn riêng lẻ không thể đạt được cả hai mục tiêu; công cụ báo cáo rằng thay vì tạo ra một công thức.","Which units can I convert?":"Tôi có thể chuyển đổi những đơn vị nào?","German degrees (°dH), French degrees (°fH), mg/L as CaCO3 (ppm), and milliequivalents per litre (meq/L). The selected unit applies to every hardness input and result.":"Độ Đức (°dH), độ Pháp (°fH), mg/L tính theo CaCO3 (ppm) và mili đương lượng trên lít (meq/L). Đơn vị được chọn áp dụng cho mọi đầu vào và kết quả độ cứng.","Is this a pH calculator or a fish-care recommendation?":"Đây là máy tính pH hay khuyến nghị chăm sóc cá?","No. pH does not mix linearly, and suitable aquarium water depends on species and other chemistry. This tool only estimates GH/KH blend proportions from supplied measurements.":"Không. Độ pH không pha trộn tuyến tính và nước hồ cá phù hợp phụ thuộc vào loài và thành phần hóa học khác. Công cụ này chỉ ước tính tỷ lệ pha trộn GH/KH từ các phép đo được cung cấp.","Water source A":"Nguồn nước A","Water source B":"Nguồn nước B","Source A label":"Nguồn A nhãn","Source B label":"Nhãn nguồn B","Enter measured GH and KH for each source. For example, source A can be tap water and source B reverse-osmosis water.":"Nhập GH và KH đo được cho từng nguồn. Ví dụ, nguồn A có thể là nước máy và nguồn B là nước thẩm thấu ngược.","Hardness unit":"Đơn vị đo độ cứng","German degrees (°dH)":"Độ Đức (° dH)","French degrees (°fH)":"độ Pháp (°fH)","mg/L as CaCO3 (ppm)":"mg/L tính theo CaCO3 (ppm)","Milliequivalents per litre (meq/L)":"Milli đương lượng trên lít (meq/L)","General hardness (GH)":"Độ cứng chung (GH)","Carbonate hardness (KH)":"Độ cứng cacbonat (KH)","Target water":"Nước mục tiêu","Final batch volume (litres)":"Thể tích mẻ cuối cùng (lít)","Calculate blend":"Tính toán pha trộn","Clear values":"Xóa giá trị","Enter both water sources and your target GH/KH.":"Nhập cả nguồn nước và GH/KH mục tiêu của bạn.","Both target values can be reached with one blend ratio.":"Có thể đạt được cả hai giá trị mục tiêu với một tỷ lệ pha trộn.","GH and KH require different blend ratios; these two sources cannot reach both targets together.":"GH và KH yêu cầu tỷ lệ pha trộn khác nhau; hai nguồn này không thể đạt được cả hai mục tiêu cùng nhau.","At least one target is outside the range between the two source waters.":"Ít nhất một mục tiêu nằm ngoài phạm vi giữa hai nguồn nước.","Source A volume":"Nguồn A tập","Source B volume":"Khối lượng nguồn B","Source A share":"Nguồn A chia sẻ","Predicted blend":"Hỗn hợp dự đoán","Predicted GH":"GH dự đoán","Predicted KH":"Dự đoán KH","Source A share required by GH":"Nguồn Chia sẻ theo yêu cầu của GH","Source A share required by KH":"Nguồn Chia sẻ theo yêu cầu của KH","Comparison tolerance":"Dung sai so sánh","Unit conversion: 1 °dH = 17.848 mg/L CaCO3; 1 °fH = 10 mg/L CaCO3; 1 meq/L = 50 mg/L CaCO3.":"Đơn vị chuyển đổi: 1 °dH = 17.848 mg/L CaCO3; 1 °fH = 10 mg/L CaCO3; 1 meq/L = 50 mg/L CaCO3.","All calculations run locally in this browser; no water measurements are uploaded.":"Tất cả các phép tính chạy cục bộ trong trình duyệt này; không có phép đo nước nào được tải lên.","Check the values: hardness must be 0–10,000 and final volume 0–100,000 litres.":"Kiểm tra các giá trị: độ cứng phải là 0–10,000 và thể tích cuối cùng là 0–100,000 lít.","Unit conversion factors":"Hệ số chuyển đổi đơn vị","mg/L as CaCO3":"mg/L tính theo CaCO3","meq/L":"meq/L","A compatible result is an estimate within 0.05 °dH; real test kits and water chemistry have measurement variation.":"Kết quả tương thích là ước tính trong phạm vi 0.05 °dH; bộ dụng cụ thử nghiệm thực tế và thành phần hóa học của nước có sự khác nhau về số đo."},"zh":{"Aquarium Water Mixing Calculator":"水族箱混水计算器","Aquarium Water Mixing Calculator — Free GH & KH Planner":"水族箱水混合计算器 — 免费 GH 和 KH 规划师","Mix two water sources by measured GH and KH. Convert German, French, ppm and meq/L hardness units, check if both targets are compatible, and calculate litres locally.":"通过测量的 GH 和 KH 混合两种水源。转换德语、法语、ppm 和 meq/L 硬度单位，检查两个目标是否兼容，并在本地计算升。","Plan an aquarium water blend from two measured sources. The calculator solves general hardness (GH) and carbonate hardness (KH) together, rather than assuming reverse-osmosis water is exactly zero.":"规划来自两个测量来源的水族箱水混合。该计算器同时求解一般硬度 (GH) 和碳酸盐硬度 (KH)，而不是假设反渗透水恰好为零。","Example: mix tap water at GH 10 / KH 5 with RO water at GH 0 / KH 0. A 50% blend produces about GH 5 / KH 2.5; a different pair of targets may require incompatible blend ratios.":"示例：将 GH 10 / KH 5 的自来水与 GH 0 / KH 0 的 RO 水混合。 50% 的混合物产生约 GH 5 / KH 2.5；不同的目标对可能需要不兼容的混合比例。","Each hardness value is converted to German degrees for calculation. GH and KH are treated as linearly mixable measured concentrations; the tool checks both independently and only gives a water recipe when the two results agree within 0.05 °dH.":"每个硬度值均转换为德度进行计算。 GH和KH被视为线性可混合的测量浓度；该工具独立检查两者，并且仅当两个结果在 0.05 °dH 范围内一致时才给出水配方。","This is a mixing estimate, not a pH or species-care recommendation. It does not model remineralization, buffers, acids, substrate effects, evaporation or measurement error. Test your water and follow reliable aquarium-care guidance.":"这是混合估计，而不是 pH 值或物种护理建议。它不模拟再矿化、缓冲液、酸、底物效应、蒸发或测量误差。测试您的水质并遵循可靠的水族箱护理指南。","Mixing example":"混合示例","How GH/KH mixing works":"GH/KH 混合的工作原理","Aquarium water mixing questions":"水族箱混水问题","Assumptions and limits":"假设和限制","What do GH and KH mean?":"GH和KH是什么意思？","GH is general hardness, mainly dissolved calcium and magnesium. KH is carbonate hardness/alkalinity as reported by your test. They are separate measurements and are not interchangeable.":"GH是一般硬度，主要是溶解的钙和镁。 KH 是测试报告的碳酸盐硬度/碱度。它们是单独的测量结果并且不可互换。","Does reverse-osmosis water always have zero hardness?":"反渗透水的硬度总是为零吗？","No. Enter the GH and KH you actually measured for both sources. The calculator does not silently assume either source is pure water.":"编号输入您实际测量的两个源的 GH 和 KH。计算器不会默默地假设任一来源都是纯净水。","Why can my GH and KH targets be incompatible?":"为什么我的 GH 和 KH 目标不兼容？","One blend percentage must satisfy both values. If GH requires a different source ratio from KH, two-source mixing alone cannot reach both targets; the tool reports that instead of making up a recipe.":"一种混合百分比必须满足这两个值。如果 GH 需要与 KH 不同的源比例，则仅使用双源混合无法达到两个目标；该工具会报告这一点，而不是制作一个食谱。","Which units can I convert?":"我可以转换哪些单位？","German degrees (°dH), French degrees (°fH), mg/L as CaCO3 (ppm), and milliequivalents per litre (meq/L). The selected unit applies to every hardness input and result.":"德国度 (°dH)、法国度 (°fH)、CaCO3 毫克/升 (ppm) 和每升毫当量 (meq/L)。所选单位适用于每个硬度输入和结果。","Is this a pH calculator or a fish-care recommendation?":"这是 pH 计算器还是鱼类护理建议？","No. pH does not mix linearly, and suitable aquarium water depends on species and other chemistry. This tool only estimates GH/KH blend proportions from supplied measurements.":"编号pH 值不是线性混合的，合适的水族箱水取决于物种和其他化学成分。该工具仅根据提供的测量值估计 GH/KH 混合比例。","Water source A":"水源A","Water source B":"水源B","Source A label":"来源A标签","Source B label":"B源标签","Enter measured GH and KH for each source. For example, source A can be tap water and source B reverse-osmosis water.":"输入每个光源测量的 GH 和 KH。例如，水源A可以是自来水，水源B可以是反渗透水。","Hardness unit":"硬度单位","German degrees (°dH)":"德国度 (°dH)","French degrees (°fH)":"法国度 (°fH)","mg/L as CaCO3 (ppm)":"mg/L，以 CaCO3 计 (ppm)","Milliequivalents per litre (meq/L)":"毫当量每升 (meq/L)","General hardness (GH)":"一般硬度(GH)","Carbonate hardness (KH)":"碳酸盐硬度(KH)","Target water":"目标水","Final batch volume (litres)":"最终批次体积（升）","Calculate blend":"计算混合","Clear values":"清除值","Enter both water sources and your target GH/KH.":"输入水源和您的目标 GH/KH。","Both target values can be reached with one blend ratio.":"使用一种混合比例即可达到两个目标值。","GH and KH require different blend ratios; these two sources cannot reach both targets together.":"GH和KH需要不同的混合比例；这两个来源无法同时达到两个目标。","At least one target is outside the range between the two source waters.":"至少有一个目标位于两个源水之间的范围之外。","Source A volume":"源A卷","Source B volume":"源B卷","Source A share":"来源A股","Predicted blend":"预测混合","Predicted GH":"预测 GH","Predicted KH":"预测 KH","Source A share required by GH":"GH要求的来源A股","Source A share required by KH":"KH要求的来源A股","Comparison tolerance":"比较公差","Unit conversion: 1 °dH = 17.848 mg/L CaCO3; 1 °fH = 10 mg/L CaCO3; 1 meq/L = 50 mg/L CaCO3.":"单位换算：1 °dH = 17.848 mg/L CaCO3； 1 °fH = 10 mg/L CaCO3； 1 meq/L = 50 mg/L CaCO3。","All calculations run locally in this browser; no water measurements are uploaded.":"所有计算都在此浏览器中本地运行；没有上传水测量数据。","Check the values: hardness must be 0–10,000 and final volume 0–100,000 litres.":"检查值：硬度必须为 0–10,000，最终体积必须为 0–100,000 升。","Unit conversion factors":"单位换算系数","mg/L as CaCO3":"mg/L（以 CaCO3 计）","meq/L":"meq/L","A compatible result is an estimate within 0.05 °dH; real test kits and water chemistry have measurement variation.":"兼容的结果是 0.05 °dH 内的估计值；真实的测试套件和水化学具有测量差异。"},"zh_tw":{"Aquarium Water Mixing Calculator":"水族箱混水計算器","Aquarium Water Mixing Calculator — Free GH & KH Planner":"水族箱水混合計算器 — 免費 GH 和 KH 規劃師","Mix two water sources by measured GH and KH. Convert German, French, ppm and meq/L hardness units, check if both targets are compatible, and calculate litres locally.":"透過測量的 GH 和 KH 混合兩種水源。轉換德語、法語、ppm 和 meq/L 硬度單位，檢查兩個目標是否相容，並在本地計算升。","Plan an aquarium water blend from two measured sources. The calculator solves general hardness (GH) and carbonate hardness (KH) together, rather than assuming reverse-osmosis water is exactly zero.":"規劃來自兩個測量來源的水族箱水混合。此計算器同時求解一般硬度 (GH) 和碳酸鹽硬度 (KH)，而不是假設逆滲透水恰好為零。","Example: mix tap water at GH 10 / KH 5 with RO water at GH 0 / KH 0. A 50% blend produces about GH 5 / KH 2.5; a different pair of targets may require incompatible blend ratios.":"範例：將 GH 10 / KH 5 的自來水與 GH 0 / KH 0 的 RO 水混合。 50% 的混合物產生約 GH 5 / KH 2.5；不同的目標對可能需要不相容的混合比例。","Each hardness value is converted to German degrees for calculation. GH and KH are treated as linearly mixable measured concentrations; the tool checks both independently and only gives a water recipe when the two results agree within 0.05 °dH.":"每個硬度值轉換為德度進行計算。 GH和KH被視為線性可混合的測量濃度；該工具獨立檢查兩者，並且僅當兩個結果在 0.05 °dH 範圍內一致時才給出水配方。","This is a mixing estimate, not a pH or species-care recommendation. It does not model remineralization, buffers, acids, substrate effects, evaporation or measurement error. Test your water and follow reliable aquarium-care guidance.":"這是混合估計，而不是 pH 值或物種護理建議。它不模擬再礦化、緩衝液、酸、底物效應、蒸發或測量誤差。測試您的水質並遵循可靠的水族箱護理指南。","Mixing example":"混合範例","How GH/KH mixing works":"GH/KH 混合的工作原理","Aquarium water mixing questions":"水族箱混水問題","Assumptions and limits":"假設與限制","What do GH and KH mean?":"GH和KH是什麼意思？","GH is general hardness, mainly dissolved calcium and magnesium. KH is carbonate hardness/alkalinity as reported by your test. They are separate measurements and are not interchangeable.":"GH是一般硬度，主要是溶解的鈣和鎂。 KH 是測試報告的碳酸鹽硬度/鹼度。它們是單獨的測量結果且不可互換。","Does reverse-osmosis water always have zero hardness?":"逆滲透水的硬度總是為零嗎？","No. Enter the GH and KH you actually measured for both sources. The calculator does not silently assume either source is pure water.":"編號輸入您實際測量的兩個來源的 GH 和 KH。計算器不會默默地假設任一來源都是純淨水。","Why can my GH and KH targets be incompatible?":"為什麼我的 GH 和 KH 目標不相容？","One blend percentage must satisfy both values. If GH requires a different source ratio from KH, two-source mixing alone cannot reach both targets; the tool reports that instead of making up a recipe.":"一種混合百分比必須滿足這兩個值。如果 GH 需要與 KH 不同的來源比例，則僅使用雙源混合無法達到兩個目標；該工具會報告這一點，而不是製作一個食譜。","Which units can I convert?":"我可以轉換哪些單位？","German degrees (°dH), French degrees (°fH), mg/L as CaCO3 (ppm), and milliequivalents per litre (meq/L). The selected unit applies to every hardness input and result.":"德國度 (°dH)、法國度 (°fH)、CaCO3 毫克/公升 (ppm) 和每公升毫當量 (meq/L)。所選單位適用於每個硬度輸入和結果。","Is this a pH calculator or a fish-care recommendation?":"這是 pH 計算器還是魚類護理建議？","No. pH does not mix linearly, and suitable aquarium water depends on species and other chemistry. This tool only estimates GH/KH blend proportions from supplied measurements.":"編號pH 值不是線性混合的，合適的水族箱水取決於物種和其他化學成分。該工具僅根據提供的測量值估計 GH/KH 混合比例。","Water source A":"水源A","Water source B":"水源B","Source A label":"來源A標籤","Source B label":"B來源標籤","Enter measured GH and KH for each source. For example, source A can be tap water and source B reverse-osmosis water.":"輸入每個光源測量的 GH 和 KH。例如，水源A可以是自來水，水源B可以是逆滲透水。","Hardness unit":"硬度單位","German degrees (°dH)":"德國度 (°dH)","French degrees (°fH)":"法國度 (°fH)","mg/L as CaCO3 (ppm)":"mg/L，以 CaCO3 計 (ppm)","Milliequivalents per litre (meq/L)":"毫當量每公升 (meq/L)","General hardness (GH)":"一般硬度(GH)","Carbonate hardness (KH)":"碳酸鹽硬度(KH)","Target water":"目標水","Final batch volume (litres)":"最終批次體積（公升）","Calculate blend":"計算混合","Clear values":"清除值","Enter both water sources and your target GH/KH.":"輸入水源和您的目標 GH/KH。","Both target values can be reached with one blend ratio.":"使用一種混合比例即可達到兩個目標值。","GH and KH require different blend ratios; these two sources cannot reach both targets together.":"GH和KH需要不同的混合比例；這兩個來源無法同時達到兩個目標。","At least one target is outside the range between the two source waters.":"至少有一個目標位於兩個源水之間的範圍之外。","Source A volume":"源A卷","Source B volume":"源B卷","Source A share":"來源A股","Predicted blend":"預測混合","Predicted GH":"預測 GH","Predicted KH":"預測 KH","Source A share required by GH":"GH要求的來源A股","Source A share required by KH":"KH所需來源A股","Comparison tolerance":"比較公差","Unit conversion: 1 °dH = 17.848 mg/L CaCO3; 1 °fH = 10 mg/L CaCO3; 1 meq/L = 50 mg/L CaCO3.":"單位換算：1°dH =17.848毫克/公升碳酸鈣3;1°fH =10毫克/公升碳酸鈣3;1毫克當量/L =50毫克/公升碳酸鈣3。","All calculations run locally in this browser; no water measurements are uploaded.":"所有計算都在此瀏覽器中本地運行；沒有上傳水測量數據。","Check the values: hardness must be 0–10,000 and final volume 0–100,000 litres.":"檢查值：硬度必須為 0–10,000，最終體積必須為 0–100,000 公升。","Unit conversion factors":"單位換算係數","mg/L as CaCO3":"mg/L（以 CaCO3 計）","meq/L":"毫克當量/公升","A compatible result is an estimate within 0.05 °dH; real test kits and water chemistry have measurement variation.":"相容的結果是 0.05 °dH 內的估計值；真實的測試套件和水化學具有測量差異。"}});
